05:23:06.767 --> 05:23:10.838
This is not an area which is easy to reach for emergency services.

05:23:10.871 --> 05:23:11.538
These two buildings,

05:23:12.039 --> 05:23:12.539
Hudson River,

05:23:12.573 --> 05:23:15.676
there's only the west side drive that comes up there.

05:23:15.809 --> 05:23:19.913
