As soon as I got out of the building,

05:23:21.982 --> 05:23:25.419
obviously, the first thing you're surrounded by is siren noise everywhere,

05:23:25.519 --> 05:23:28.021
and you can hear it coming by. Now, even still.

05:23:28.222 --> 05:23:29.790
Anything else you know that you'd like to add?

05:23:30.357 --> 05:23:31.792
Just as I was coming out of the building,

05:23:32.659 --> 05:23:34.661
I heard somebody sort of ushering people away,

05:23:34.795 --> 05:23:35.496
