05:24:14.034 --> 05:24:14.968
He's out at Dulles.

05:24:16.036 --> 05:24:16.303
Okay,

05:24:16.503 --> 05:24:16.737
and...

05:24:17.204 --> 05:24:17.504
Dulles,

05:24:17.704 --> 05:24:17.838
L.A.,

05:24:18.539 --> 05:24:21.341
And they both apparently have been hijacked.

05:24:21.442 --> 05:24:25.145
11 were pretty sure is in there and

05:24:25.512 --> 05:24:34.988
77 we were talking to them, according to Indianapolis Center about 45 minutes ago and in Indy Center.

05:24:35.756 --> 05:24:37.758
I don't know how we got to do it.

05:24:38.158 --> 05:24:39.126
Back to the trade Center.

05:24:39.126 --> 05:24:41.595
