05:24:41.862 --> 05:24:42.062
Okay,

05:24:42.162 --> 05:24:42.863
it may not have.

05:24:42.863 --> 05:24:43.964
We have another call sign.

05:24:43.964 --> 05:24:44.298
Of course,

05:24:44.298 --> 05:24:46.700
we don't know for sure any of these call signs right now,

05:24:46.767 --> 05:24:48.802
