05:24:54.475 --> 05:24:54.675
Yes.

05:24:55.576 --> 05:24:57.945
And you don't know who, either one of them are, for sure?

05:24:58.278 --> 05:24:58.412
Yeah,

05:24:58.545 --> 05:24:58.979
that's true.

05:24:59.613 --> 05:24:59.847
Okay.

05:25:00.347 --> 05:25:00.781
If I did,

05:25:00.848 --> 05:25:01.548
