05:29:16.536 --> 05:29:16.670
Well,

05:29:16.703 --> 05:29:18.271
we're letting everybody in here illegally.

05:29:18.505 --> 05:29:19.206
Could the plane have been,

05:29:19.206 --> 05:29:19.339
like,

05:29:19.372 --> 05:29:20.807
loaded with explosives or something,

05:29:20.807 --> 05:29:21.007
