Come on,

05:29:22.309 --> 05:29:23.744
what would you do if you wanted to bomb?

05:29:24.745 --> 05:29:51.938
Something you're just sticking up, just flying, you know, I don't know how true it is, but a couple, I think. While we were on vacation, I read in one of the newspapers that they are actually, you know, like, honoring the families of these s****** mission guys. They have over in the yellow. Does that? After they blow up an Israeli? US, you know, the family gets compensated, the family is treated like heroes.

05:29:54.174 --> 05:29:54.274
uh...

