05:30:39.619 --> 05:30:39.719
Yeah.

05:30:39.719 --> 05:30:39.820
Good.

05:30:39.820 --> 05:30:40.420
You want to go on top?

05:30:40.420 --> 05:30:42.656
You can go on top of mine.

05:30:42.656 --> 05:30:42.722
Yeah,

05:30:42.722 --> 05:30:42.923
it's cool.

05:30:42.923 --> 05:30:43.123
Go ahead.

05:30:43.123 --> 05:30:43.990
Come on.

05:31:00.140 --> 05:31:00.774
Just one second,

05:31:00.774 --> 05:31:05.278
