05:31:07.314 --> 05:31:08.515
No confirmation of that whatsoever?

05:31:08.548 --> 05:31:09.216
We have no confirmation of that.

05:31:09.216 --> 05:31:10.750
Is anybody even there discussing that?

05:31:11.518 --> 05:31:11.651
No,

05:31:11.785 --> 05:31:13.887
the only discussion that's been going on here,

05:31:13.954 --> 05:31:14.254
Brian,

05:31:14.321 --> 05:31:14.921
is that the...

05:31:15.055 --> 05:31:17.624
The World Trade Center has obvious symbolic value.

05:31:18.024 --> 05:31:19.826
It's been a target before of terrorism,

05:31:19.926 --> 05:31:24.364
and, frankly, it would not surprise the FBI or anyone in national security if it was a target again.

05:31:24.564 --> 05:31:27.100
Sometimes the obvious leads you to a conclusion.

05:31:27.400 --> 05:31:29.970
We're looking at two crashes 18 minutes apart.

05:31:30.403 --> 05:31:31.838
Into an obvious target,

05:31:32.105 --> 05:31:35.308
a building that has never been hit with a plane before on a clear day.

05:31:36.643 --> 05:31:38.778
What do the intelligence people there say about that?

05:31:39.279 --> 05:31:43.316
The intelligence community for some time has been warning in a steady drumbeat,

05:31:43.350 --> 05:31:43.617
Brian,

05:31:44.050 --> 05:31:46.353
that Osama bin Laden has not been heard from now,

05:31:46.419 --> 05:31:46.820
frankly,

05:31:46.887 --> 05:31:47.988
since the beginning of the year,

05:31:48.521 --> 05:31:49.856
the U.S.S. Cole incident,

05:31:49.923 --> 05:31:50.156
rather,

05:31:50.590 --> 05:31:53.593
And they've been wondering when and if he will strike again,

05:31:53.727 --> 05:31:55.495
and they only believed it was a matter of time,

05:31:55.495 --> 05:31:59.032
and I believe that today that is going to be their first suspicion.

05:31:59.132 --> 05:31:59.733
But we have no...

05:31:59.900 --> 05:32:00.734
Confirmation of that,

05:32:00.767 --> 05:32:01.701
I must underline.

05:32:01.701 --> 05:32:04.371
There's no confirmation that this is a terrorist attack,

05:32:04.471 --> 05:32:04.871
number one,

05:32:05.071 --> 05:32:05.672
or number two,

05:32:05.705 --> 05:32:07.507
that it's Osama bin Laden involvement.

05:32:07.707 --> 05:32:10.710
But I can tell you right now, that is what they are thinking.

05:32:10.810 --> 05:32:12.145
That is the working premise.

05:32:12.479 --> 05:32:15.315
And we'll just have to see, as the day unfolds, what they discover.

05:32:39.706 --> 05:32:39.839
Jim,

05:32:39.839 --> 05:32:42.042
as we sit here at 9-17,

05:32:42.075 --> 05:32:45.979
does the FBI have any choice but to sit and watch this on television?

05:32:47.948 --> 05:32:57.123
I have never heard such a gasp of astonishment as I heard speaking to the FBI headquarters this morning. When they saw what we saw,

05:32:57.824 --> 05:32:59.693
the explosion at the World Trade Center,

05:32:59.893 --> 05:33:02.262
the second explosion and the smoke coming out of it.

05:33:02.629 --> 05:33:05.432
It reminded me and them of Oklahoma City.

05:33:05.498 --> 05:33:06.733
There's pure astonishment,

05:33:06.766 --> 05:33:07.267
I can tell you,

05:33:07.267 --> 05:33:08.835
at FBI headquarters this morning,

05:33:09.369 --> 05:33:12.505
and they are trying to find out the facts, just as we are.

05:33:33.159 --> 05:33:35.895
Okay,

05:33:35.929 --> 05:33:38.031
we're going to get field comms set up.

05:33:38.064 --> 05:33:39.199
We'll be able to copy everything,

05:33:39.199 --> 05:33:39.366
okay?

05:33:39.366 --> 05:33:40.700
Right, 10-4,

05:33:40.734 --> 05:33:41.935
just advise me when you're ready.

05:34:08.428 --> 05:34:08.828
.in. The United States,

05:34:08.862 --> 05:34:09.429
John Cochran,

05:34:09.429 --> 05:34:10.730
who was the president in Florida.

05:34:10.797 --> 05:34:11.064
John?

05:34:11.798 --> 05:34:12.032
Peter,

05:34:12.032 --> 05:34:12.365
as you know,

05:34:12.365 --> 05:34:14.401
the president's down in Florida talking about education.

05:34:14.401 --> 05:34:16.436
He got up out of his hotel suite this morning,

05:34:16.436 --> 05:34:17.303
was about to leave.

