Reporters saw the White House chief of Staff,

05:34:19.472 --> 05:34:20.006
Andy Card,

05:34:20.073 --> 05:34:21.007
whisper into his ear.

05:34:21.041 --> 05:34:22.242
The reporter said to the president,

05:34:22.509 --> 05:34:23.376
Do you know what's going on?

05:34:23.376 --> 05:34:23.777
On in New York.

05:34:23.843 --> 05:34:26.713
He said he did and said he will have something to say about it later.

05:34:26.780 --> 05:34:30.383
His first event is about a half an hour at an elementary school in Sarasota,

05:34:30.383 --> 05:34:30.717
Florida.

05:34:31.284 --> 05:34:31.484
Thanks,

05:34:31.518 --> 05:34:31.751
John.

05:34:31.785 --> 05:34:32.952
John Cochran with the president.

05:34:32.986 --> 05:34:35.622
President's in Florida today pushing his education reform.

05:34:35.655 --> 05:34:42.362
It will get wiped off the agenda today in view of this extraordinarily serious accident.

