12:49:14.608 --> 12:49:16.810
We were sitting at our desks having a meeting,

12:49:16.910 --> 12:49:19.346
and there was a large shutter,

12:49:19.446 --> 12:49:20.714
where there was a shutter of the building,

12:49:20.781 --> 12:49:22.649
and the sound of a large thud.

12:49:24.051 --> 12:49:24.218
Right,

12:49:24.251 --> 12:49:26.787
