12:49:26.954 --> 12:49:28.155
and there was a large concussion,

12:49:28.522 --> 12:49:29.756
like an explosion would do,

12:49:29.756 --> 12:49:31.191
the air would be a concussion.

12:49:31.725 --> 12:49:32.860
We didn't know there was an explosion.

12:49:32.926 --> 12:49:33.393
We just,

12:49:33.393 --> 12:49:33.861
it was clear,

12:49:33.994 --> 12:49:37.197
we looked at each other and knew that something catastrophic had happened,

12:49:37.297 --> 12:49:38.432
but we had no idea what it was.

12:49:39.099 --> 12:49:43.337
People began evacuating immediately and went outside.

12:49:43.337 --> 12:49:45.506
It wasn't until we were outside we realized what had happened.

