13:41:40.884 --> 13:41:42.186
Just before 10 o'clock,

13:41:42.820 --> 13:41:44.588
parts of the building began peeling away.

13:41:44.655 --> 13:41:45.689
People started screaming.

13:41:46.290 --> 13:41:46.991
Jennifer tells me,

13:41:46.991 --> 13:41:48.525
because she was a little closer to the building,

13:41:49.226 --> 13:41:50.694
that the police began yelling,

13:41:50.728 --> 13:41:50.894
run,

13:41:50.995 --> 13:41:51.195
run,

13:41:51.962 --> 13:41:56.033
And thousands of people started running away from the buildings as they were falling.

13:41:56.834 --> 13:41:57.134
That was,

13:41:57.134 --> 13:41:57.501
of course,

13:41:57.534 --> 13:42:03.607
followed by an onrush of ambulances and special police vehicles.

13:42:04.174 --> 13:42:05.142
Some people have told us,

13:42:05.142 --> 13:42:06.377
although I can't confirm this,

13:42:07.044 --> 13:42:09.346
that dozens of stories of the building have fallen away,

13:42:09.446 --> 13:42:11.148
maybe down as low as the 30th floor.

13:42:24.428 --> 13:42:24.795
Michael,

13:42:24.928 --> 13:42:25.195
Michael,

13:42:25.195 --> 13:42:25.729
if you can hear me,

13:42:25.729 --> 13:42:28.499
we just heard another explosion down at the Pentagon building.

13:42:28.499 --> 13:42:33.037
We just heard another loud explosion down at the Pentagon building just seconds ago.

13:42:33.437 --> 13:42:34.571
That's our Audrey Barnes,

13:42:34.571 --> 13:42:36.240
who is standing nearby the Pentagon,

13:42:36.307 --> 13:42:37.741
saying they heard a second explosion.

13:42:37.808 --> 13:42:37.975
Audrey,

13:42:38.008 --> 13:42:40.210
did you see anything since these other attacks have been aerial?

13:42:40.444 --> 13:42:43.814
Did you see anything flying overhead just before this explosion?

13:42:44.281 --> 13:42:47.351
We can't see exactly where the source of the explosion was,

13:42:47.351 --> 13:42:50.354
but you could hear it very clearly with a loud boom.

13:42:50.921 --> 13:42:51.188
And

13:42:51.889 --> 13:42:53.190
I'm looking for another plume of smoke.

13:42:53.223 --> 13:42:54.258
I don't see anything right now.

13:42:54.258 --> 13:42:58.329
It might be still in that same general area where the fire is burning right now.

13:42:58.395 --> 13:43:00.731
But you could clearly hear another loud explosion.

13:43:00.798 --> 13:43:02.399
I was sitting next to it, right beside it.

13:43:02.700 --> 13:43:03.300
Tell me what you saw.

13:43:04.268 --> 13:43:04.435
Well,

13:43:05.002 --> 13:43:06.704
I was at my desk and I saw the building.

13:43:07.137 --> 13:43:08.172
I felt the building rumble.

13:43:08.839 --> 13:43:09.139
After that,

13:43:09.139 --> 13:43:09.740
I looked outside.

13:43:09.773 --> 13:43:10.774
I saw papers everywhere.

13:43:11.308 --> 13:43:12.109
Then I looked.

13:43:12.242 --> 13:43:13.577
I saw a big hole in the water.

13:43:13.711 --> 13:43:13.844
center,

13:43:13.844 --> 13:43:15.479
then we all evacuated our building.

13:43:15.813 --> 13:43:16.880
And when I went outside,

13:43:17.448 --> 13:43:35.065
Unbelievable.

13:43:35.299 --> 13:43:41.605
It's the markings of a leased.

13:43:44.541 --> 13:43:44.708
Well,

13:43:45.909 --> 13:43:47.978
often in the Middle East, when there's a bombing,

13:43:47.978 --> 13:43:49.913
a s****** bombing or a car bombing,

13:43:50.814 --> 13:43:57.154
you'll find a second bomb going off when the emergency response crews respond.

13:43:57.254 --> 13:43:57.688
Right.

13:43:57.688 --> 13:43:58.455
Which just happened.

13:43:58.856 --> 13:43:59.256
They are so sweet,

13:43:59.289 --> 13:43:59.523
those people.

13:44:01.692 --> 13:44:03.894
This is our worst case scenario.

13:44:04.561 --> 13:44:05.095
This is something.

13:44:05.095 --> 13:44:06.697
A fourth plane has just crashed into...

13:44:07.064 --> 13:44:09.066
I'm not sure where.

13:44:12.035 --> 13:44:12.936
This is something that has...

13:44:12.936 --> 13:44:13.404
Let me see,

13:44:13.470 --> 13:44:14.838
someone's on the phone saying that

13:44:15.706 --> 13:44:20.043
Palestine and that Bensama bin Laden guy is claiming responsibility,

13:44:20.110 --> 13:44:20.544
whatever his name is.

13:44:20.544 --> 13:44:20.577
Oh,

13:44:20.611 --> 13:44:22.713
the second plane was in Jersey,

13:44:22.746 --> 13:44:23.547
huh?

13:44:23.547 --> 13:44:24.948
Both from an investigative standpoint.

13:44:24.948 --> 13:44:25.149
Hold on,

13:44:25.149 --> 13:44:25.849
I'll get to that guy.

13:44:25.849 --> 13:44:27.050
From a response standpoint,

13:44:28.185 --> 13:44:29.520
is going to be...

13:44:29.520 --> 13:44:31.255
Another explosion hits Lower Manhattan.

13:44:31.355 --> 13:44:32.322
Oh my God.

13:44:32.556 --> 13:44:33.924
Clearly, you can only do so much...

13:44:34.224 --> 13:44:34.558
Hold on,

13:44:34.558 --> 13:44:37.261
let me see what this guy's saying.

13:45:09.193 --> 13:45:10.828
The nature of the event is shocking.

13:45:11.195 --> 13:45:12.396
The fact that it's happened is not.

13:45:12.696 --> 13:45:13.397
Thank you very much,

13:45:13.464 --> 13:45:13.697
Carl.

13:45:13.730 --> 13:45:14.531
Really appreciate it.

13:45:14.565 --> 13:45:15.065
Carl Olson.

13:45:16.934 --> 13:45:17.468
One quick thing.

13:45:18.135 --> 13:45:20.304
The suggestions that are floating around out there right now,

13:45:20.337 --> 13:45:24.041
there's apparently this claim from the Democratic Front for the Liberation of Palestine.

13:45:24.141 --> 13:45:25.576
Right.

13:45:25.576 --> 13:45:27.411
Very interesting to note,

13:45:27.711 --> 13:45:28.645
if this is legitimate,

13:45:29.146 --> 13:45:30.214
if this claim stands up,

13:45:30.481 --> 13:45:33.417
this appears to be the first time this group has targeted Americans.

13:45:33.917 --> 13:45:38.422
This group has primarily steered away from the more extreme end of the violence scale.

13:45:38.422 --> 13:45:39.022
They focus on the violence.

13:45:39.156 --> 13:45:40.557
Less on s****** bombings,

13:45:40.891 --> 13:45:45.996
more on gun attacks and that sort of thing in the territories against Israelis.

13:45:45.996 --> 13:45:47.731
If this holds up,

13:45:47.865 --> 13:45:48.999
this is a very different tactic.

13:45:49.132 --> 13:45:49.299
Well,

13:45:49.566 --> 13:45:50.167
if it is true,

13:45:50.167 --> 13:45:50.534
of course,

13:45:50.534 --> 13:45:54.238
The Democratic Front for Liberation of Palestine was very much involved in attacking aircraft in the

13:45:54.938 --> 13:45:55.072
1970s.

13:46:00.777 --> 13:46:03.280
We're actually being asked to move back by Virginia State police a little bit.

13:46:03.280 --> 13:46:05.516
We're going to try to keep this location as much as possible.

13:46:05.516 --> 13:46:06.917
The reason they asked us to move back is because,

13:46:07.184 --> 13:46:07.518
of course,

13:46:07.518 --> 13:46:09.686
they're concerned about any secondary explosions.

13:46:09.720 --> 13:46:11.455
I can tell you from my experience as a firefighter,

13:46:11.488 --> 13:46:15.592
there's still a great deal of fire inside the Pentagon by the smoke that's coming out of there.

13:46:15.692 --> 13:46:21.865
I'm sure firefighters are inside, making sure first that they can get everybody out that they can, and then trying to attack the fire inside.

13:46:22.099 --> 13:46:22.933
They've also had fire,

13:46:22.966 --> 13:46:23.333
of course,

13:46:23.333 --> 13:46:27.104
on the outside, that probably involved some sort of airplane fuel.

13:46:27.404 --> 13:46:28.972
That's why it burned so well.

13:46:29.239 --> 13:46:29.907
It's still burning,

13:46:29.907 --> 13:46:30.240
in fact,

13:46:30.407 --> 13:46:30.674
on the side.

13:46:30.707 --> 13:46:33.143
South end, on the outside, near those construction trailers.

13:46:33.810 --> 13:46:34.044
Again,

13:46:34.077 --> 13:46:38.715
I can't tell you much more other than a loud pop. Just a few minutes ago. That seemed a little bit different,

13:46:38.982 --> 13:46:45.255
a little bit different than the ones we heard earlier, which were on the outside here. That could have been tires or something else.

13:46:45.522 --> 13:46:48.292
We're just watching also as they're taking another man to the hospital.

13:46:48.358 --> 13:46:49.560
Looks like it's going to be a medevac.

13:46:50.327 --> 13:46:51.161
And what I can tell,

13:46:51.161 --> 13:46:52.162
it looks like he's burned.

13:46:52.262 --> 13:46:54.197
There seems to be a burn sheet on top of him.

13:46:54.698 --> 13:46:55.832
Medics are taking him to the U.S.

13:46:55.899 --> 13:46:56.433
Park Police

13:46:56.767 --> 13:46:57.634
Eagle helicopter.

13:46:57.668 --> 13:46:59.102
This is a vehicle,

13:46:59.102 --> 13:47:00.237
and we have seen ambulance issues.

13:47:06.643 --> 13:47:11.715
As you see the scope of this and the mythology of this,

13:47:11.815 --> 13:47:15.018
radical way in which it appears to have been planned and happened.

13:47:15.018 --> 13:47:15.419
And again,

13:47:15.485 --> 13:47:18.055
we don't know what truly occurred,

13:47:18.088 --> 13:47:22.492
but there's talk of aircraft being hijacked,

13:47:23.026 --> 13:47:25.028
of second explosions,

13:47:25.128 --> 13:47:26.063
of et cetera,

13:47:26.096 --> 13:47:26.496
et cetera.

13:47:27.030 --> 13:47:29.533
What if there are signals...

13:47:58.528 --> 13:47:58.929
And again,

13:47:59.062 --> 13:48:01.632
just because we lost a little bit at the beginning,

13:48:01.732 --> 13:48:03.033
where are you physically now?

13:48:03.133 --> 13:48:06.870
I'm just south of the Holland Tunnel in downtown Manhattan,

13:48:06.937 --> 13:48:07.404
perhaps

13:48:08.038 --> 13:48:10.140
10 to 15 blocks north of the World Trade Center.

13:48:10.140 --> 13:48:10.474
Got it.

13:48:10.707 --> 13:48:13.143
And the pictures that our viewers are looking at,

13:48:13.477 --> 13:48:19.650
this was that collapse of the South Tower just a few minutes ago here in New York.

13:48:26.089 --> 13:48:26.923
The President of the United States,

13:48:26.923 --> 13:48:27.457
President Trump,

13:48:27.491 --> 13:48:33.997
and President Obama have been in the same position for more than a decade.

13:48:34.765 --> 13:48:39.202
The President of the United

13:48:40.637 --> 13:48:42.506
States, President Trump,

13:48:42.539 --> 13:48:47.611
and President Obama have been in the same position for more than a decade.

13:48:47.611 --> 13:48:49.846
The President of the United States,

13:48:49.846 --> 13:48:50.947
President Trump,

13:48:50.947 --> 13:48:53.583
and President Obama

13:49:09.866 --> 13:49:10.333
take all that.

13:49:10.333 --> 13:49:11.868
I'm the last one.

13:49:11.935 --> 13:49:13.770
There's nobody up on 23?

13:49:13.870 --> 13:49:13.970
No.

13:49:14.237 --> 13:49:15.706
They evacuated everybody down.

13:49:15.772 --> 13:49:16.306
Alright,

13:49:16.306 --> 13:49:17.307
they're probably going to the bus.

13:49:17.407 --> 13:49:17.674
Thanks.

13:49:17.708 --> 13:49:17.874
Yeah.

13:49:29.820 --> 13:49:31.021
I think we'll try to get a shot of that.

13:49:31.021 --> 13:49:32.956
We're going to show you over here on Washington Boulevard.

13:49:33.223 --> 13:49:35.559
The Eagle helicopter from Park Police is landing,

13:49:35.859 --> 13:49:38.228
taking this man to the hospital.

13:49:38.295 --> 13:49:39.329
From my vantage point,

13:49:39.362 --> 13:49:40.530
it looks like he has burns.

13:49:40.931 --> 13:49:41.298
We also,

13:49:41.364 --> 13:49:43.033
besides Arlington Fire and Rescue,

13:49:43.133 --> 13:49:43.900
see some doctors,

13:49:43.900 --> 13:49:44.334
what appear to be...

13:49:44.334 --> 13:50:06.323
Be doctors on the scene, not sure if they're military or not, they seem to be helping with the injured. This dust is just starting to settle. After the Second World Trade Center collapsed, we saw it collapsed and come towards us. I'm

13:50:06.356 --> 13:50:12.662
doing, uh, well, as good as can be expected. I've got guys that will be launching in about 15 minutes. Appreciate it. Are they loaded?

13:50:12.763 --> 13:50:13.630
We've got hot guns.

13:50:13.630 --> 13:50:14.331
That's all I've got.

13:50:14.498 --> 13:50:14.664
Well,

13:50:14.664 --> 13:50:16.767
that's good enough for me for the time being.

13:50:16.967 --> 13:50:17.634
Only words I've got,

13:50:17.667 --> 13:50:20.771
I've got another possible aircraft with a bomb on board.

13:50:21.438 --> 13:50:22.272
It's in

13:50:22.873 --> 13:50:24.474
Pennsylvania, York,

13:50:25.509 --> 13:50:26.209
approximately area.

13:50:26.543 --> 13:50:26.643
Yeah,

13:50:26.676 --> 13:50:27.210
that's south.

13:50:27.577 --> 13:50:27.677
Yeah,

13:50:27.778 --> 13:50:28.345
south of us.

13:50:29.012 --> 13:50:34.785
And there's also the possibility of another one that's possibly at Cleveland area.

13:50:35.051 --> 13:50:35.218
Okay.

13:50:35.719 --> 13:50:36.586
Do we have vectors on those?

13:50:36.887 --> 13:50:37.387
Not yet.

13:50:37.454 --> 13:50:40.157
It's like one over Cleveland turned around.

13:50:40.190 --> 13:50:41.191
Looks like he's heading back.

13:50:41.224 --> 13:50:42.425
The guy down at York,

13:50:42.626 --> 13:50:43.226
Pennsylvania,

13:50:43.894 --> 13:50:44.861
he's heading north,

13:50:45.262 --> 13:50:45.929
northwest.

13:50:46.129 --> 13:50:46.296
Okay.

13:50:46.296 --> 13:50:47.264
We might be able to get those,

13:50:47.297 --> 13:50:47.430
too.

13:50:47.864 --> 13:50:48.031
Yeah.

13:50:48.331 --> 13:50:53.336
And the call sign for the guy in York is United. 93,

13:50:53.336 --> 13:50:54.337
Mode 3 of

13:50:54.838 --> 13:50:56.139
1527. Okay.

13:50:56.139 --> 13:50:56.773
It doesn't help us.

13:50:56.773 --> 13:50:58.208
We can't interrogate.

13:50:58.241 --> 13:50:58.542
Okay.

13:50:58.642 --> 13:51:00.377
And I got this other guy out west.

13:51:00.544 --> 13:51:01.311
He's American.

13:51:01.578 --> 13:51:02.045
Where's that guy?

13:51:02.045 --> 13:51:03.213
The track is fading over Cleveland.

13:51:03.647 --> 13:51:03.847
Okay,

13:51:03.947 --> 13:51:05.982
I got one who dissipated over. Cleveland,

13:51:06.783 --> 13:51:07.117
Delta

13:51:08.018 --> 13:51:08.151
8-9er,

13:51:08.852 --> 13:51:10.153
Mode 3.

13:51:10.153 --> 13:51:10.987
I know it's not going to help you,

13:51:10.987 --> 13:51:11.988
but if you're talking to FAA,

13:51:12.088 --> 13:51:12.889
they might be able to help you.

13:51:12.889 --> 13:51:14.090
13-04.

13:51:14.357 --> 13:51:14.491
Okay,

13:51:14.524 --> 13:51:15.592
when we get our guys airborne,

13:51:15.592 --> 13:51:17.894
they're going to contact you on 260.9.

13:51:18.128 --> 13:51:19.196
I've got two jets right now.

13:51:19.196 --> 13:51:20.096
Do you need more than two?

13:51:20.197 --> 13:51:21.164
Can you bring up two more?

13:51:21.264 --> 13:51:21.898
Get four to them.

13:51:21.998 --> 13:51:22.132
Yep,

13:51:22.632 --> 13:51:22.799
yep.

13:51:23.099 --> 13:51:23.333
Okay,

13:51:23.466 --> 13:51:23.700
thank you,

13:51:23.700 --> 13:51:23.867
sir.

13:51:24.034 --> 13:51:26.236
And if you want to talk to Colonel Marr,

13:51:26.236 --> 13:51:26.736
he's up at

13:51:27.204 --> 13:51:28.371
6403, sir.

13:51:28.638 --> 13:51:28.905
Thank you.

13:51:30.440 --> 13:51:34.010
So you're a journalist as well?

13:51:34.044 --> 13:51:39.883
I make videos and my sister called me right when it happened, and

13:51:41.818 --> 13:51:43.153
I just knew I had to go.

13:51:43.520 --> 13:51:46.823
I actually got on tape of the crashing down of the building.

13:51:57.267 --> 13:51:58.101
Right at the Pentagon.

13:51:59.469 --> 13:51:59.669
Audrey,

13:51:59.703 --> 13:52:00.604
from where we're standing,

13:52:00.670 --> 13:52:01.605
from where we're watching,

13:52:01.671 --> 13:52:01.905
rather,

13:52:01.938 --> 13:52:05.876
it appears now we can start to see the shell of something there.

13:52:06.543 --> 13:52:09.012
Can you have any better vantage point on what may have,

13:52:09.246 --> 13:52:09.880
on the type of,

13:52:09.946 --> 13:52:10.714
on an aircraft,

13:52:10.814 --> 13:52:11.615
see any wreckage at all?

13:52:11.615 --> 13:52:11.915
All now.

13:52:12.182 --> 13:52:14.584
It seems like the smoke is dissipating to a certain extent.

13:52:15.619 --> 13:52:16.987
From what witnesses have said,

13:52:17.020 --> 13:52:20.323
they saw the tail of some type of aircraft go into the Pentagon building.

13:52:20.390 --> 13:52:22.759
I'm still trying to confirm that from somebody who's on the scene,

13:52:22.993 --> 13:52:29.232
but there's a couple of people who are coming from the Pentagon building. That I'd like to see if I can get some information about that.

13:52:54.057 --> 13:52:57.327
Can we do that with Johnstown through tower when he goes over to tower?

13:52:57.827 --> 13:52:58.061
Okay,

13:52:58.795 --> 13:52:58.929
yeah,

13:52:58.929 --> 13:52:59.329
go ahead.

13:52:59.462 --> 13:53:00.497
This is imperial go for

13:53:00.897 --> 13:53:02.599
06. If I can,

13:53:02.732 --> 13:53:05.635
I'm going to take him down towards that report of smoke area.

13:53:05.635 --> 13:53:06.636
I just got it, Bill,

13:53:06.736 --> 13:53:07.203
I have it.

13:53:07.337 --> 13:53:07.804
I have the.

13:53:08.204 --> 13:53:09.739
I see a guy right over it right now.

13:53:10.106 --> 13:53:11.041
You can do what you want,

13:53:11.041 --> 13:53:13.443
but I have a guy down there at 5,000 feet over through it.

13:53:13.476 --> 13:53:15.145
We got the lat-longs and everything.

13:53:15.612 --> 13:53:16.179
And a report.

13:53:16.212 --> 13:53:16.913
That was the United.

13:53:16.913 --> 13:53:19.416
He sees smoke and he doesn't see flames.

13:53:19.416 --> 13:53:20.517
He sees smoke and,

13:53:22.619 --> 13:53:22.752
yeah.

13:53:22.752 --> 13:53:22.886
Okay,

13:53:22.886 --> 13:53:23.153
I got it.

13:53:23.153 --> 13:53:23.753
That's a positive idea.

13:53:23.820 --> 13:53:24.487
All right.

13:53:24.587 --> 13:53:26.189
All right.

13:53:26.222 --> 13:53:26.456
Bye.

13:53:28.658 --> 13:53:28.892
Okay,

13:53:28.992 --> 13:53:29.159
sir,

13:53:29.192 --> 13:53:31.861
can you see any kind of wreckage or anything out there?

13:53:32.963 --> 13:53:34.464
As we get around this side of it,

13:53:34.798 --> 13:53:36.366
the smoke is blowing away from us.

13:53:36.399 --> 13:53:37.600
We do see flames.

13:53:38.702 --> 13:53:39.302
It's on the edge,

13:53:39.369 --> 13:53:39.769
like I say,

13:53:39.803 --> 13:53:40.971
of a wooded area.

13:53:43.006 --> 13:53:47.077
And a very, fairly clean field.

13:53:47.911 --> 13:53:50.013
But I don't see wreckage.

13:53:50.046 --> 13:53:52.182
I do see flames now and dark smoke.

13:53:52.882 --> 13:53:53.116
Okay,

13:53:53.183 --> 13:53:54.117
2-0, Victor, Fox,

13:53:54.617 --> 13:53:54.951
Roger.

13:53:57.187 --> 13:53:57.320
Roy,

13:53:57.320 --> 13:54:00.957
I'm going to keep you there for just one more second in case we need a little more information,

13:54:00.991 --> 13:54:01.825
if that's alright with you,

13:54:01.891 --> 13:54:02.125
sir.

