14:06:32.475 --> 14:06:32.742
Dr.

14:06:32.808 --> 14:06:33.142
Kushner,

14:06:33.175 --> 14:06:34.643
I don't know if you're watching television,

14:06:34.677 --> 14:06:35.778
but we are now showing...

14:06:36.278 --> 14:06:41.684
Our very first pictures of some of the victims of this today,

14:06:41.751 --> 14:06:43.219
and we can see some horrific,

14:06:43.285 --> 14:06:44.620
what appears to be burns,

14:06:46.989 --> 14:06:48.124
some serious injuries.

14:06:48.557 --> 14:06:48.758
Again,

14:06:48.791 --> 14:06:51.293
this is video that we have just gotten in.

14:06:51.293 --> 14:06:51.427
Yes.

14:06:52.161 --> 14:06:52.795
I'm watching it.

14:06:52.795 --> 14:06:53.195
I can see it.

14:07:23.159 --> 14:07:27.396
Two planes going straight into the World Trade Center and you can see the picture there.

14:07:27.496 --> 14:07:28.964
Smoke still billowing.

14:07:28.998 --> 14:07:31.200
The fire is completely out of control.

14:07:31.667 --> 14:07:34.970
It's making the job of the rescue services extremely difficult.

14:07:35.404 --> 14:07:38.808
We've seen a few helicopters trying to get to the scene,

14:07:38.908 --> 14:07:42.344
but visibility must be extremely difficult for them.

14:08:00.129 --> 14:08:15.211
I have your attention, please.

14:08:15.578 --> 14:08:19.215
I have

14:08:32.728 --> 14:08:34.563
Four.

14:08:34.730 --> 14:08:35.064
Three.

14:08:57.219 --> 14:08:58.621
That area was completely evacuated.

14:08:59.788 --> 14:08:59.989
You know,

14:08:59.989 --> 14:09:01.223
if I might just interject this,

14:09:01.724 --> 14:09:07.563
I was involved in a civil litigation against the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey because

14:09:08.397 --> 14:09:12.067
I was representing with a team of attorneys who represented two clubs.

14:09:12.167 --> 14:09:13.836
Clients were at the B2 level.

14:09:14.637 --> 14:09:21.710
And the Trade Towers was warned many years in advance that there's a possibility of having a bomb placed in the bottom of the building.

14:09:22.177 --> 14:09:27.683
And my report showed that the construction of that building was in such,

14:09:28.117 --> 14:09:29.051
beyond the code,

14:09:29.418 --> 14:09:32.121
that even such a powerful bomb couldn't do the damage.

14:09:32.388 --> 14:09:34.456
But now, looking at these pictures as we speak,

14:09:34.957 --> 14:09:35.724
it just,

14:09:36.325 --> 14:09:37.726
I'm choked up looking at it,

14:09:38.360 --> 14:09:40.896
thinking that this type of risk assessment.

14:09:41.730 --> 14:10:10.793
Wasn't there and we didn't have. But how do you guard against something like this? So, um, while officials may not have confirmed it, it seems fairly clear, plus, the tower would not have collapsed absent some tremendous trauma. Absolutely, and that that seems to to make sense. And that was my next question. Second explosion at Pentagon building reported, according to Dow Jones. That is literally just crossing, a second explosion, a second explosion. Could we get up? the Pentagon shot reported at the Pentagon

14:10:47.629 --> 14:10:49.331
.of. A plane crashing at the Pentagon,

14:10:49.365 --> 14:10:50.833
the Pentagon being evacuated,

14:10:51.400 --> 14:10:52.868
fire on the mall in Washington,

14:10:52.901 --> 14:10:54.470
the State Department evacuated,

14:10:55.170 --> 14:10:56.105
and we...

14:10:56.138 --> 14:11:02.378
We have all flights shut down across the country as officials sort out what's happening here.

14:11:03.178 --> 14:11:03.379
Randy,

14:11:03.445 --> 14:11:04.279
back to you for a second.

14:11:04.580 --> 14:11:05.147
How much of the,

14:11:05.347 --> 14:11:05.514
well,

14:11:05.981 --> 14:11:07.149
if I recall this correctly,

14:11:07.182 --> 14:11:07.649
there is a,

14:11:08.617 --> 14:11:10.519
what was called a bunker,

14:11:10.552 --> 14:11:13.789
the mayor's bunker for these sorts of events in the trade Center,

14:11:13.856 --> 14:11:14.523
correct?

14:11:14.523 --> 14:11:15.991
There is an emergency management center.

14:11:15.991 --> 14:11:17.626
The scene is covered with extra equipment right here.

14:11:27.336 --> 14:11:27.903
My question is,

14:11:27.903 --> 14:11:28.904
was the first building,

14:11:29.605 --> 14:11:30.372
the one that's still up,

14:11:30.472 --> 14:11:33.308
the second one was where the big plane went into the collapse,

14:11:33.409 --> 14:11:33.542
right?

14:11:33.709 --> 14:11:33.842
Yep.

14:11:34.176 --> 14:11:35.811
And they're saying a possible third plane.

14:11:36.211 --> 14:11:38.947
I also want to give you a heads up,

14:11:39.014 --> 14:11:39.581
Washington.

14:11:39.581 --> 14:11:40.949
Go ahead.

14:11:40.983 --> 14:11:41.984
United 9-3,

14:11:41.984 --> 14:11:43.218
have you got information on that yet?

14:11:43.318 --> 14:11:43.452
Yeah,

14:11:43.485 --> 14:11:43.919
he's down.

14:11:44.620 --> 14:11:45.087
He's down?

14:11:45.387 --> 14:11:45.587
Yes.

14:11:46.088 --> 14:11:46.855
When did he land?

14:11:47.122 --> 14:11:49.058
He did not land.

14:11:49.725 --> 14:11:49.858
Oh,

14:11:49.858 --> 14:11:50.359
he's down?

14:11:50.592 --> 14:11:50.959
Yeah,

14:11:50.959 --> 14:11:52.728
somewhere up northeast of Camp, David.

14:11:54.797 --> 14:11:55.030
Northeast of St.

14:11:55.030 --> 14:11:55.164
David.

14:11:55.197 --> 14:11:56.298
That's the last report.

14:11:56.331 --> 14:11:57.366
They don't know exactly where.

14:11:58.634 --> 14:12:04.073
You can see now the thick pool of smoke that's enveloping the scene.

14:12:04.473 --> 14:12:05.541
One of the other problems there,

14:12:05.541 --> 14:12:05.908
of course,

14:12:06.008 --> 14:12:09.311
is that these fumes will be extremely toxic.

14:12:09.812 --> 14:12:16.185
That'll mean that only people with proper breathing apparatus will be able to get anywhere near the rescue work.

14:12:17.119 --> 14:12:20.222
I think that's probably going to be restricting work as well.

14:12:20.589 --> 14:12:32.167
There's nothing you can do now.

14:12:32.267 --> 14:12:33.435
Let's go to Frank Herzog,

14:12:33.469 --> 14:12:36.238
who is near one of the most visible monuments in the city,

14:12:36.271 --> 14:12:37.239
the Washington Monument.

14:12:37.272 --> 14:12:37.506
Frank,

14:12:37.539 --> 14:12:38.073
what do you see?

14:12:38.073 --> 14:12:38.574
What do you hear?

14:12:39.007 --> 14:12:41.110
I'm on the west grounds of the Washington Monument.

14:12:41.143 --> 14:12:43.745
The area has been completely evacuated by park police,

14:12:43.745 --> 14:12:47.282
and I think I could answer Dave Statter's question about that secondary explosion.

14:12:47.282 --> 14:12:48.550
It wasn't an explosion.

14:12:48.584 --> 14:12:50.285
That was the sonic boom of jet fire.

14:12:50.319 --> 14:12:52.721
Fighters that were scrambled out of Andrews Air Force Base,

14:12:52.988 --> 14:12:53.622
we believe.

14:12:54.022 --> 14:12:55.924
They just circled the Washington area,

14:12:56.325 --> 14:12:58.327
flying from the east out to the west,

14:12:58.627 --> 14:13:01.697
and they were in a hurry and they were high up in the air.

14:13:21.016 --> 14:13:21.350
Maria

14:13:21.416 --> 14:13:21.884
Bartiromo,

14:13:22.050 --> 14:13:22.751
What can you tell us?

14:13:23.252 --> 14:13:23.886
Thanks, Mark.

14:13:23.919 --> 14:13:26.522
You know, now I'm standing on the floor of the exchange,

14:13:26.555 --> 14:13:30.626
but I just came back from outside and I am covered with soot.

14:13:30.959 --> 14:13:31.360
Basically,

14:13:31.393 --> 14:13:34.396
I was outside when that third explosion occurred,

14:13:34.830 --> 14:13:36.999
and everyone ran for their lives,

14:13:37.065 --> 14:13:37.533
basically.

14:13:37.733 --> 14:13:39.168
I went under a building.

14:13:39.201 --> 14:13:42.538
There was a little stairwell that I could go under with about 20 people,

14:13:42.538 --> 14:13:43.472
and we just stayed there.

14:13:43.739 --> 14:13:48.410
The whole area turned pitch black when that third explosion happened.

14:13:48.677 --> 14:13:49.378
At this point,

14:13:49.444 --> 14:13:51.413
people are in the New York Stock Exchange.

14:13:51.613 --> 14:13:55.817
People feel that this is the safest place to be right now, because when everyone was outside,

14:13:56.018 --> 14:13:56.251
there was...

14:13:56.618 --> 14:13:57.186
explosion.

14:13:57.219 --> 14:13:58.654
There were three explosions.

14:13:58.687 --> 14:14:01.323
So now the exchange is keeping everyone inside.

14:14:01.390 --> 14:14:03.125
I'm on the floor with about,

14:14:03.192 --> 14:14:03.625
I don't know,

14:14:03.759 --> 14:14:04.159
100,

14:14:04.159 --> 14:14:05.260
200 people right here,

14:14:05.260 --> 14:14:06.195
and we're just waiting.

14:14:07.062 --> 14:14:08.063
That's all I can tell you.

14:14:08.063 --> 14:14:09.498
It's pitch black outside.

14:14:09.531 --> 14:14:11.700
There's soot falling from the sky.

14:14:12.434 --> 14:14:15.370
I don't know if you could see my jacket and my shoes,

14:14:15.470 --> 14:14:18.740
but I'm completely covered in white smoke. From the explosion,

14:14:18.807 --> 14:14:19.942
from that third explosion.

14:14:19.942 --> 14:14:20.142
Maria,

14:14:20.142 --> 14:14:21.510
do you know what that explosion was?

14:14:21.777 --> 14:14:22.411
That was about,

14:14:23.011 --> 14:14:23.312
I'd say,

14:14:23.378 --> 14:14:24.279
15 minutes ago.

14:14:24.646 --> 14:14:25.781
But do you know what caused it?

14:14:33.121 --> 14:14:33.222
No,

14:14:33.222 --> 14:14:33.422
I don't.

14:14:33.422 --> 14:14:34.223
So jet fighters,

14:14:34.289 --> 14:14:35.090
at least one,

14:14:35.157 --> 14:14:35.924
possibly two,

14:14:36.024 --> 14:14:36.758
were scrambled,

14:14:37.125 --> 14:14:38.927
probably as a precautionary measure.

14:14:39.628 --> 14:14:40.395
Needless to say,

14:14:40.596 --> 14:14:41.563
downtown Washington,

14:14:41.630 --> 14:14:41.863
D.C.,

14:14:42.064 --> 14:14:43.599
Except for the vehicular traffic,

14:14:43.632 --> 14:14:44.700
which is bumper to bumper,

14:14:45.000 --> 14:14:46.935
the rest of the city has been shut down.

14:14:47.202 --> 14:14:48.737
It looks like a Sunday morning here.

14:14:48.770 --> 14:14:50.405
The mall is absolutely empty.

14:14:50.806 --> 14:14:52.674
Park police came through about ten minutes ago,

14:14:52.908 --> 14:14:54.343
evacuated the entire area.

14:14:54.710 --> 14:14:56.912
And told tourists to go somewhere else.

14:14:57.412 --> 14:15:00.415
But I can tell you right now that at least one,

14:15:00.449 --> 14:15:01.116
if not two,

14:15:01.250 --> 14:15:02.951
jet fighters have been scrambled.

14:15:03.218 --> 14:15:05.254
They are patrolling the skies over Washington.

14:15:05.887 --> 14:15:06.488
Frank Herzog,

14:15:06.555 --> 14:15:07.322
Thank you very much.

14:15:13.629 --> 14:15:13.762
No,

14:15:13.862 --> 14:15:14.630
that wasn't a third.

14:15:15.797 --> 14:15:17.266
It looked like the World Trade Center was almost...

14:15:17.666 --> 14:15:18.500
Tipping at one point.

14:15:18.867 --> 14:15:19.001
Yeah,

14:15:19.001 --> 14:15:19.201
it did.

14:15:19.201 --> 14:15:19.901
I think it was probably like that.

14:15:19.901 --> 14:15:21.336
The World Trade Center just doesn't exist anymore.

14:15:21.403 --> 14:15:21.536
No,

14:15:21.570 --> 14:15:24.172
I think the one that's still up looks like it's almost buckling.

14:15:24.206 --> 14:15:25.507
I think that's the one that got hit originally.

14:15:25.507 --> 14:15:25.674
Charlie!

14:15:56.104 --> 14:15:57.606
Let me just read you the lead,

14:15:57.739 --> 14:15:59.141
the Associated Press lead,

14:15:59.341 --> 14:16:00.475
just came out of New York.

14:16:01.076 --> 14:16:01.510
First of all,

14:16:01.543 --> 14:16:03.545
let's check in with Dave Stattert at The Pentagon.

14:16:03.612 --> 14:16:03.879
Dave.

14:16:04.713 --> 14:16:04.846
Oh,

14:16:04.846 --> 14:16:05.814
it collapsed right now,

14:16:05.847 --> 14:16:06.415
as you can see.

14:16:06.615 --> 14:16:07.883
I assume you're taking our picture.

14:16:07.883 --> 14:16:08.684
I do not have a monitor,

14:16:08.717 --> 14:16:14.956
But right now. We just had a middle section here of the e-ring of the Pentagon. Collapse from the amount of fire and destruction from this.

14:16:15.324 --> 14:16:18.293
So obviously there was a great deal of damage here.

14:16:18.327 --> 14:16:19.261
It just collapsed.

14:16:19.728 --> 14:16:22.097
We don't know who was inside or how many people were inside.

14:16:22.097 --> 14:16:22.731
You hurt somebody.

14:16:23.231 --> 14:16:25.967
One of the people who was inside the building talked to us a short time ago and said,

14:16:26.001 --> 14:16:29.871
this e-ring of the Pentagon has a great many senior officials,

14:16:29.905 --> 14:16:31.540
so if somebody was planning something,

14:16:31.573 --> 14:16:34.509
this might have been the place if they wanted to get senior officials.

14:16:36.044 --> 14:16:36.278
Again,

14:16:36.378 --> 14:16:39.047
most of the fire on the outside of the building has been extinguished.

14:16:39.047 --> 14:16:41.550
There's still some spot fires on the outside of the building,

14:16:41.917 --> 14:16:42.351
and still,

14:16:42.384 --> 14:16:43.051
from what I can see,

14:16:43.051 --> 14:16:44.186
a great deal of fire inside.

14:16:44.186 --> 14:16:49.124
So now you have a gaping hole on the west side of the Pentagon, here at Washington Boulevard,

14:16:49.191 --> 14:16:50.459
and this collapse just happened.

14:16:50.459 --> 14:16:51.393
It was not an explosion,

14:16:51.426 --> 14:16:52.327
a secondary explosion.

14:16:52.561 --> 14:16:56.565
This apparently the damage from the great deal of fire and the structural damage from the plane crash.

14:16:56.932 --> 14:16:57.499
Any word yet,

14:16:57.566 --> 14:16:57.766
Dave,

14:16:57.766 --> 14:16:58.500
on casualties?

14:17:07.576 --> 14:17:07.876
Bel Air,

14:17:07.909 --> 14:17:08.710
Blue Ridge Ad line.

14:17:10.812 --> 14:17:11.179
Bel Air.

14:17:12.314 --> 14:17:12.581
Yeah,

14:17:12.581 --> 14:17:14.583
I got him holding a ticket on a Med-X 411.

14:17:14.583 --> 14:17:15.751
Did you guys divert him somewhere?

14:17:16.084 --> 14:17:17.552
We put everybody on the ground.

14:17:18.353 --> 14:17:18.587
All right.

14:17:18.587 --> 14:17:21.289
The only plane I got in the air right now is a military plane.

14:17:21.723 --> 14:17:23.759
All right,

14:17:23.925 --> 14:17:25.360
you get to me.

14:17:25.694 --> 14:17:31.533
All right,

14:17:31.533 --> 14:17:31.600
TJ.

14:17:31.600 --> 14:17:31.633
Bye.

14:17:31.633 --> 14:17:32.100
I mean,

14:17:32.100 --> 14:17:33.402
you don't just hijack an airplane.

14:17:33.402 --> 14:17:34.703
It's not the easiest thing to do.

14:17:34.703 --> 14:17:34.803
Yeah,

14:17:34.803 --> 14:17:34.936
I mean,

14:17:34.936 --> 14:17:36.471
and to do it simultaneously?

14:17:36.671 --> 14:17:36.938
Right,

14:17:36.972 --> 14:17:37.939
three or four airplanes.

14:17:38.340 --> 14:17:40.575
Look at how long Japan planned to do

14:17:41.143 --> 14:17:41.777
Pearl Harbor.

14:17:41.843 --> 14:17:42.844
They did as much.

14:17:42.944 --> 14:17:44.379
They did as much work as that.

14:17:44.546 --> 14:17:46.681
This is a huge undertaking.

14:17:46.681 --> 14:17:47.449
This is a war.

14:17:47.649 --> 14:17:54.389
The problem is, we've been talking about Osama Bin Laden planning some new major attack on the United States for about a year.

14:17:54.423 --> 14:17:55.323
We've been waiting for this.

14:17:55.323 --> 14:17:55.557
You know,

14:17:55.557 --> 14:17:57.192
we'll never know until this whole thing is over.

14:17:57.259 --> 14:17:58.093
But for all we know,

14:17:58.627 --> 14:17:59.928
their plans failed miserably.

14:17:59.961 --> 14:18:02.397
And this is a third of what they were planning.

14:18:05.167 --> 14:18:09.337
The world thought they were going to do on New Year's Eve in 1999.

14:18:09.337 --> 14:18:10.772
And they were smart and they waited.

14:18:10.806 --> 14:18:14.075
They waited until a random day in the middle of the week, in the middle of September.

14:18:21.450 --> 14:18:24.252
Say was responsible for it and who's since been charged in it.

14:18:25.020 --> 14:18:25.787
In this case,

14:18:26.221 --> 14:18:27.689
I think this ratchets up.

14:18:27.689 --> 14:18:29.658
Excuse me.

14:18:30.459 --> 14:18:34.329
This is the Pentagon we're looking at now, according to my monitor.

14:18:37.065 --> 14:18:37.899
And again,

14:18:37.966 --> 14:18:41.970
it is hard to grasp what part of the building,

14:18:42.737 --> 14:18:44.973
we do not know if they're in the courtyard or outside,

14:18:45.006 --> 14:18:49.578
But you can see that a fairly considerable amount of damage has been done.

14:18:49.578 --> 14:18:51.847
We do not know whether these are offices or storage areas.

14:18:51.847 --> 14:18:57.319
Areas the Pentagon is full of many thousands of people every day. That

14:18:57.686 --> 14:19:06.795
Secretary of Defense Donald Rumsfeld has been saying only yesterday and today. If he wants to reduce the bloatedness. As he put it, as he alluded to it in the military.

14:19:06.828 --> 14:19:07.462
And the bureaucracy,

14:19:07.496 --> 14:19:10.398
but this is the great home of the military.

14:19:10.398 --> 14:19:14.035
But this is the great home of the military bureaucratic establishment.

14:19:32.854 --> 14:19:32.988
Can

14:19:33.054 --> 14:19:35.991
you tell me your name,

14:19:35.991 --> 14:19:36.324
please?

14:19:36.491 --> 14:19:36.625
Yes.

14:19:36.625 --> 14:19:36.758
Yes,

14:19:36.758 --> 14:19:38.226
my name is Lisa Fleischer.

14:19:38.560 --> 14:19:40.395
I live down in Gateway Plaza,

14:19:40.462 --> 14:19:42.697
which is right across from the World Trade Center.

14:19:42.898 --> 14:19:43.532
Where were you when this happened?

14:19:43.532 --> 14:19:45.300
I was standing on the street,

14:19:45.834 --> 14:19:48.904
and I heard the first explosion,

14:19:49.538 --> 14:19:50.305
and I ran,

14:19:50.705 --> 14:19:51.072
and

14:19:51.907 --> 14:19:53.508
I didn't see what happened.

14:19:54.075 --> 14:19:54.442
But then

14:19:54.876 --> 14:19:58.880
I saw the second explosion happen.

14:19:59.180 --> 14:20:02.684
It looked like a plane rammed into the second building,

14:20:03.318 --> 14:20:05.253
and then that exploded as well.

14:20:09.624 --> 14:20:11.993
What happened at that moment of impact?

14:20:11.993 --> 14:20:15.797
It was just a huge fireball and pieces flying out,

14:20:15.864 --> 14:20:17.966
papers flying.

14:20:17.966 --> 14:20:20.569
Debris flying.

14:20:20.902 --> 14:20:22.871
Heat coming off from the explosion.

14:20:24.806 --> 14:20:26.541
What did you think it was?

14:20:26.541 --> 14:20:26.675
Well,

14:20:26.808 --> 14:20:30.979
we knew at the second hit that it was obviously a terrorist attack.

14:20:32.213 --> 14:20:33.214
The first time, we just,

14:20:33.848 --> 14:20:34.816
the first explosion.

14:20:37.485 --> 14:20:38.186
Yeah,

14:20:38.386 --> 14:20:39.287
yeah,

14:20:39.421 --> 14:20:41.423
there was debris raining all over the place on the street.

14:20:41.423 --> 14:20:41.990
What about bodies lying,

14:20:41.990 --> 14:20:42.357
tell me,

14:20:42.424 --> 14:20:43.525
like, what happened?

14:20:43.525 --> 14:20:43.625
No,

14:20:43.892 --> 14:20:44.059
it's,

14:20:44.593 --> 14:20:44.726
well,

14:20:45.193 --> 14:20:46.094
people were jumping.

