16:27:15.442 --> 16:27:20.347
Well, because we have everything, and we have a way of life that's organized and free, and they're jealous.

16:27:20.648 --> 16:27:22.049
I mean, it's an easy question to answer.

16:27:22.216 --> 16:27:22.383
Yeah.

16:27:22.683 --> 16:27:23.284
We have it all.

16:27:23.751 --> 16:27:26.453
Honey, I'm sorry you have to list stuff like this.

16:27:26.487 --> 16:27:28.923
Because these other countries live in fear of their leaders.

16:27:29.356 --> 16:27:29.757
It's unbelievable.

16:27:29.790 --> 16:27:30.824
They're raised to hate.

16:27:31.458 --> 16:27:33.360
And we have to now recognize...

16:27:33.360 --> 16:27:33.661
And we're...

16:27:34.061 --> 16:27:36.397
They make us responsible for all of their misery.

16:27:36.463 --> 16:27:36.730
You know,

16:27:37.198 --> 16:27:39.600
it's no different than when you were a kid growing up and you were beaten.

16:27:39.867 --> 16:27:40.201
I mean,

16:27:40.267 --> 16:27:40.467
it's,

16:27:40.568 --> 16:27:40.868
uh,

16:27:40.868 --> 16:27:43.671
you either take out those that beat you, or you accept it and you...

16:27:43.837 --> 16:27:45.105
And the behavior continues.

16:27:45.306 --> 16:27:45.406
Right.

16:27:45.406 --> 16:27:45.573
Reaver!

16:27:45.573 --> 16:27:45.706
Reaver!

16:27:45.706 --> 16:27:54.882
Let's go,

16:27:57.251 --> 16:28:01.488
I'm an Adan asking any division or any staff chief at the scene of any of the World Trade Center,

16:28:07.428 --> 16:28:07.561
okay?

16:28:07.561 --> 16:28:10.631
Any division chief or any staff chief at the scene of any of the World Trade Center,

16:28:10.631 --> 16:28:10.764
okay?

16:28:10.764 --> 16:28:11.031
I'm an Adan,

16:28:11.031 --> 16:28:11.432
mobile command Center,

16:28:19.607 --> 16:28:20.641
okay?

16:28:23.177 --> 16:28:24.445
Mobile Command Center to Manhattan,

16:28:24.445 --> 16:28:24.511
K.

16:28:24.511 --> 16:28:32.186
This is 36RK at the Command Post of Manhattan,

16:28:32.186 --> 16:28:32.286
K.

16:28:32.353 --> 16:28:33.921
Mobile Command Center to Manhattan,

16:28:33.954 --> 16:28:34.021
K.

16:28:34.054 --> 16:28:36.290
Mobile

16:28:36.757 --> 16:28:40.694
Command Center,

16:28:40.694 --> 16:28:43.264
What chief do you have at your Mobile Command

16:28:43.864 --> 16:28:44.331
Center, K?

16:28:44.331 --> 16:28:44.965
Negative on anything,

16:28:44.965 --> 16:28:44.999
K.

16:28:44.999 --> 16:28:46.066
Right now, we're all alone.

16:28:46.066 --> 16:28:47.301
The second building is down.

16:28:47.334 --> 16:28:49.403
So we have no contact with anybody at this time,

16:28:49.403 --> 16:28:49.436
K.

16:28:49.436 --> 16:28:49.803
10-4.

16:28:59.847 --> 16:29:00.514
I'm in the pizza shop!

16:29:05.152 --> 16:29:10.090
You know, this is the documentarian in me that feels like I need to record this.

16:29:15.896 --> 16:29:17.331
Look at all the ashes.

16:29:17.364 --> 16:29:18.532
It looks like it's snowing.

16:29:24.071 --> 16:29:29.810
There's people getting onto the west side now, onto the walkway.

16:30:38.946 --> 16:30:39.380
Yeah,

16:30:39.380 --> 16:30:40.147
that's the guy.

16:30:54.895 --> 16:30:56.930
These are the emergency workers who are coming back.

16:30:57.498 --> 16:31:03.303
It was just about 10 minutes ago that we described to you the possibility of that North Tower collapsing.

16:31:03.771 --> 16:31:05.439
About five minutes after we went off the air,

16:31:05.539 --> 16:31:06.473
it did collapse.

16:31:07.141 --> 16:31:07.574
Once again,

16:31:07.608 --> 16:31:09.643
we have no idea at this point, the loss of life.

16:31:09.910 --> 16:31:13.647
I can only tell you there were hundreds of emergency workers down there,

16:31:14.114 --> 16:31:15.616
about five or six blocks.

16:31:15.849 --> 16:31:17.217
It took probably about,

16:31:17.785 --> 16:31:18.352
I would say,

16:31:18.819 --> 16:31:22.489
no more than 50 or 60 seconds for that dust, cloud,

16:31:22.589 --> 16:31:23.457
dust and smoke.

16:31:23.690 --> 16:31:41.608
To literally make it the five or six blocks up here and begin to envelop us. At which point we started to move out of the way, there were literally dozens and dozens of firemen who were trying to run past us. In fact, our cameraman even put one of the captains in his car and drove him down to a command post.

16:31:49.616 --> 16:31:50.083
Teterboro?

16:31:54.855 --> 16:31:55.122
Teterboro,

16:31:55.222 --> 16:31:59.860
I just forgot what you said.

16:32:01.528 --> 16:32:02.463
Refueling.

16:32:02.463 --> 16:32:02.596
I mean,

16:32:02.629 --> 16:32:08.402
I came up here five minutes ago, getting ready to talk about which markets may be closing around the world,

16:32:08.435 --> 16:32:09.937
but now this is just becoming irrelevant.

16:32:09.937 --> 16:32:10.003
No,

16:32:10.003 --> 16:32:10.437
they're irrelevant.

16:32:10.471 --> 16:32:11.171
This is...

16:32:11.171 --> 16:32:12.439
Oh my goodness.

16:32:12.573 --> 16:32:14.775
There you see the building imploding.

16:32:16.210 --> 16:32:17.244
Do you see what's happening?

16:32:17.244 --> 16:32:17.478
Yes.

16:32:17.478 --> 16:32:17.711
Now,

16:32:18.345 --> 16:32:19.680
what would cause that?

16:32:19.947 --> 16:32:20.547
I don't know.

16:32:20.614 --> 16:32:20.747
Well,

16:32:20.814 --> 16:32:21.315
you have...

16:32:21.949 --> 16:32:22.182
I mean...

16:32:23.684 --> 16:32:24.818
All right,

16:32:24.818 --> 16:32:25.118
CSU2,

16:32:25.219 --> 16:32:27.888
can't wait to have you on.

16:32:30.424 --> 16:32:30.591
Hey,

16:32:30.624 --> 16:32:33.393
you're the one that's gonna check these radios.

16:32:35.028 --> 16:32:37.464
Climb to base.

16:32:37.464 --> 16:32:39.166
All servicemen.

16:32:39.166 --> 16:32:40.100
Is that a policeman?

16:32:40.267 --> 16:32:40.534
Fire.

16:32:40.601 --> 16:32:40.734
10.

16:32:40.767 --> 16:32:44.605
Climb to ambulance and land off the course.

16:32:44.605 --> 16:32:45.138
10,

16:32:45.138 --> 16:32:45.806
Can you hold this?

16:32:48.075 --> 16:32:49.176
Just a few moments ago,

16:32:49.276 --> 16:32:49.977
as we said,

16:32:50.711 --> 16:32:53.413
and perhaps 20 minutes after the first tower collapsed,

16:32:54.248 --> 16:32:58.785
we turned around and saw what looked like sparks falling.

16:32:59.720 --> 16:33:03.290
And then the top part of tower number one.

16:33:04.491 --> 16:33:06.193
Collapsed.

16:33:06.193 --> 16:33:07.227
Somebody better close the door.

16:33:07.227 --> 16:33:08.629
We're going to have nothing but dust in here.

16:33:11.164 --> 16:33:12.266
We need a sledge or something,

16:33:12.299 --> 16:33:12.499
guys.

16:33:13.300 --> 16:33:15.269
Why don't we open up keys to these fucking doors?

16:33:17.738 --> 16:33:18.372
Get inside,

16:33:18.405 --> 16:33:19.172
away from the dust.

16:33:19.206 --> 16:33:19.940
Everybody get out.

16:33:19.973 --> 16:33:20.841
Open the door for us.

16:33:22.075 --> 16:33:24.511
John Zito is an MSNBC producer.

16:33:24.578 --> 16:33:26.113
He lives in Lower Manhattan.

16:33:26.146 --> 16:33:27.548
He's on the phone with us now.

16:33:27.648 --> 16:33:27.848
John,

16:33:28.015 --> 16:33:29.283
where are you and what can you see?

16:33:30.050 --> 16:33:30.951
I can't see much.

16:33:30.951 --> 16:33:32.519
I can't see more of about...

16:33:32.653 --> 16:33:34.288
Three feet in front of my face.

16:33:34.555 --> 16:33:39.560
All the debris and soot from the second tower is just showering down.

16:33:40.160 --> 16:33:41.762
There's paper and just black soot.

16:33:42.596 --> 16:33:47.234
I'm outside a bank and a bunch of people are inside in the lobby, taking cover.

16:33:49.269 --> 16:33:52.973
Where exactly are you in relation to where the twin towers stood,

16:33:53.040 --> 16:33:53.307
John?

16:33:54.174 --> 16:33:54.841
I'm about,

16:33:54.942 --> 16:33:55.342
I'd say,

16:33:56.009 --> 16:33:57.544
15 to 20 blocks away.

16:33:57.978 --> 16:33:59.813
I'm at the Bowling Green subway station.

16:33:59.846 --> 16:34:01.748
I know that doesn't mean much to people who aren't from New York,

16:34:01.782 --> 16:34:02.983
but it's in the downtown area.

16:34:03.350 --> 16:34:06.920
It's a very popular place where a lot of commuters come in and out.

16:34:07.788 --> 16:34:11.625
Well,

16:34:13.560 --> 16:34:14.461
you know,

16:34:14.695 --> 16:34:15.662
as Robin pointed out,

16:34:15.662 --> 16:34:16.530
for a year now,

16:34:16.663 --> 16:34:17.297
they've all been saying,

16:34:17.397 --> 16:34:17.531
Well,

16:34:17.598 --> 16:34:20.400
Ben Laden is preparing a big attack on the United States.

16:34:21.401 --> 16:34:23.103
I don't know if it's Ben Laden on this particular thing,

16:34:23.103 --> 16:34:25.372
but once I hear he's preparing an attack,

16:34:26.840 --> 16:34:28.075
level the country he lives in.

16:34:28.442 --> 16:34:29.343
They're protecting him.

16:34:30.777 --> 16:34:31.778
Why do we care?

16:34:32.212 --> 16:34:33.547
We're a country that has it all.

16:34:33.914 --> 16:34:35.115
Now's the time to level.

16:34:35.215 --> 16:34:36.450
There's too many people in the world anyway.

16:34:36.917 --> 16:34:37.684
Level them out.

16:34:39.620 --> 16:34:39.753
Do

16:34:41.088 --> 16:34:42.589
I force the heat from in the building,

16:34:42.589 --> 16:34:43.557
or is that a bomb?

16:34:46.994 --> 16:34:48.195
That's the second big sprint.

16:34:49.296 --> 16:34:50.430
Everybody in one room,

16:34:50.530 --> 16:34:50.831
now!

16:34:54.034 --> 16:34:54.901
I was in this before,

16:34:54.901 --> 16:34:55.569
I know what it's like.

16:34:58.872 --> 16:35:01.441
When the first one collapsed,

16:35:01.441 --> 16:35:04.011
the dust followed us like a firebomb.

16:35:04.044 --> 16:35:10.183
And you can see now whether that was an explosion or exactly what happened that caused that second tower to collapse.

16:35:10.217 --> 16:35:11.885
We cannot tell you.

16:35:13.320 --> 16:35:14.021
And at this point,

16:35:14.054 --> 16:35:16.823
I can't imagine we're getting any word anytime soon.

16:35:17.024 --> 16:35:17.758
I don't think,

16:35:18.125 --> 16:35:18.925
I think we're safe.

16:35:19.292 --> 16:35:20.460
Here, I think I'm on safe ground,

16:35:20.460 --> 16:35:20.627
Bill.

16:35:20.694 --> 16:35:21.261
I don't think.

16:35:22.696 --> 16:35:26.199
This was clearly the way the structure is collapsing.

16:35:26.733 --> 16:35:28.735
This was the result of something that was planned.

16:35:29.136 --> 16:35:34.007
This is not. It's not accidental that the first tower just happened to collapse.

16:35:34.041 --> 16:35:37.678
And then the second hour just happened to collapse in exactly the same way.

16:35:38.211 --> 16:35:39.413
How they accomplished this,

16:35:39.579 --> 16:35:40.113
we don't know.

16:35:41.148 --> 16:35:41.615
But clearly,

16:35:41.648 --> 16:35:43.083
this is what they wanted to accomplish.

16:35:47.621 --> 16:35:49.156
Out of the World Trade Center building.

16:35:50.123 --> 16:35:50.390
People,

16:35:51.625 --> 16:35:54.461
the body parts.

16:35:54.461 --> 16:35:54.628
Oh,

16:35:54.695 --> 16:35:55.062
God.

16:35:55.829 --> 16:35:59.633
Guys,

16:35:59.633 --> 16:35:59.833
how you doing?

16:35:59.833 --> 16:35:59.866
Oh,

16:35:59.866 --> 16:36:00.500
my God.

16:36:00.534 --> 16:36:03.203
I'm just so sad.

16:36:03.236 --> 16:36:03.437
I know.

16:36:03.437 --> 16:36:03.603
Now,

16:36:03.737 --> 16:36:04.237
obviously,

16:36:04.304 --> 16:36:04.571
listen,

16:36:05.572 --> 16:36:07.507
The most important thing is that you stay safe,

16:36:07.541 --> 16:36:07.841
John,

16:36:07.874 --> 16:36:13.046
and that you get to an area where you feel that you may be most secure.

16:36:13.747 --> 16:36:16.850
Were you able to feel the collapse?

16:36:16.983 --> 16:36:17.984
Of that second tower?

16:36:18.285 --> 16:36:19.086
The second tower,

16:36:19.119 --> 16:36:19.252
no.

16:36:19.453 --> 16:36:21.154
But the first tower that went down,

16:36:21.588 --> 16:36:22.589
I was very close.

16:36:22.689 --> 16:36:24.024
I'd say about five blocks away.

16:36:24.424 --> 16:36:31.298
And CNBC's Ron and Ana and I were trying to hook up with the truck or find any NBC contact down there.

16:36:31.865 --> 16:36:34.301
And we were very close when that tower came down.

16:36:34.634 --> 16:36:36.369
And the debris came showering down.

16:36:37.003 --> 16:36:38.939
And Ron and I both ran for cover.

16:36:39.439 --> 16:36:50.150
I managed to get inside an alcove of a building and all the scaffolding around collapsed in front of me and broke the window next to me. And I climbed inside that and stayed in there for about 10 minutes.

16:36:51.051 --> 16:36:51.852
I couldn't get out of there.

16:36:51.852 --> 16:36:56.256
It was pitch black outside and I haven't pulled up.

16:36:57.424 --> 16:36:57.858
I'm all right.

16:37:15.242 --> 16:37:15.776
What you see?

16:37:16.443 --> 16:37:16.843
Everything.

16:37:16.843 --> 16:37:18.645
That's what chaos is.

16:37:18.645 --> 16:37:19.780
It's just chaos out here.

16:37:19.780 --> 16:37:20.247
It really is.

16:37:20.814 --> 16:37:22.682
So the twin towers fall.

16:37:22.816 --> 16:37:23.383
It's amazing.

16:37:23.650 --> 16:37:24.151
It's crazy.

16:37:24.151 --> 16:37:26.052
I can't believe this shit is happening.

16:37:26.953 --> 16:37:27.587
I really can't.

16:37:27.587 --> 16:37:28.755
It's a nightmare.

16:37:28.789 --> 16:37:29.756
It's armageddon right here.

16:37:31.057 --> 16:37:32.359
What's your name and how do you spell it?

16:37:32.893 --> 16:37:35.262
Peter Rodriguez.

16:37:35.295 --> 16:37:37.130
R-o-d-r-i-g-u-e-z Where do you work?

16:37:37.597 --> 16:37:37.931
Embassy,

16:37:37.931 --> 16:37:38.431
the hotel,

16:37:38.431 --> 16:37:39.032
the Embassy Suite.

16:37:39.266 --> 16:37:39.900
How's the hotel?

16:37:40.600 --> 16:37:41.067
Oh man,

16:37:41.101 --> 16:37:42.002
I can't even see it right now.

16:37:42.369 --> 16:37:42.702
Hopefully,

16:37:42.736 --> 16:37:46.106
it looks like we're going to have a lot of work to do.

16:37:46.973 --> 16:37:49.309
A lot of work and hopefully all those families are alright.

16:37:50.777 --> 16:37:51.178
My god,

16:37:51.178 --> 16:37:51.812
this is crazy.

16:37:51.878 --> 16:37:52.212
I can't,

16:37:52.279 --> 16:37:53.180
I'm distraught right now,

16:37:53.280 --> 16:37:53.580
sorry.

16:37:53.580 --> 16:37:54.881
I can't talk,

16:37:54.881 --> 16:37:55.582
this is crazy.

16:38:00.020 --> 16:38:00.120
Oh,

16:38:00.120 --> 16:38:01.254
you're insane.

16:38:01.254 --> 16:38:01.655
This is a deal.

16:38:04.391 --> 16:38:05.792
This is a huge deal for the city.

16:38:06.393 --> 16:38:07.460
It's not just the city,

16:38:07.594 --> 16:38:08.528
this is our country,

16:38:08.528 --> 16:38:08.562
man.

16:38:08.562 --> 16:38:08.662
Yeah,

16:38:08.662 --> 16:38:09.996
this is our country.

16:38:10.030 --> 16:38:12.833
The World Health and Care Center and the Pentagon, and everything else.

16:38:13.767 --> 16:38:14.801
This is scary.

16:38:20.140 --> 16:38:22.876
That is un-fucking-real.

16:38:29.015 --> 16:38:29.149
Wow.

16:38:29.149 --> 16:38:29.816
You need to read this.

16:38:30.116 --> 16:38:35.355
Region commander has declared that we can shoot down tracks that do not respond to our direction.

16:38:35.355 --> 16:38:35.488
Okay.

16:38:35.655 --> 16:38:36.456
I'll pass out the weapons.

16:38:37.023 --> 16:38:37.224
Okay.

16:38:39.226 --> 16:38:43.797
The region commander has declared that we can shoot down aircraft that do not respond to our direction.

16:38:43.864 --> 16:38:44.130
Copy that?

16:38:44.130 --> 16:38:44.431
Copy that,

16:38:44.431 --> 16:38:44.531
sir.

16:38:46.266 --> 16:38:48.468
So if you're trying to divert somebody and he won't divert...

16:38:48.468 --> 16:38:50.270
Po's saying no.

16:38:50.470 --> 16:38:50.570
No?

16:38:50.570 --> 16:38:51.371
He came over to the chest.

16:38:51.738 --> 16:38:51.938
Fox,

16:38:51.972 --> 16:38:52.873
you got a conflict on that?

16:38:53.874 --> 16:38:55.208
You got a conflict on that direction?

16:38:55.342 --> 16:38:55.909
Right now.

16:38:56.743 --> 16:38:56.977
Okay,

16:38:58.211 --> 16:38:58.378
okay,

16:38:58.678 --> 16:38:59.913
you read that from the vice president,

16:38:59.980 --> 16:39:02.115
right?

16:39:02.115 --> 16:39:03.083
Vice president has cleared.

16:39:03.383 --> 16:39:06.286
Vice president has cleared us to intercept track.

16:39:06.519 --> 16:39:09.189
Shoot them down if they do not respond first on RCC.

16:39:09.189 --> 16:39:09.656
Let's go!

16:39:21.601 --> 16:39:23.203
Tell me what you heard,

16:39:23.236 --> 16:39:23.803
what you saw.

16:39:24.704 --> 16:39:24.838
Well,

16:39:25.272 --> 16:39:25.605
excuse me,

16:39:25.639 --> 16:39:28.475
I was over there, just meeting with some of my customers.

16:39:28.475 --> 16:39:29.709
I'm a defense contractor,

16:39:30.377 --> 16:39:36.983
and we were standing around watching the CNN report on the World Trade Center incident. When we felt a jolt,

16:39:37.117 --> 16:39:37.951
something along the lines,

16:39:37.984 --> 16:39:38.551
I would suspect,

16:39:38.551 --> 16:39:40.153
of a minor tremor.

16:39:41.087 --> 16:39:44.791
And then a strong gust of air went through the hallways.

16:39:45.558 --> 16:39:46.326
Immediately after that,

16:39:47.494 --> 16:39:48.695
someone in the hallway started yelling,

16:39:48.695 --> 16:39:49.596
Get out of the building now.

16:39:50.530 --> 16:39:51.464
Panic inside there?

16:39:52.599 --> 16:39:52.999
Excuse me?

16:39:53.166 --> 16:39:53.566
Was there?

16:39:54.301 --> 16:39:55.602
Was there panic inside there?

16:39:56.169 --> 16:39:56.469
Yeah,

16:39:57.437 --> 16:40:04.945
it got fairly chaotic quickly, as everyone was trying to run down the narrow corridors there on the D-ring to get to an exit.

16:40:17.991 --> 16:40:19.292
Mobile command to, uh...

16:40:22.128 --> 16:40:23.430
This is Italian. 4 Alpha,

16:40:23.964 --> 16:40:25.865
I have dozens and dozens of firemen,

16:40:25.899 --> 16:40:30.403
we're at the bulkhead on the Hudson River side of the World Trade Center.

16:40:31.471 --> 16:40:32.472
We have medical emergencies,

16:40:32.505 --> 16:40:33.807
we have EMS on the team,

16:40:34.240 --> 16:40:35.675
three possible heart attacks.

16:40:36.576 --> 16:40:38.845
We're in the process of hitting some kind of a roll call.

16:40:38.845 --> 16:40:41.047
We're going to try to keep the units together here,

16:40:41.081 --> 16:40:41.181
Kay.

