16:51:01.667 --> 16:51:04.637
There are bits of debris of that plane scattered across

16:51:05.104 --> 16:51:09.175
27, across the lawn of the Pentagon, into the woods.

16:51:09.375 --> 16:51:11.777
A couple of joggers said they even saw debris in the area.

16:51:11.777 --> 16:51:11.944
Audrey,

16:51:11.944 --> 16:51:12.345
let me break in.

16:51:12.345 --> 16:51:15.548
Let's focus for a second on this developing situation.

16:51:15.615 --> 16:51:16.616
Help us sort out.

16:51:16.983 --> 16:51:20.620
Certainly, in more than 20 years of covering horrific events,

16:51:20.987 --> 16:51:22.788
this is something that I've never seen before.

16:51:24.223 --> 16:51:24.790
As we say,

16:51:24.824 --> 16:51:27.760
the emergency workers now beginning to try to gather themselves.

16:51:27.793 --> 16:51:30.329
Over there, you can see a police emergency service unit.

16:51:31.163 --> 16:51:35.167
They are trying basically now to reestablish some kind of a safe perimeter.

16:51:36.502 --> 16:51:37.036
And many of the...

16:51:37.403 --> 16:51:39.772
Emergency workers basically just happy to be alive.

16:51:40.072 --> 16:51:41.440
Certainly, that picture tells it all.

16:51:41.941 --> 16:51:44.010
Many of them just happy to be alive at this point,

16:51:45.211 --> 16:51:47.747
having survived what is an extraordinary event,

16:51:47.747 --> 16:51:49.148
the collapse of two towers.

16:51:49.181 --> 16:51:50.516
As we said earlier in our report,

16:51:50.516 --> 16:51:52.151
110 stories each.

16:51:53.052 --> 16:51:54.353
I will tell you that what fell,

16:51:54.387 --> 16:51:55.321
what I saw fall,

16:51:55.421 --> 16:51:56.489
had to be at least 40,

16:51:56.589 --> 16:51:58.624
50 stories of that building at first.

16:51:59.091 --> 16:52:01.327
The skeleton was left at about,

16:52:01.360 --> 16:52:01.761
I would say,

16:52:01.794 --> 16:52:02.428
the 50th or

16:52:02.795 --> 16:52:04.563
60th floor after the shell,

16:52:04.630 --> 16:52:04.997
after the

16:52:05.364 --> 16:52:07.166
the structure of the building fell down.

16:52:08.000 --> 16:52:08.734
The skeleton,

16:52:08.768 --> 16:52:09.769
the steel skeleton,

16:52:10.302 --> 16:52:17.043
was literally sheathed off, and it took probably about another 30 seconds before the skeleton collapsed into the street.

16:52:17.309 --> 16:52:20.112
That was the last we saw of the World Trade Center.

16:52:20.913 --> 16:52:25.451
And that was maybe 10 minutes ago when that final skeleton,

16:52:25.451 --> 16:52:26.252
the metal skeleton,

16:52:26.318 --> 16:52:26.952
steel skeleton,

16:52:27.019 --> 16:52:28.220
collapsed into the street.

16:52:28.454 --> 16:52:30.189
That was NBC's Pat Dawson, again.

16:52:34.326 --> 16:52:34.827
The Pentagon,

16:52:34.827 --> 16:52:35.695
if we do hear from them,

16:52:35.695 --> 16:52:38.664
we'll simply interrupt and let them get on talking.

16:52:38.964 --> 16:52:39.131
Yeah,

16:52:39.165 --> 16:52:39.465
Rebecca,

16:52:39.465 --> 16:52:39.932
