16:52:39.999 --> 16:52:40.166
Yes,

16:52:40.266 --> 16:52:40.499
Peter,

16:52:40.533 --> 16:52:41.033
I hear you.

16:52:41.133 --> 16:52:43.936
I'm in the basement of 815 Connecticut Avenue.

16:52:43.969 --> 16:52:46.906
It's a building across the block from the White House,

16:52:47.106 --> 16:52:47.873
across the park.

16:52:48.140 --> 16:52:49.275
You know where that is next to the...

16:52:49.275 --> 16:52:50.142
The Chamber of COMMERCE.

16:52:50.476 --> 16:52:51.877
I had to come down here BECAUSE,

16:52:51.911 --> 16:52:52.378
as you SAID,

16:52:52.445 --> 16:52:53.746
none of the cell phones are WORKING.

16:52:54.080 --> 16:52:55.981
I'm in the engineer's office and they've given us

16:52:56.382 --> 16:52:57.349
their phones to USE.

16:52:57.450 --> 16:52:59.251
There's a real dichotomy here at the White HOUSE,

16:52:59.285 --> 16:52:59.552
PETER.

16:52:59.919 --> 16:53:04.156
Tourists who still are not fully aware of what's happening across the nation are

16:53:04.256 --> 16:53:04.557
the White HOUSE.

16:53:04.557 --> 16:53:06.058
They are standing there, watching with CURIOSITY.

16:53:06.392 --> 16:53:07.626
They keep getting moved BACK.

16:53:07.893 --> 16:53:10.496
But those of us who are inside the White House realize

16:53:10.963 --> 16:53:11.697
the SITUATION.

16:53:11.731 --> 16:53:14.734
I was inside the White House this morning trying to gather information for you.

16:53:15.267 --> 16:53:16.969
When we were told by a very nervous

16:53:17.603 --> 16:53:18.804
White House security staff

16:53:19.171 --> 16:53:21.307
that they feared a plane was headed to the White HOUSE.

16:53:21.373 --> 16:53:23.109
And we heard planes, indeed, OVERHEAD.

16:53:23.442 --> 16:53:25.878
And they quickly evacuated all of us out of the White HOUSE.

16:53:25.945 --> 16:53:26.078
NOW,

16:53:26.445 --> 16:53:27.713
I just got off the phone with my own

16:53:28.481 --> 16:53:30.516
crying mother, who I'm a little bit of a crying MOTHER.

16:53:30.616 --> 16:53:32.518
I'm a little bit of a crying MOTHER.

16:53:32.518 --> 16:53:34.053
I'm a little bit of my own

16:53:34.086 --> 16:53:34.520
White HOUSE.

16:53:34.520 --> 16:53:36.655
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:36.655 --> 16:53:39.492
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:39.525 --> 16:53:42.328
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:42.328 --> 16:53:44.363
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:44.363 --> 16:53:46.165
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:46.198 --> 16:53:47.900
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:47.967 --> 16:53:50.236
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:50.369 --> 16:53:52.338
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:52.338 --> 16:53:55.007
I'm not sure if you're ready

16:53:55.407 --> 16:53:55.908
for THAT.

16:53:55.908 --> 16:53:58.344
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:53:58.377 --> 16:53:58.477
I'm

16:53:59.311 --> 16:54:00.846
not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:54:00.880 --> 16:54:02.081
I'm not sure if you're ready for THAT.

16:54:02.081 --> 16:54:02.715
The President's OFFICE.

16:54:02.715 --> 16:54:03.883
I think it's important that

16:54:03.983 --> 16:54:07.286
days ago was preparing a lovely state dinner for President Fox of Mexico.

16:54:07.820 --> 16:54:09.421
I saw him and I tried to speak to him.

16:54:09.822 --> 16:54:10.222
And, frankly,

16:54:10.289 --> 16:54:10.523
Peter,

16:54:10.523 --> 16:54:11.323
he was too rattled.

16:54:11.357 --> 16:54:15.861
He said he couldn't speak and he was with his staff. And they were all very anxious and very worried. because,

16:54:15.861 --> 16:54:16.195
of course,

16:54:16.228 --> 16:54:18.831
they did know what's going on in the country today.

16:54:19.031 --> 16:54:19.532
Many thanks,

16:54:19.565 --> 16:54:19.832
Rebecca.

16:54:21.534 --> 16:54:22.434
They want us to land.

16:54:22.535 --> 16:54:23.235
They just want us.

16:54:23.302 --> 16:54:25.037
They're evacuating 30 Rock,

16:54:25.237 --> 16:54:26.605
so they just want us to land.

16:54:28.874 --> 16:54:30.576
You want to go back and get your phone and stuff?

16:54:36.448 --> 16:54:39.318
It's just smoke.

16:54:39.351 --> 16:54:40.719
We saw the whole building shiver.

16:54:40.753 --> 16:54:45.891
Our cameraman even put one of the captains in his car and drove him down to a command post.

16:54:46.725 --> 16:54:50.496
The people that you see here are pretty much all emergency workers.

16:54:50.529 --> 16:54:53.766
Many of them I have seen in the last two to three minutes.

16:55:06.812 --> 16:55:09.248
Now we are...

16:55:09.348 --> 16:55:10.583
We are getting reports from

16:55:11.050 --> 16:55:17.957
Dow Jones across the wires just about 60 seconds ago.

16:55:18.657 --> 16:55:22.161
Reports of a hijacked plane heading toward Washington.

16:55:23.229 --> 16:55:25.598
We should note that President Bush is not in Washington right now.

16:55:25.598 --> 16:55:27.233
President Bush is not in Washington.

16:55:27.299 --> 16:55:30.269
