16:55:37.042 --> 16:55:37.109
No,

16:55:37.142 --> 16:55:37.576
that's fine.

16:55:37.643 --> 16:55:38.377
I'm not logged in.

16:55:38.377 --> 16:55:41.080
Let me do that now so I can be up to date along with you.

16:56:08.941 --> 16:56:12.478
It's just me and Rafe standing by to where else you want us to go.

16:56:12.478 --> 16:56:20.986
We have some good people.

16:56:21.020 --> 16:56:21.086
Copy,

16:56:21.086 --> 16:56:21.353
stand by.

16:56:21.353 --> 16:56:21.553
Hey,

16:56:21.553 --> 16:56:21.987
you got a 100-feel horn,

16:56:21.987 --> 16:56:22.154
man.

16:56:27.259 --> 16:56:27.960
Get people shots,

16:56:27.993 --> 16:56:28.127
too.

16:56:28.127 --> 16:56:28.527
I did,

16:56:28.527 --> 16:56:29.662
I got a few right here.

16:56:29.662 --> 16:56:29.962
Excellent.

16:56:30.229 --> 16:56:30.396
Man,

16:56:30.396 --> 16:56:31.463
you don't need to tell me how to shoot.

16:56:31.730 --> 16:56:32.598
You can do it yourself.

16:56:43.108 --> 16:56:51.684
Thank you.

16:57:11.837 --> 16:57:12.504
Come on guys,

16:57:12.538 --> 16:57:13.305
anybody coming?

16:57:13.472 --> 16:57:14.406
Get your ass over here,

16:57:14.473 --> 16:57:14.873
now!

16:57:16.208 --> 16:57:16.742
Now!

16:57:40.032 --> 16:57:43.502
Everything south of the Brooklyn Bridge is in a dust cloud.

16:57:43.535 --> 16:57:44.536
There's no visibility.

16:57:44.937 --> 16:57:46.105
People all over the street.

16:57:46.438 --> 16:57:47.473
Travel is near impossible.

16:57:47.506 --> 16:57:48.207
10-4, Division 1,

16:57:48.207 --> 16:57:55.014
clear to land.

16:58:02.888 --> 16:58:03.589
Who is saying what?

16:58:03.622 --> 16:58:05.891
