16:58:06.592 --> 16:58:06.792
Here,

16:58:06.959 --> 16:58:07.159
there's a...

16:58:07.159 --> 16:58:07.826
Take your time.

16:58:07.993 --> 16:58:08.360
Excuse me,

16:58:08.394 --> 16:58:08.761
officer.

16:58:08.994 --> 16:58:09.995
Can we talk to you for a second?

16:58:09.995 --> 16:58:11.063
That officer is trying to...

16:58:11.096 --> 16:58:13.999
The car just tried to sneak by here and is headed to the

16:58:14.500 --> 16:58:15.267
Pentagon building.

16:58:15.267 --> 16:58:16.402
And they're telling everybody...

16:58:16.802 --> 16:58:21.073
Let's see if I can get him to update us on exactly what the situation is here.

16:58:21.173 --> 16:58:21.640
Officer?

16:58:22.174 --> 16:58:22.541
Officer?

16:58:22.875 --> 16:58:24.643
We want to just find out what the situation is.

16:58:24.676 --> 16:58:27.312
We're told another aircraft is coming towards the Pentagon.

16:58:27.479 --> 16:58:28.113
We have another threat,

16:58:28.147 --> 16:58:28.347
ma'am.

16:58:28.981 --> 16:58:33.619
.breathing. Problems are the biggest problem for those who manage to make it safely out of the...

16:58:33.619 --> 16:58:33.919
Oh my god,

16:58:33.986 --> 16:58:35.087
there's no more World Trade Centers.

16:58:35.087 --> 16:58:36.255
.You. Can't see much more than a block south of the...

16:58:36.255 --> 16:58:46.165
.trade. Center probably stands about ten blocks south of where I am at this moment.

16:58:49.601 --> 16:58:51.703
Dave Statter is at the Pentagon.

16:58:51.970 --> 16:58:52.204
Dave,

16:58:52.237 --> 16:58:52.771
can you hear me?

16:58:53.005 --> 16:58:53.405
I hear you,

16:58:53.405 --> 16:58:53.639
Mike.

16:58:53.639 --> 16:58:56.008
The fire continues to burn out of control at the Pentagon.

16:58:56.041 --> 16:58:58.077
It looked like they were making some headway.

16:58:58.243 --> 16:59:01.346
We don't know if they had to pull back because of the threat that came in here,

16:59:01.647 --> 16:59:04.249
but right now, there's still a great deal of fire in...

16:59:05.784 --> 16:59:07.319
Inside the Pentagon at the moment.

16:59:07.352 --> 16:59:10.989
Firefighting operations may have ceased for a little bit because of the threat.

16:59:11.457 --> 16:59:11.924
The threat,

16:59:11.957 --> 16:59:12.291
again,

16:59:12.458 --> 16:59:13.759
which you've been talking about,

16:59:13.792 --> 16:59:15.961
is that there's some other plane that may have been hijacked.

16:59:16.361 --> 16:59:19.398
FBI agents on the scene here moved everybody they could away from the plane.

16:59:19.398 --> 16:59:19.865
From the Pentagon,

16:59:19.865 --> 16:59:20.432
including us.

16:59:20.499 --> 16:59:23.502
There was a brief bit of panic as people ran,

16:59:23.936 --> 16:59:25.304
and they forced us out of the area.

16:59:25.304 --> 16:59:26.572
We're now a little bit further away,

16:59:26.972 --> 16:59:28.640
looking at the west side of the Pentagon,

16:59:28.774 --> 16:59:29.541
near the heliport,

16:59:29.641 --> 16:59:30.375
the E-ring.

16:59:30.542 --> 16:59:32.478
50th floor of the Millennium, Hilton,

16:59:33.178 --> 16:59:35.147
And I was getting ready to call my wife.

16:59:35.414 --> 16:59:36.949
I heard the whine of a jet.

16:59:37.349 --> 16:59:39.885
An American Airlines jet hit the tower.

16:59:40.819 --> 16:59:41.887
I know about planes.

16:59:42.287 --> 16:59:46.125
It was either a 737 or a 757.

16:59:46.158 --> 16:59:47.526
I don't know if they fly the Airbus,

16:59:47.726 --> 16:59:49.228
but the air...

16:59:49.228 --> 16:59:52.331
Engine configuration looked like it was a 737.

16:59:52.331 --> 16:59:53.532
It had the nose down.

16:59:54.733 --> 16:59:55.801
It was hauling ass.

16:59:56.101 --> 16:59:57.236
I looked up and I thought,

16:59:57.970 --> 16:59:59.972
what is this plane doing, coming so fast?

17:00:00.005 --> 17:00:02.674
And it just slammed right into the first tower.

17:00:03.842 --> 17:00:04.209
Wham.

17:00:04.376 --> 17:00:05.110
Unbelievable.

17:00:05.944 --> 17:00:08.514
I think it was just from the heat of the fire.

17:00:08.680 --> 17:00:09.448
That's my guess.

17:00:10.249 --> 17:00:11.450
And when that happened,

17:00:11.650 --> 17:00:14.720
then they told us to get the hell out of the hotel.

17:00:14.987 --> 17:00:15.954
What's your name?

17:00:15.988 --> 17:00:16.955
My name's Doug Eisler.

17:00:16.955 --> 17:00:18.824
What's your last name?

17:00:18.891 --> 17:00:19.057
E-I-S-L-E-R.

17:00:19.258 --> 17:00:19.992
From Philadelphia.

17:00:19.992 --> 17:00:21.860
Have you ever seen anything like this?

17:00:21.894 --> 17:00:22.694
Absolutely not.

17:00:22.761 --> 17:00:27.966
I've seen at least 10 people fall to their death and just splat like a ripe tomato.

17:00:28.867 --> 17:00:29.401
It's awful.

17:00:29.468 --> 17:00:30.002
But it's,

17:00:30.769 --> 17:00:33.739
I don't know who was at the controls or what was going on in the plane,

17:00:33.772 --> 17:00:34.806
but it was not a bomb.

17:00:34.806 --> 17:00:38.710
It was an American Airlines jet that crashed into the tower.

17:00:39.344 --> 17:00:39.578
Sure.

17:00:40.245 --> 17:00:44.449
He's standing about 10 blocks from where the World Trade Center towers used to stand.

17:00:44.950 --> 17:00:46.051
You're looking at the collapse.

17:00:46.318 --> 17:00:47.619
Of one of those towers right now.

17:00:47.686 --> 17:00:51.023
We now have an AP news alert out of Pittsburgh.

17:00:51.056 --> 17:00:57.162
Officials at Somerset County Airport are confirming the crash of a large plane just north of the airport.

17:00:57.563 --> 17:01:00.098
That's about 80 miles southeast of Pittsburgh.

17:01:00.132 --> 17:01:00.432
Again,

17:01:00.832 --> 17:01:05.971
Officials at Somerset County Airport confirmed the crash of a large plane north of that airport,

17:01:06.305 --> 17:01:10.976
which is located about 80 miles to the southeast of the city of Pittsburgh.

17:01:11.009 --> 17:01:14.613
We do not know whether that crash of that plane is related.

17:01:14.980 --> 17:01:19.885
.to. What has become an obvious terrorist attack, both here in New York City and in Washington,

17:01:19.918 --> 17:01:20.185
D.C.

17:01:20.285 --> 17:01:20.953
At the Pentagon.

17:01:30.762 --> 17:01:30.929
Cindy,

17:01:31.597 --> 17:01:32.231
if you're still there,

17:01:32.231 --> 17:01:32.965
I just want to clarify,

17:01:32.998 --> 17:01:34.433
you're saying there was a plane down,

17:01:34.466 --> 17:01:37.236
a report of a plane down somewhere else in Pennsylvania?

17:01:37.536 --> 17:01:37.803
Yes,

17:01:37.970 --> 17:01:41.640
we are getting that from CNN as reporting that there is a plane down in Pennsylvania,

17:01:41.740 --> 17:01:42.474
a large plane.

17:01:42.574 --> 17:01:43.208
As well as now...

17:01:43.542 --> 17:01:45.944
A fourth explosion at the site of the World Trade Center.

17:01:45.944 --> 17:01:49.281
You continue to look live at the scene across New York Harbor.

17:01:49.514 --> 17:01:54.019
What is left of the skyline is truly just smoke and ash right now.

17:01:54.119 --> 17:01:54.753
And parents,

17:01:54.953 --> 17:01:56.255
as you continue to watch with us,

17:01:57.155 --> 17:01:59.925
here's what Cindy had told us regarding children in that area.

17:02:27.152 --> 17:02:27.686
Okay,

17:02:37.696 --> 17:02:38.196
yeah,

17:02:38.230 --> 17:02:38.397
hi.

17:02:38.730 --> 17:02:41.533
The police have gone up on the Williamsburg Bridge,

17:02:42.000 --> 17:02:43.735
and now people from the walkway,

17:02:43.735 --> 17:02:45.304
there's a walkway that goes across the bridge.

17:02:45.604 --> 17:02:47.139
They're running back into Brooklyn.

17:02:47.172 --> 17:02:47.839
I don't know why,

17:02:47.906 --> 17:02:48.540
but they're running.

17:02:48.840 --> 17:02:49.875
They're not walking back.

17:02:51.209 --> 17:02:51.743
What's going on,

17:02:51.743 --> 17:02:51.943
Tom?

17:02:51.943 --> 17:02:52.511
What did you just hear?

17:02:52.511 --> 17:02:54.980
Part of the Pentagon has collapsed.

17:02:54.980 --> 17:02:56.481
Part of the Pentagon just collapsed.

17:02:56.481 --> 17:02:56.648
Wait.

17:02:56.815 --> 17:02:58.350
Where they say a lot of senior officials'

17:02:58.417 --> 17:02:59.017
offices are,

17:02:59.251 --> 17:03:00.252
it continues to burn.

17:03:00.619 --> 17:03:01.420
I guess about 20,

17:03:01.586 --> 17:03:02.054
30 minutes,

17:03:02.054 --> 17:03:03.055
sort of lost track of time.

17:03:03.288 --> 17:03:04.990
That whole middle section collapsed.

17:03:05.891 --> 17:03:07.426
That wasn't from the initial explosion,

17:03:07.459 --> 17:03:10.996
apparently from the great amount of fire there and the damage done when the plane hit.

17:03:18.403 --> 17:03:18.904
First of all,

17:03:18.904 --> 17:03:23.775
we were just in the building and we were looking out the window because we saw the paper going around.

17:03:23.775 --> 17:03:26.645
We were looking out and all of a sudden we saw the plane come from this direction.

17:03:26.645 --> 17:03:27.713
You were on the same floor?

17:03:27.713 --> 17:03:27.846
Yeah,

