17:03:53.605 --> 17:03:53.705
No,

17:03:54.106 --> 17:03:54.206
no.

17:03:54.306 --> 17:03:55.006
It was so quick.

17:03:55.173 --> 17:03:55.874
Just out of nowhere.

17:03:55.941 --> 17:03:56.241
Boom.

17:03:57.042 --> 17:03:57.309
And then?

17:03:57.376 --> 17:03:57.609
Big.

17:03:58.276 --> 17:03:59.511
