17:04:01.146 --> 17:04:01.780
I mean,

17:04:02.013 --> 17:04:02.781
pocketbooks,

17:04:03.115 --> 17:04:03.448
tools,

17:04:03.548 --> 17:04:05.016
everything I had was out of my...

17:04:05.283 --> 17:04:27.139
My pockets. I went back and got it afterwards. So you felt the explosion? yeah, did you feel the first one or hear the first one? No, no. We just looked out the window, we were in the building and we saw. We said, Where'd the Yankees win the World Series again? It's like a ticker tape parade. We were joking around and then we looked out the window and realized that the children was on fire. We didn't hear whatsoever. Then we came down and checked it out. I saw it all I was.

17:04:33.779 --> 17:04:35.046
I'll find the other problem.

17:04:35.247 --> 17:04:35.747
Just let's go.

17:04:35.814 --> 17:04:37.182
Let's get you guys down to the front here.

17:04:37.182 --> 17:04:37.983
Sorry.

17:04:37.983 --> 17:04:43.522
I had to learn to go here.

17:04:43.522 --> 17:04:43.789
Cooper,

17:04:43.822 --> 17:04:45.724
And if you just see that picture that was going by,

17:04:45.757 --> 17:04:46.158
