17:09:42.854 --> 17:09:52.897
Well, the coordinated nature of this attack makes it clear we're not just talking about an isolated group. And I'm sure the dominant suspicion,

17:09:53.031 --> 17:09:55.734
although no response has been claimed,

17:09:55.800 --> 17:10:00.338
