I know.

19:31:10.200 --> 19:31:10.867
I heard a boom.

19:31:10.934 --> 19:31:11.734
And when I turned around,

19:31:11.768 --> 19:31:12.068
I said,

19:31:12.101 --> 19:31:12.202
oh,

19:31:12.235 --> 19:31:12.769
my God,

19:31:12.769 --> 19:31:13.736
there's my tower.

19:31:13.870 --> 19:31:14.938
That was two World Trade.

19:31:14.971 --> 19:31:15.138
Oh,

19:31:15.171 --> 19:31:15.772
my God.

19:31:15.772 --> 19:31:16.306
I got hit.

19:31:16.639 --> 19:31:17.640
At which point...

19:31:17.807 --> 19:31:18.641
Let me ask you something.

19:31:18.841 --> 19:31:21.377
How many people were
at work on your floor?

19:31:21.644 --> 19:31:22.412
Let me tell you another thing.

19:31:22.612 --> 19:31:23.246
My floor,

19:31:23.379 --> 19:31:26.950
my co-workers are the actual
victims of the first bombing.

19:31:27.617 --> 19:31:30.486
They were in B1 level when the actual
bombing happened back in the 90s.

19:31:30.753 --> 19:31:32.088
So when you say you got out,

19:31:32.121 --> 19:31:33.523
there was a lot of
people still on the floor,

19:31:33.556 --> 19:31:35.758
There was a lot of people because there
was one space in the freight elevator.

19:31:35.825 --> 19:31:36.960
I don't know who
pulled me in there.

19:31:37.093 --> 19:31:39.195
And usually the elevators
stop because there's a fire.

19:31:39.195 --> 19:31:40.296
They automatically stop.

19:31:40.396 --> 19:31:40.496
Well,

19:31:40.530 --> 19:31:41.397
you were real lucky.

19:31:41.497 --> 19:31:44.500
I have no idea how
lucky I really am.

19:31:44.534 --> 19:31:44.634
Oh,

19:31:44.667 --> 19:31:45.401
my God.

19:31:45.602 --> 19:31:47.337
What was your job at
the World Trade Center?

19:31:47.403 --> 19:31:53.643
I was actually the sign and the coordinator
for all the signs and all the...

19:31:54.611 --> 19:31:56.145
The directories of the
World Trade Center.

19:31:56.179 --> 19:31:57.413
I work for the Port Authority.

19:31:57.580 --> 19:31:58.381
You work for the building,

19:31:58.414 --> 19:31:58.982
the World Trade Center.

19:31:59.048 --> 19:31:59.616
For the Port Authority.

19:31:59.716 --> 19:31:59.949
Right.

19:32:00.083 --> 19:32:00.984
Oh my God.

19:32:01.184 --> 19:32:02.118
You are so lucky.

19:32:04.287 --> 19:32:07.056
Quick update on the
plane crash here in our area.

19:32:07.123 --> 19:32:09.125
It was United 757.

19:32:09.425 --> 19:32:11.427
We don't know how
many people are on board.

19:32:11.828 --> 19:32:16.032
We have to assume the worst
given the pictures we've seen there

19:32:16.032 --> 19:32:20.236
and the accounts of the scene
of a crater in the ground and very,

19:32:20.370 --> 19:32:21.704
very little in the
way of debris.

19:32:21.771 --> 19:32:22.772
Rick Earl just telling us.

19:32:23.640 --> 19:32:26.309
The largest piece they
found is about five feet long.

19:32:26.609 --> 19:32:29.178
There is again shots
of New York as the,

19:32:29.679 --> 19:32:30.346
unbelievably.

19:32:30.346 --> 19:32:33.883
I think that's the first tower
that was hit first collapsing,

19:32:33.916 --> 19:32:35.451
but the second one to collapse.

19:32:35.451 --> 19:32:35.685
And the

19:32:36.152 --> 19:32:37.954
Pittsburgh incident that
they were describing,

19:32:38.021 --> 19:32:39.889
United Airlines Flight 93,

19:32:39.889 --> 19:32:41.224
a 757.

19:32:41.291 --> 19:32:42.091
So devastated,
I'm so devastated.

19:32:42.125 --> 19:32:43.226
the towers are gone.

19:32:43.359 --> 19:32:43.960
Everything's gone.

19:32:43.993 --> 19:32:45.561
I don't know what
happens tomorrow.

19:32:45.862 --> 19:32:46.129
Well,

19:32:46.362 --> 19:32:47.764
there's got to be retribution.

19:32:48.231 --> 19:32:48.564
I see.

19:32:48.564 --> 19:32:49.132
Not even retribution.

19:32:49.132 --> 19:32:50.133
for self-preservation,

19:32:50.199 --> 19:32:51.200
we must attack.

19:32:51.567 --> 19:32:52.602
I tell you,

19:32:52.635 --> 19:32:53.536
this is ridiculous.

19:32:53.569 --> 19:32:55.805
And I said it at 9 o'clock in the
morning when I first saw the news.

19:32:55.838 --> 19:32:56.105
I said,

19:32:56.139 --> 19:32:57.373
now it is their excuse.

19:32:57.507 --> 19:32:59.108
Now you finally
have been pushed.

19:32:59.208 --> 19:32:59.776
I mean, really?

19:32:59.909 --> 19:33:00.943
Now let's not stop.

19:33:00.943 --> 19:33:02.745
I would love to know what
they're saying in Europe now.

19:33:02.845 --> 19:33:03.746
All the people who always say,

19:33:03.846 --> 19:33:05.982
The rest of the world
is laughing at us.

19:33:05.982 --> 19:33:06.282
How about,

19:33:06.282 --> 19:33:07.083
I don't even care.

19:33:07.250 --> 19:33:08.384
I don't even care
what Europe's saying.

19:33:08.451 --> 19:33:08.818
I'm saying,

19:33:08.951 --> 19:33:10.353
now we have to make a decision.

19:33:11.521 --> 19:33:11.888
Yes we do.

19:33:12.055 --> 19:33:13.990
We know the countries
that harbor terrorists.

19:33:14.057 --> 19:33:16.793
Don't wait to even find
out who is responsible.

19:33:16.793 --> 19:33:17.560
Why even let them
into this country?

19:33:17.593 --> 19:33:19.529
We should stop letting
people in already.

19:33:19.562 --> 19:33:20.463
It's enough immigration.

19:33:20.496 --> 19:33:21.531
We've got too many people here.

19:33:32.742 --> 19:33:34.310
The mayor says he
arrived at the World Trade

19:33:34.344 --> 19:33:35.945
Center building just
moments after the first

19:33:35.978 --> 19:33:39.182
blast and witnessed people jumping from their
window- from the windows to their deaths.

19:33:39.315 --> 19:33:42.385
Oh.

19:33:42.385 --> 19:33:42.518
Wow.

19:33:43.653 --> 19:33:45.221
Imagine jumping out of
the World Trade Center.

19:33:45.321 --> 19:33:45.455
No,

19:33:45.555 --> 19:33:48.257
and there's no way
of surviving that.

19:33:48.624 --> 19:33:48.825
Well,

19:33:50.159 --> 19:33:50.993
we're going to go now.

19:33:52.662 --> 19:33:53.896
There's not much
more to be said.

19:33:53.930 --> 19:33:57.066
You guys can tune to TV
and radio and everything else,

19:33:57.133 --> 19:33:57.300
and

19:33:58.868 --> 19:34:01.471
I'm just devastated by this.

19:34:01.738 --> 19:34:02.972
We'll be doing
what you're doing.

19:34:02.972 --> 19:34:03.239
Yep,

19:34:03.473 --> 19:34:05.475
we'll all be sitting around
waiting to hear what goes on.

19:34:10.980 --> 19:34:11.247
You know,

19:34:11.981 --> 19:34:13.049
this is a great day in the

19:34:13.950 --> 19:34:14.650
Arab lands.

19:34:15.651 --> 19:34:16.586
They're cheering for us.

19:34:17.186 --> 19:34:20.022
Let it be the start of the
worst moment of their lives.

19:34:20.056 --> 19:34:20.189
Yeah.

19:34:20.623 --> 19:34:22.458
Let this be the day
that we woke up.

19:34:22.825 --> 19:34:23.192
Please.

19:34:23.826 --> 19:34:24.093
You know,

19:34:24.160 --> 19:34:28.798
much like when the Japanese had struck
their blow against the United States,

19:34:28.998 --> 19:34:30.500
it was just the
beginning of the end.

19:34:30.900 --> 19:34:31.768
It was the beginning
of their nightmare.

19:34:31.768 --> 19:34:33.803
Let's hope this is the
beginning of the end.

19:34:33.803 --> 19:34:34.971
I think this is
the wake-up call,

19:34:35.505 --> 19:34:36.205
unfortunately.

19:34:36.539 --> 19:34:37.707
It's an unfortunate
wake-up call,

19:34:37.707 --> 19:34:38.207
but it's here.

19:34:39.409 --> 19:34:40.410
I guess we would never really...

19:34:40.510 --> 19:34:42.578
Because the world has been
plagued with this long enough,

19:34:42.678 --> 19:34:43.513
obviously.

19:34:43.546 --> 19:34:45.081
Let's free the
world of terrorists.

19:34:45.515 --> 19:34:46.549
It's time to do it now.

19:34:47.150 --> 19:34:50.353
It's going to take about a
month to really nuclear attack

19:34:50.353 --> 19:34:53.556
them and do it in a devastating
way where they don't live.

19:34:54.457 --> 19:34:57.059
So that maybe only a roach
will live in these Arab lands.

19:35:06.202 --> 19:35:06.436
Alright,

19:35:06.769 --> 19:35:06.903
Rick,

19:35:07.136 --> 19:35:09.572
I held up the Redmond
Hart Commission that

19:35:09.605 --> 19:35:12.408
said we were going
to get attacked like this.

19:35:12.475 --> 19:35:14.310
We were a sitting duck
for a terrorist attack.

19:35:14.310 --> 19:35:16.579
It would hit hard
and it would hit soon.

19:35:16.646 --> 19:35:17.380
Where did we fail?

19:35:18.347 --> 19:35:20.183
I don't think that we
necessarily did fail.

19:35:20.249 --> 19:35:22.752
This is a very free nation.

19:35:22.785 --> 19:35:25.455
There's no nation in the
world where you can travel

19:35:25.455 --> 19:35:28.624
about and do the things that
you do in the United States.

19:35:43.773 --> 19:35:46.042
Today is the day
that we must wake up.

19:35:47.610 --> 19:35:49.445
I don't think I'm being
irresponsible by saying that.

19:35:49.479 --> 19:35:50.179
Absolutely not.

19:35:50.213 --> 19:35:50.713
This was,

19:35:51.047 --> 19:35:52.515
if this doesn't wake us up,

19:35:52.782 --> 19:35:53.049
you know,

19:35:53.149 --> 19:35:55.485
this is affecting
our way of life.

19:35:55.485 --> 19:35:58.654
They want to take our
way of life away from us.

19:35:58.754 --> 19:35:59.555
As we sit here now,

19:35:59.589 --> 19:36:02.859
we don't even know who is alive
and who is dead in our personal lives.

19:36:03.926 --> 19:36:04.327
We don't,

19:36:04.660 --> 19:36:06.762
especially those of us
who live here in Manhattan.

19:36:07.897 --> 19:36:10.900
And just imagine
if we capitulate,

19:36:11.434 --> 19:36:14.003
how our lives will be
affected from now on.

19:36:14.003 --> 19:36:14.770
I'll leave you with this,

19:36:14.804 --> 19:36:18.074
the military is at full threat
level and we'll see what happens.

19:36:19.575 --> 19:36:20.877
That doesn't mean
we're attacking anybody.

19:36:20.877 --> 19:36:20.977
No, No.

19:36:20.977 --> 19:36:22.612
it just means that
we're on full alert.

19:36:23.012 --> 19:36:23.980
which means nothing.

19:36:23.980 --> 19:36:25.147
Like we're waiting
for another blow.

19:36:25.848 --> 19:36:26.015
Yeah.

19:36:26.048 --> 19:36:26.816
We might catch it.

19:36:27.483 --> 19:36:29.519
How happy were you
yesterday now looking back?

19:36:30.152 --> 19:36:30.686
What does that mean?

19:36:30.953 --> 19:36:31.454
Meaning just,

19:36:31.487 --> 19:36:31.754
you know,

19:36:31.787 --> 19:36:32.121
you don't...

19:36:32.188 --> 19:36:32.889
You were carefree.

19:36:32.889 --> 19:36:33.422
Yeah.

19:36:34.190 --> 19:36:34.357
Well,

19:36:34.524 --> 19:36:35.191
and we shouldn't have been.

19:36:35.358 --> 19:36:35.858
I mean...

19:36:35.892 --> 19:36:37.426
Because today was coming.

19:36:37.426 --> 19:36:39.862
For 20 years I've been
on the radio saying this.

19:36:39.962 --> 19:36:40.530
And I'm not saying...

19:36:40.530 --> 19:36:42.565
I remember you saying this when
we first started working together.

19:36:42.565 --> 19:36:42.932
And I was like,

19:36:43.533 --> 19:36:43.733
Yeah.

19:36:43.900 --> 19:36:44.667
Stop it.

19:36:44.767 --> 19:36:45.067
I know,

19:36:45.167 --> 19:36:46.102
And I've been saying it.

19:36:46.102 --> 19:36:47.703
I said the chickens
will come home to roost.

19:36:47.770 --> 19:36:49.272
It's going to happen,

19:36:49.305 --> 19:36:51.140
And we should really
wipe out terrorism now.

19:36:51.173 --> 19:36:53.609
But we were afraid of
what France will say.

19:36:54.210 --> 19:36:56.812
The intelligence
community regularly gets all

19:36:56.846 --> 19:36:59.882
types of information
regarding potential threats.

19:37:00.917 --> 19:37:01.384
There is,

19:37:01.584 --> 19:37:02.051
however,

19:37:02.184 --> 19:37:04.820
a chasm between
freedom of speech,

19:37:04.921 --> 19:37:06.622
where people talk
about doing things,

19:37:07.123 --> 19:37:08.691
and the actual acts themselves.

19:37:09.158 --> 19:37:14.797
And it's frequently impossible to discern
whether someone is merely talking or,

19:37:15.031 --> 19:37:15.398
in fact,

19:37:16.098 --> 19:37:18.734
is planning to do some
sort of terrorist event.

19:37:19.168 --> 19:37:23.272
I suspect that if we had any sort of
information at all regarding this in advance,

19:37:23.339 --> 19:37:24.974
that it was still
being evaluated.

19:37:25.775 --> 19:37:26.142
We did,

19:37:26.142 --> 19:37:27.577
and let me turn to Joe Canameza,

19:37:27.677 --> 19:37:27.810
Rick,

19:37:27.810 --> 19:37:29.478
if you'll hang on
for just a moment.

19:37:29.979 --> 19:37:34.150
It was reported three weeks
ago by the editor of an Arab

19:37:34.183 --> 19:37:39.055
newspaper that Osama bin
Laden planned this kind of an attack.

19:37:39.555 --> 19:37:40.289
Very soon,

19:37:40.356 --> 19:37:43.059
he said it would be an
unprecedented attack.

19:38:02.244 --> 19:38:02.378
Over

19:38:02.378 --> 19:38:03.045
to Lester Holt.

19:38:03.079 --> 19:38:03.346
Lester?

19:38:04.080 --> 19:38:04.280
Greg,

19:38:04.280 --> 19:38:08.417
we are getting an idea of what air traffic
controllers may have seen this morning.

19:38:08.451 --> 19:38:10.553
The first indication
something was happening.

19:38:10.586 --> 19:38:12.254
We are going to show
you with Flight Explorer.

19:38:12.254 --> 19:38:13.489
That's American Flight 11,

19:38:13.623 --> 19:38:14.357
Boston to LA.

19:38:14.790 --> 19:38:18.394
going up upstate New York
and suddenly makes a sharp turn,

19:38:18.995 --> 19:38:19.428
180-degree heading,

19:38:19.462 --> 19:38:21.263
heading right toward
New York City.

19:38:21.297 --> 19:38:23.132
That's probably at least a

19:38:25.601 --> 19:38:26.402
20-30-minute flight there.

19:38:26.402 --> 19:38:29.872
The controllers know this plane
is not only slightly off course,

19:38:30.039 --> 19:38:30.806
way off course.

19:38:30.840 --> 19:38:30.973
This,

19:38:31.007 --> 19:38:31.240
again,

19:38:31.307 --> 19:38:32.341
from Flight Explorer,

19:38:32.375 --> 19:38:33.709
as that plane was being tracked,

19:38:34.043 --> 19:38:35.511
there it makes that sharp turn,

19:38:35.945 --> 19:38:36.812
way off course,

19:38:37.113 --> 19:38:39.048
on a beeline to New York City,

19:38:39.148 --> 19:38:42.918
where it slammed into one of the
World Trade Center towers today.

19:38:46.355 --> 19:38:47.156
Good smear it.

19:38:47.490 --> 19:38:48.691
Look at this,

19:38:51.060 --> 19:38:51.827
Yeah.

19:39:08.310 --> 19:39:13.282
That plane was scheduled to leave
about 7.45 from Boston this morning.

19:39:13.315 --> 19:39:15.384
It's not clear if that's the
one you're seeing there.

19:39:15.451 --> 19:39:15.751
Remember,

19:39:15.851 --> 19:39:20.222
two airplanes hit separate towers
and were not clear of the order yet.

19:39:20.756 --> 19:39:22.224
But this is something
I pointed out earlier,

19:39:22.291 --> 19:39:25.327
that there was indications
a good time before these

19:39:25.361 --> 19:39:28.264
attacks that something
horrible was happening.

19:39:28.364 --> 19:39:30.332
What would an air controller
do in a case like this?

19:39:30.666 --> 19:39:31.167
not a lot.

19:39:31.200 --> 19:39:33.536
You could be making radio
call after radio call to the

19:39:33.569 --> 19:39:35.905
plane when you decide
he's not listening or ignoring.

19:39:36.338 --> 19:39:38.541
All you can do is get on
the horn to other planes,

19:39:38.808 --> 19:39:39.675
clear out of the way.

19:39:39.909 --> 19:39:41.277
We don't know where
this guy is going.

19:39:41.677 --> 19:39:41.977
Clearly,

19:39:41.977 --> 19:39:44.880
he was dropping in altitude as
well as he's making this approach.

19:39:45.347 --> 19:39:46.882
This was a plane that
would have then come

19:39:46.916 --> 19:39:48.751
straight into the Newark
International Airspace,

19:39:48.818 --> 19:39:49.351
LaGuardia,

19:39:49.418 --> 19:39:49.785
JFK,

19:39:50.052 --> 19:39:50.820
all in that area.

19:39:51.187 --> 19:39:51.687
So clearly,

19:39:51.754 --> 19:39:56.592
other planes had to have been aware
that there was a rogue airplane in the sky.

19:39:56.959 --> 19:40:00.496
American Airlines only given us a brief
statement saying it lost two airplanes.

19:40:00.496 --> 19:40:05.201
We don't know the nature of any conversations
that took place between the crew,

19:40:05.401 --> 19:40:06.836
between the air
traffic controllers.

19:40:07.169 --> 19:40:10.473
They also have their own private
data links between the cockpit

19:40:10.506 --> 19:40:13.843
and the airline headquarters when
they have a mechanical problem.

19:40:14.210 --> 19:40:15.711
An airplane can squawk,

19:40:15.745 --> 19:40:16.579
what's called squawk,

19:40:16.679 --> 19:40:19.014
a certain code
on its transponder.

19:40:19.415 --> 19:40:21.484
That lights up at the
air traffic control center.

19:40:21.584 --> 19:40:23.619
It's a code that says
I'm being hijacked.

19:40:23.619 --> 19:40:24.887
There's no voice communications.

19:40:25.454 --> 19:40:29.725
But if the pilot can somehow
serotopously punch in that code,

19:40:29.759 --> 19:40:33.662
it would alert someone to at
least know this plane is in trouble.

19:40:43.205 --> 19:40:48.277
We are in the airport.

19:41:20.709 --> 19:41:22.011
It's now about 12.30.

19:41:27.716 --> 19:41:30.519
It's the hole in
the sky where the

19:41:31.854 --> 19:41:33.355
World Trade
Center used to stand.

19:41:54.810 --> 19:41:55.811
Crossed over the wires,

19:41:55.845 --> 19:41:59.882
a Navy public affairs spokesperson
telling a Washington network

19:41:59.915 --> 19:42:04.553
affiliate television station that
there are dead inside the Pentagon.

19:42:05.321 --> 19:42:08.524
One of these hijacked
planes came crashing down in

19:42:08.557 --> 19:42:11.760
what appears to be a
glancing blow on the Pentagon.

19:42:11.794 --> 19:42:12.194
In fact,

19:42:12.795 --> 19:42:16.332
NBC's Jay Barbary spoke to a
friend who works in the Pentagon.

19:42:16.832 --> 19:42:21.337
who believe that the pilot appeared to make
a deliberate nosedive into the pad area,

19:42:21.337 --> 19:42:22.338
the helipad area,

19:42:23.038 --> 19:42:25.641
in a way to avoid the
heart of the Pentagon,

19:42:25.674 --> 19:42:29.011
and perhaps it could have
been a heroic act by the pilot.

19:42:29.545 --> 19:42:31.680
From this friend of Jay
Barber's vantage point,

19:42:31.680 --> 19:42:34.817
the damage done to the Pentagon
came really from the plane's debris,

19:42:34.817 --> 19:42:36.552
so not a direct hit,

19:42:36.652 --> 19:42:39.221
perhaps a last-minute
effort by a pilot under

19:42:39.255 --> 19:42:42.358
incredible duress to save
as many lives as possible.

19:43:07.683 --> 19:43:07.950
David,

19:43:08.217 --> 19:43:11.353
I want to go to a graphic that
our viewers just saw on our air,

19:43:11.553 --> 19:43:13.889
and let's try to coordinate
this while you talk.

19:43:14.056 --> 19:43:15.724
You can explain
what we're seeing.

19:43:15.758 --> 19:43:19.128
This is from the
website Flight Tracker,

19:43:19.628 --> 19:43:21.730
which every commercial aircraft,

19:43:21.797 --> 19:43:23.432
every jet aircraft
has a transponder,

19:43:23.465 --> 19:43:28.270
which is then traced by
global positioning system.

19:43:28.337 --> 19:43:31.440
This is the American
Airlines flight out of Boston.

19:43:31.440 --> 19:43:31.573
And,

19:43:31.573 --> 19:43:31.874
David,

19:43:31.874 --> 19:43:32.808
what are we watching here?

19:43:32.808 --> 19:43:33.008
Right.

19:43:33.008 --> 19:43:34.710
This is something
I sent over to you,

19:43:34.877 --> 19:43:35.778
Flight Explorer,

19:43:35.844 --> 19:43:36.712
which developed this.

19:43:37.479 --> 19:43:39.048
out in Virginia
sent this over to me.

19:43:39.081 --> 19:43:40.316
They reconstructed this.

19:43:40.382 --> 19:43:43.385
This is the flight track
of American Airlines.

19:43:43.519 --> 19:43:49.491
flight number 11 as it came out of Boston
and was heading on its route to Los Angeles.

19:43:49.525 --> 19:43:50.893
You'll see four lines there.

19:43:51.327 --> 19:43:52.895
The top line is
the airline number,

19:43:52.962 --> 19:43:54.930
American Airlines
flight number 11.

19:43:55.397 --> 19:43:56.231
The next line,

19:43:56.365 --> 19:43:57.232
the left number,

19:43:57.333 --> 19:43:59.401
is the altitude at
which the aircraft is at.

19:43:59.868 --> 19:44:02.338
The right number in that
second line is the airspeed.

19:44:02.838 --> 19:44:05.407
The third line shows
the originating point,

19:44:05.507 --> 19:44:05.975
Boston,

19:44:06.075 --> 19:44:08.243
and its scheduled
destination point,

19:44:08.277 --> 19:44:08.978
Los Angeles.

19:44:09.578 --> 19:44:11.647
The last line shows
the aircraft type,

19:44:11.647 --> 19:44:14.283
in this case a Boeing 767-200,

19:44:14.917 --> 19:44:19.855
and the proposed arrival time
in Los Angeles in eastern time,

19:44:19.888 --> 19:44:20.489
at that point,

19:44:20.489 --> 19:44:22.491
149.

19:44:22.658 --> 19:44:24.593
As we track the
airplane out of Boston,

19:44:24.626 --> 19:44:28.330
it seems to be making a normal
departure out of the Boston area.

19:44:28.364 --> 19:44:30.933
I know your screen shows
beyond this at this point.

19:44:31.400 --> 19:44:32.568
When it gets back to Boston,

19:44:33.135 --> 19:44:33.902
let's start again.

19:44:34.403 --> 19:44:35.571
It's coming out of Boston,

19:44:35.637 --> 19:44:36.338
turns west,

19:44:36.405 --> 19:44:38.073
going through
western Massachusetts,

19:44:38.574 --> 19:44:39.441
going into upstate

19:44:39.575 --> 19:44:43.445
New York above Albany and it
makes a very hard left turn there.

19:44:43.979 --> 19:44:47.016
Now the folks at Flight
Tracker have indicated

19:44:47.049 --> 19:44:50.085
to me that that plane
made that turn at 828 a.m.

19:44:50.152 --> 19:44:52.354
according to the data
they received from the FAA.

19:44:53.188 --> 19:44:54.156
The flight coordinates

19:44:54.556 --> 19:44:57.326
We're 42.8 north,

19:44:57.693 --> 19:44:59.495
74.15 west.

19:45:00.462 --> 19:45:04.199
Now what's also quite interesting
in this tracking is you'll see that

19:45:04.199 --> 19:45:07.936
when the airplane did come out of
Boston and start heading out west,

19:45:08.437 --> 19:45:09.171
it was climbing.

19:45:09.271 --> 19:45:12.975
to twenty nine thousand feet
apparently on its way to a higher

19:45:13.008 --> 19:45:16.745
altitude on that classic northern
route by the way david that

19:45:16.745 --> 19:45:20.182
would have taken it across
the continent right and up over

19:45:20.215 --> 19:45:24.219
chicago perhaps and down into
los angeles great circle route right

19:45:24.253 --> 19:45:25.387
What we start to notice,

19:45:25.387 --> 19:45:27.489
and I've had a chance to be
able to look at this at some time,

19:45:27.523 --> 19:45:27.856
Brian,

19:45:28.524 --> 19:45:32.461
it was at a steady cruising
speed of about 457 knots.

19:45:33.128 --> 19:45:36.765
Just before or apparently
around the time of the hijacking,

19:45:37.232 --> 19:45:38.867
the speed gets very erratic.

19:45:38.934 --> 19:45:40.869
It goes to 427 knots,

19:45:41.437 --> 19:45:44.506
drops about 100 knots
down to 340 knots.

19:45:44.573 --> 19:45:46.742
Maybe that's when they were
getting control of the airplane.

19:45:47.376 --> 19:45:49.111
Back up to 470 knots,

19:45:49.211 --> 19:45:51.146
up to 495 knots,

19:45:51.747 --> 19:45:53.315
up over 500 knots.

19:45:53.348 --> 19:45:53.615
Thank you.

19:45:54.049 --> 19:45:54.950
493,

19:45:54.950 --> 19:45:55.751
441,

19:45:55.884 --> 19:45:56.652
407,

19:45:56.952 --> 19:45:57.953
396,

19:45:58.654 --> 19:45:59.855
390 knots,

19:45:59.855 --> 19:46:01.623
and then finally
on the last readout,

19:46:02.224 --> 19:46:03.525
313 knots.

19:46:03.992 --> 19:46:05.360
This is quite a
dramatic picture.

19:46:05.627 --> 19:46:06.061
And you know,

19:46:06.128 --> 19:46:06.462
Brian,

19:46:06.495 --> 19:46:10.199
that we would have not seen
any kind of tracking like this coming

19:46:10.232 --> 19:46:13.936
out of an NTSB investigation for
months and months and months.

19:46:14.002 --> 19:46:14.503
That's right,

19:46:14.570 --> 19:46:15.871
and that's the advantage here.

19:46:16.305 --> 19:46:16.939
It's ghoulish,

19:46:16.972 --> 19:46:18.974
but we get to see what happened.

19:46:19.108 --> 19:46:19.241
And

19:46:20.042 --> 19:46:23.879
I don't know if people can
appreciate how severe a turn that is.

19:46:23.946 --> 19:46:32.421
is on an aircraft that big and to go from
456 to 340 in terms of speed while turning,

19:46:32.521 --> 19:46:34.756
it must have been an emergency.

19:46:34.823 --> 19:46:34.923
And,

19:46:34.923 --> 19:46:35.290
of course,

19:46:35.324 --> 19:46:36.024
now we know.

19:46:36.191 --> 19:46:36.458
David,

19:46:36.458 --> 19:46:38.026
we'll return to this
topic in one second.

19:46:38.060 --> 19:46:38.794
Hold there with me.

19:46:39.361 --> 19:46:39.561
Okay.

19:46:41.697 --> 19:46:42.464
A man in a white car,

19:46:42.464 --> 19:46:43.799
who is in a hurry
to go to the hospital,

19:46:43.799 --> 19:46:46.468
was taken to the hospital by a man
who was in a hurry to go to the hospital.

19:46:46.468 --> 19:46:54.710
The man was taken to the hospital by a man
who was in a hurry to go to the hospital.

19:46:55.110 --> 19:46:56.879
This brings us back
to David Stempler.

19:46:57.146 --> 19:46:57.513
David,

19:46:58.514 --> 19:46:59.648
four people,

19:46:59.915 --> 19:47:01.717
and perhaps more than that,

19:47:02.217 --> 19:47:04.987
got on four commercial
flights this morning,

19:47:05.821 --> 19:47:06.488
diverted them,

19:47:07.289 --> 19:47:08.390
killed themselves,

19:47:08.624 --> 19:47:09.992
and everyone on board.

19:47:10.726 --> 19:47:11.493
What does that mean to you?

19:47:14.563 --> 19:47:15.564
Have we lost David Stentler?

19:47:16.231 --> 19:47:16.632
Brian?

19:47:16.798 --> 19:47:17.032
Yes,

19:47:17.065 --> 19:47:17.299
David.

19:47:17.432 --> 19:47:17.599
Yes.

19:47:18.133 --> 19:47:20.202
I don't know how we can
assess this at this point,

19:47:20.202 --> 19:47:21.003
and I'll tell you why.

19:47:21.770 --> 19:47:22.638
What we have,

19:47:22.638 --> 19:47:25.641
and the kind of domestic
airline security that we have,

19:47:25.774 --> 19:47:28.644
is really set up to
manage a hijacked...

19:47:28.911 --> 19:47:32.047
situation using
metal type weapons,

19:47:32.748 --> 19:47:34.116
whether it's guns or knives.

19:47:34.850 --> 19:47:36.919
I talked with a security
colleague this morning.

19:47:36.985 --> 19:47:39.588
What could have happened
is you could have put 10,

19:47:39.721 --> 19:47:40.122
15,

19:47:40.189 --> 19:47:41.790
20 people on this airplane.

19:47:42.291 --> 19:47:43.559
They could have overpowered.

19:47:43.792 --> 19:47:46.595
any amount of people without
any guns or any weapons.

19:47:47.062 --> 19:47:50.699
But I would assume that what has happened
here is that these were not the pilots,

19:47:51.333 --> 19:47:53.001
the American or
United Airlines pilots.

19:47:53.101 --> 19:47:57.105
I believe that those pilots were
taken out somehow and placed in the

19:47:57.139 --> 19:48:01.710
seats were these terrorist pilots who
actually focused on these buildings.

19:48:01.743 --> 19:48:05.981
So I don't know how you deal with that
kind of threat assessment at this point.

19:48:07.916 --> 19:48:09.284
Airport outside Pittsburgh,

19:48:09.318 --> 19:48:10.052
Pennsylvania.

19:48:10.185 --> 19:48:16.158
An earlier report that an aircraft had
crashed into Camp David has now been put down.

19:48:16.992 --> 19:48:20.429
This is a picture of the
wreckage near Pittsburgh,

19:48:20.462 --> 19:48:21.163
Pennsylvania.

19:48:22.798 --> 19:48:26.902
We also cannot forget that
the most crushing human drama

19:48:26.935 --> 19:48:31.039
is taking place at this
hour in the city of New York.

19:48:32.207 --> 19:48:38.080
What side of the overpass?

19:48:38.914 --> 19:48:43.452
It's been theorized that
because of just how these planes

19:48:43.485 --> 19:48:47.990
acted today that it would
have taken more even then uh...

19:48:48.156 --> 19:48:50.058
someone with a gun
to the head of the pilot

19:48:50.626 --> 19:48:55.130
To make a commercial airline
pilot aim for and blow through,

19:48:55.897 --> 19:48:56.598
for starters,

19:48:57.099 --> 19:49:00.002
one of the two towers of
the Twin Towers in New York,

19:49:00.035 --> 19:49:03.472
that they had to be
overpowered and replaced,

19:49:03.605 --> 19:49:06.975
and that adds yet another dimension
to what we're covering here today,

19:49:07.042 --> 19:49:09.778
that these hijackers
were perhaps,

19:49:10.045 --> 19:49:10.712
some would say,

19:49:10.946 --> 19:49:15.450
were likely trained
commercial airline pilots,

19:49:15.584 --> 19:49:18.787
and flying aircraft the size
we're talking about today.

19:49:19.288 --> 19:49:24.026
is not a skill possessed by every person
walking around the face of the earth.

19:49:50.185 --> 19:49:57.526
Wait a minute.

19:50:01.763 --> 19:50:02.164
Wait a minute.

19:50:13.375 --> 19:50:14.876
Paul Begala is with us today,

19:50:14.976 --> 19:50:16.211
and for all the wrong reasons.

19:50:16.278 --> 19:50:16.478
Paul,

19:50:16.511 --> 19:50:17.179
what did you see?

19:50:17.245 --> 19:50:17.646
Where were you?

19:50:18.113 --> 19:50:18.380
Brian,

19:50:18.380 --> 19:50:20.182
I was on the Boundary
Channel Drive,

19:50:20.449 --> 19:50:23.151
which runs northeast
of the Pentagon,

19:50:23.352 --> 19:50:24.353
along the Potomac River,

19:50:24.853 --> 19:50:26.088
alongside one of
the parking lots.

19:50:26.088 --> 19:50:28.223
And I was looking over at the
building and thinking about...

19:50:28.290 --> 19:50:30.525
about those counterterrorism
folks who were going to be meeting

19:50:30.559 --> 19:50:32.794
there in the tank as I was
driving to a meeting on Capitol Hill.

19:50:33.595 --> 19:50:35.163
And as I looked at the building,

19:50:35.197 --> 19:50:36.398
I didn't see any aircraft,

19:50:36.398 --> 19:50:38.600
but I saw an enormous fireball,

19:50:38.967 --> 19:50:41.136
red and orange
fireball that shot at least

19:50:41.169 --> 19:50:43.739
twice the height of
the building into the air.

19:50:44.673 --> 19:50:45.607
That was then followed,

19:50:45.607 --> 19:50:45.941
of course,

19:50:45.974 --> 19:50:48.643
by huge plumes of
thick black smoke.

19:50:49.778 --> 19:50:52.481
Two other men were
driving alongside me,

19:50:52.481 --> 19:50:53.782
and they pulled over as I did.

19:50:54.549 --> 19:50:54.950
One of them,

19:50:55.217 --> 19:50:56.785
they were on their cell
phones immediately.

19:50:57.219 --> 19:50:59.187
One of them said he thought
maybe it was a chopper.

19:50:59.354 --> 19:51:00.789
And I do know
there's a helipad there.

19:51:00.856 --> 19:51:01.523
I've landed on it.

19:51:01.623 --> 19:51:04.226
And I hoped against hope
that it was just an accident,

19:51:04.826 --> 19:51:05.494
not an attack.

19:51:06.061 --> 19:51:07.929
Another man who was
beside me was on a phone.

19:51:08.830 --> 19:51:11.133
He looked for all
the world to be a trim,

19:51:11.166 --> 19:51:12.100
young fighter pilot.

19:51:12.134 --> 19:51:12.467
He said,

19:51:12.534 --> 19:51:12.667
no,

19:51:12.801 --> 19:51:13.535
we're under attack.

19:51:13.635 --> 19:51:14.403
We're going to war.

19:51:14.503 --> 19:51:15.937
And he sped off
into the parking lot.

19:51:18.273 --> 19:51:20.275
Mayor Giuliani is
with us at the moment.

19:51:20.509 --> 19:51:20.709
Mr. Mayor,

19:51:20.876 --> 19:51:21.376
can you hear me?

19:51:21.510 --> 19:51:21.777
I can,

19:51:21.877 --> 19:51:22.077
Peter.

19:51:22.244 --> 19:51:22.444
Mr. Mayor,

19:51:22.577 --> 19:51:24.713
I saw you several
times on the street today,

19:51:24.746 --> 19:51:28.984
and it looked like you were deeply
sharing the horror that all of us feel.

19:51:28.984 --> 19:51:30.352
But I'd really appreciate,

19:51:30.886 --> 19:51:33.688
aside from on top of your
sentiments about all this,

19:51:34.089 --> 19:51:35.457
give us some sense
of what's going on.

19:51:35.891 --> 19:51:38.593
What is going on now is
a massive rescue effort.

19:51:38.894 --> 19:51:42.264
We have thousands of police
officers and firefighters in all of

19:51:42.297 --> 19:51:45.700
Manhattan trying to rescue as
many people as we possibly can.

19:51:46.835 --> 19:51:48.970
There are still a lot of
people there that are injured,

19:51:49.004 --> 19:51:49.237
hurt,

19:51:50.172 --> 19:51:50.639
dazed,

19:51:50.705 --> 19:51:51.907
and we're trying
to get them out.

19:51:52.040 --> 19:51:54.810
And we're mobilizing
all of our fire,

19:51:54.876 --> 19:51:55.177
police,

19:51:55.177 --> 19:51:56.812
and emergency
resources to do that.

19:51:57.045 --> 19:51:59.347
The governor has
alerted the National Guard,

19:51:59.815 --> 19:52:03.919
and they're being deployed to come and
relieve us early to later this afternoon.

19:52:04.886 --> 19:52:07.989
And the urban search and
rescue teams are coming

19:52:08.023 --> 19:52:11.126
here from around the
country to also assist us.

19:52:11.159 --> 19:52:11.827
But until then,

19:52:11.893 --> 19:52:13.261
which means until probably 2,

19:52:13.328 --> 19:52:13.595
3,

19:52:13.862 --> 19:52:14.930
4 o'clock this afternoon,

19:52:15.697 --> 19:52:16.364
our police department,

19:52:16.531 --> 19:52:17.365
our fire department,

19:52:17.399 --> 19:52:19.935
and our emergency people
are being stretched out.

19:52:19.968 --> 19:52:26.341
to the limit and i'm sure we've
also lost a significant number of

19:52:26.374 --> 19:52:32.714
them and we were in a building
in which we were trapped for about

19:52:33.582 --> 19:52:37.519
10-15 minutes are you talking about the
uh did you go immediately to the office of

19:52:37.552 --> 19:52:41.490
emergency management i i went down to
the scene and we set up headquarters at 75

19:52:49.097 --> 19:52:51.733
We were told that the World
Trade Center was going to collapse.

19:52:52.567 --> 19:52:55.303
And it did collapse before we
could actually get out of the building.

19:52:55.537 --> 19:52:57.506
So we were trapped
in the building for 10,

19:52:57.572 --> 19:53:00.976
15 minutes and finally
found an exit and got out,

19:53:01.510 --> 19:53:02.110
walked north,

19:53:02.277 --> 19:53:03.345
and took a lot
of people with us.

19:53:03.512 --> 19:53:07.115
My question is the Office of Emergency
Management headquarters into

19:53:07.148 --> 19:53:11.119
which you put enormous effort for
coordination in a disaster like this,

19:53:11.152 --> 19:53:12.153
has it been damaged?

19:53:12.153 --> 19:53:13.088
Is it still operating?

19:53:13.121 --> 19:53:13.655
It's gone?

19:53:13.922 --> 19:53:16.024
It's been damaged.

19:53:16.091 --> 19:53:16.925
I don't know how badly.

19:53:17.792 --> 19:53:19.628
and right now that
whole area of Manhattan

19:53:19.928 --> 19:53:21.129
including the police department,

19:53:21.162 --> 19:53:22.864
which is another area
we would operate from,

19:53:22.931 --> 19:53:25.534
City Hall is another area
we would operate from,

19:53:25.567 --> 19:53:26.401
have been closed off.

19:53:26.568 --> 19:53:29.170
So we've moved to a
secure location in midtown

19:53:29.204 --> 19:53:31.806
Manhattan where we're
operating city government.

19:53:34.209 --> 19:53:34.709
A terrible,

19:53:34.743 --> 19:53:37.479
terrible tragedy has
befallen my nation,

19:53:37.512 --> 19:53:39.481
but it has befallen all
the nations of this region,

19:53:39.514 --> 19:53:40.615
all the nations of the world,

19:53:41.716 --> 19:53:44.185
and befallen all those
who believe in democracy.

19:53:45.820 --> 19:53:46.288
Once again,

19:53:46.388 --> 19:53:48.623
we see terrorism,

19:53:48.657 --> 19:53:49.691
we see terrorists,

19:53:49.724 --> 19:53:51.927
people who don't
believe in democracy,

19:53:52.060 --> 19:53:56.932
people who believe that with
the destruction of buildings,

19:53:57.098 --> 19:53:59.801
with the murder of people,

19:53:59.834 --> 19:54:02.604
they can somehow
achieve a political purpose.

19:54:03.305 --> 19:54:04.539
They can destroy buildings,

19:54:04.606 --> 19:54:05.707
they can kill people,

19:54:05.941 --> 19:54:06.608
and we will...

19:54:07.742 --> 19:54:09.210
be saddened by this tragedy,

19:54:09.311 --> 19:54:12.714
but they will never be allowed
to kill the spirit of democracy.

19:54:13.515 --> 19:54:15.850
They cannot destroy our society.

19:54:15.917 --> 19:54:17.686
They cannot destroy
our belief in the...

19:54:17.719 --> 19:54:19.354
Democratic way.

19:54:19.854 --> 19:54:22.023
What you thought at
the time about all this?

19:54:22.490 --> 19:54:23.325
I thought that

19:54:24.092 --> 19:54:25.527
I would never live to
see anything like this.

19:54:26.261 --> 19:54:29.064
I didn't think anything
like this was possible.

19:54:29.397 --> 19:54:30.498
When I first arrived there,

19:54:31.132 --> 19:54:33.668
I rushed down there from
midtown Manhattan and I

19:54:33.702 --> 19:54:36.237
saw the first building that
had been crashed open.

19:54:37.172 --> 19:54:39.941
And when you look at it,

19:54:39.941 --> 19:54:43.244
it takes you a minute to really
comprehend that this is actually happening.

19:54:45.280 --> 19:54:50.185
and to see people jumping from
the top of the World Trade Center.

19:54:50.352 --> 19:54:52.253
I don't think I've ever had a
nightmare that's worse than this.

19:54:53.955 --> 19:54:54.189
Mr. Mayor,

19:54:54.389 --> 19:54:55.156
one last question.

19:54:56.224 --> 19:54:59.461
You said you never believed
you'd live to see anything like this,

19:54:59.527 --> 19:55:02.430
and yet in the past you've
been one of the leaders

19:55:02.430 --> 19:55:05.333
in preparing for just this
kind of thing to happen.

19:55:05.467 --> 19:55:05.600
Yeah,

19:55:05.667 --> 19:55:09.137
but you prepare for the worst,

19:55:09.804 --> 19:55:11.006
but you don't believe
that it'll happen,

19:55:11.640 --> 19:55:12.374
and this is the worst.

19:55:13.308 --> 19:55:13.642
And

19:55:14.476 --> 19:55:15.410
I can only say that

19:55:15.977 --> 19:55:18.713
I thank God for the police department
and the fire department that we have,

19:55:18.813 --> 19:55:21.516
because this would be much,

19:55:21.583 --> 19:55:22.050
much worse.

19:55:45.440 --> 19:55:45.840
Obviously.

19:55:46.207 --> 19:55:47.742
We're joined also in
the studio this morning,

19:55:48.143 --> 19:55:49.044
or this afternoon rather,

19:55:49.044 --> 19:55:49.878
by Bill Heitman,

19:55:49.944 --> 19:55:52.280
who was in one of the
towers when this happened.

19:55:52.280 --> 19:55:52.580
And Bill,

19:55:53.281 --> 19:55:55.984
after hearing Jim Hoffer
and seeing him running

19:55:55.984 --> 19:55:58.687
from the scene there
as the building collapsed,

19:55:59.187 --> 19:55:59.988
I was wondering,

19:56:00.088 --> 19:56:02.457
as you were trying to get out,

19:56:02.490 --> 19:56:04.726
you were in the darkened
stairwell for an hour,

19:56:05.093 --> 19:56:08.897
did it ever cross your mind
that the building might collapse?

19:56:09.064 --> 19:56:10.098
Absolutely not.

19:56:10.432 --> 19:56:11.199
As a matter of fact,

19:56:13.935 --> 19:56:17.272
there was good
spirit in the stairwell.

19:56:17.706 --> 19:56:18.273
I mean,

19:56:18.339 --> 19:56:21.676
I can honestly say we
were having some laughs.

19:56:21.743 --> 19:56:21.976
You know,

19:56:22.010 --> 19:56:23.011
we were just getting down,

19:56:23.044 --> 19:56:23.945
making the best of it.

19:56:24.412 --> 19:56:25.280
Some people had to...

19:56:26.414 --> 19:56:28.116
it was more urgent
for them to get down,

19:56:28.216 --> 19:56:29.284
so we would all call out,

19:56:29.718 --> 19:56:30.518
move to the right,

19:56:31.052 --> 19:56:32.520
and they would proceed down.

19:56:33.154 --> 19:56:34.289
But there was no panic,

19:56:34.322 --> 19:56:35.924
and there was generally,

19:56:36.791 --> 19:56:38.193
considering the circumstances,

19:56:38.326 --> 19:56:39.494
good spirit in the stairwell.

19:56:39.627 --> 19:56:39.761
Again,

19:56:39.761 --> 19:56:40.395
as you said earlier,

19:56:40.395 --> 19:56:43.331
it didn't seem to be as
bad as the other explosion,

19:56:43.331 --> 19:56:43.998
the first explosion.

19:56:44.099 --> 19:56:46.334
Absolutely not.

19:56:46.434 --> 19:56:49.938
So no clue and no panic
as you were going down.

19:56:50.038 --> 19:56:50.605
No panic.

19:56:51.606 --> 19:56:54.209
The thought of the
building collapsing or

19:56:54.209 --> 19:56:57.412
being in any more danger
never crossed my mind.

19:56:57.612 --> 19:56:57.846
And then, Bill,

19:56:58.012 --> 19:56:59.013
you said it wasn't.

19:56:59.714 --> 19:56:59.914
Sorry.

19:57:00.115 --> 19:57:00.281
Jim,

19:57:00.281 --> 19:57:03.118
I'm sorry to interrupt because I want to
just point out in this live picture here,

19:57:03.351 --> 19:57:05.720
what you're looking at is
damage to an adjoining building.

19:57:06.187 --> 19:57:06.721
Obviously,

19:57:06.788 --> 19:57:07.822
the impact of this.

19:57:08.356 --> 19:57:09.958
not just to those twin towers,

19:57:09.958 --> 19:57:11.326
but also to adjoining buildings.

19:57:11.960 --> 19:57:13.728
And it looks
like there is still,

19:57:14.062 --> 19:57:14.362
obviously,

19:57:14.562 --> 19:57:14.929
smoke,

19:57:14.929 --> 19:57:16.731
and I think I saw some
flames there as well,

19:57:16.798 --> 19:57:16.998
Jim.

19:57:17.699 --> 19:57:19.901
So clearly there
is still damage.

19:57:19.934 --> 19:57:22.303
They're all bunched up so
closely together down there,

19:57:22.370 --> 19:57:22.737
obviously,

19:57:22.871 --> 19:57:26.775
and there was bound
to be collateral damage

19:57:26.775 --> 19:57:30.712
in the neighboring
businesses and buildings.

19:57:31.146 --> 19:57:31.312
Bill,

19:57:31.713 --> 19:57:34.749
as you were going down
that darkened stairwell,

19:57:35.049 --> 19:57:38.119
and you say you had no thought
that the building might collapse,

19:57:38.153 --> 19:57:40.555
was that because you had
faith in the integrity of the

19:57:40.588 --> 19:57:43.458
building or simply because you
did not know what was going on?

19:57:43.458 --> 19:57:45.827
I had no idea the magnitude
of the crash above us.

19:57:46.494 --> 19:57:49.264
We didn't know anything
had happened over in two.

19:57:49.798 --> 19:57:52.033
We thought it was
just us and one.

19:57:52.600 --> 19:57:55.703
And as the further we got down,

19:57:55.770 --> 19:58:00.041
you figure you're 94s
away from the worst of it.

19:58:00.675 --> 19:58:03.278
I figured when we came out
into the concourse level of the

19:58:03.311 --> 19:58:06.247
building that everything would
appear to be relatively normal.

19:58:06.748 --> 19:58:09.117
But when we got down
into the concourse level,

19:58:09.150 --> 19:58:10.952
which is very much
like a shopping mall,

19:58:12.687 --> 19:58:14.189
it was just flooded.

19:58:15.456 --> 19:58:18.259
And emergency
personnel were very,

19:58:18.326 --> 19:58:20.562
very urgently trying to
get us out of the building.

19:58:20.829 --> 19:58:24.599
So were people milling around down there
trying to check on others in the building?

19:58:24.666 --> 19:58:24.799
No,

19:58:24.899 --> 19:58:26.768
as soon as you came
out of the stairwell,

19:58:27.502 --> 19:58:28.803
there was great urgency.

19:58:29.037 --> 19:58:29.370
just...

19:58:29.904 --> 19:58:30.972
Personnel just,

19:58:31.206 --> 19:58:33.141
just go that way,

19:58:33.241 --> 19:58:33.741
go that way,

19:58:33.775 --> 19:58:34.676
get out,

19:58:34.676 --> 19:58:37.478
and everybody was just
walking through water.

19:58:37.545 --> 19:58:37.779
Sir,

19:58:37.846 --> 19:58:39.280
can I ask you to stand
by for just a moment?

19:58:41.449 --> 19:58:42.550
So much smoke.

19:58:43.718 --> 19:58:49.457
We want to go now to the firefighter who was
on the scene and hear what he has to say.

19:58:54.963 --> 19:58:59.934
I saw people originally coming
out the window and I was,

19:59:00.668 --> 19:59:02.503
at that time I was
quite upset about it,

19:59:03.037 --> 19:59:03.271
that

19:59:04.672 --> 19:59:05.673
I thought we
should get in there.

19:59:06.674 --> 19:59:09.143
But then the
explosion on the South,

19:59:10.445 --> 19:59:11.946
World Trade Center,

19:59:11.946 --> 19:59:13.915
happened and I said this
is something we have to do,

19:59:13.915 --> 19:59:14.816
we have to back out.

19:59:15.516 --> 19:59:18.253
We backed out over
here and even then,

19:59:19.020 --> 19:59:21.222
I saw the squad again
in the second explosion.

19:59:22.657 --> 19:59:23.458
...as possible.

19:59:23.524 --> 19:59:25.660
You're looking at a live picture
from Newscopter 7 right now,

19:59:25.927 --> 19:59:29.063
and of course you can see that
there is fire in adjacent buildings.

19:59:29.097 --> 19:59:29.864
There is problems,

19:59:30.265 --> 19:59:30.899
serious problems,

19:59:30.965 --> 19:59:32.700
still in that area down
in Lower Manhattan.

19:59:32.834 --> 19:59:33.635
We're up to the elevator.

19:59:33.635 --> 19:59:34.469
The 24th floor,

19:59:34.469 --> 19:59:35.436
as soon as we get up there,

19:59:35.436 --> 19:59:35.904
the elevator,

19:59:36.437 --> 19:59:37.438
the elevator get out.

19:59:38.806 --> 19:59:39.107
Power,

19:59:39.107 --> 19:59:40.375
we lost power in the elevator.

19:59:40.775 --> 19:59:42.777
Thank God we kept one of
the truck guys there and he

19:59:42.810 --> 19:59:45.113
forced the door and then we
walked away down the stairs.

19:59:45.647 --> 19:59:46.848
As we came down the stairs,

19:59:46.915 --> 19:59:48.516
we were just dragging
people along with us.

19:59:48.650 --> 19:59:49.851
And then when we came outside,

19:59:50.418 --> 19:59:50.985
it just blew,

19:59:50.985 --> 19:59:54.422
the tower blew and I found the
mask on the floor as I was crawling.

20:00:09.804 --> 20:00:11.706
Do you know anything
about the cause of the

20:00:11.739 --> 20:00:14.142
explosions that brought
the two buildings down yet?

20:00:14.208 --> 20:00:16.344
Was it caused by the
planes or by something else?

20:00:18.880 --> 20:00:21.950
We believe that it
was caused by the after

20:00:21.983 --> 20:00:25.019
effects of the planes
hitting the buildings.

20:00:25.420 --> 20:00:27.522
We don't know of an
additional explosion after that.

20:00:27.989 --> 20:00:28.556
It's weird.

20:00:29.257 --> 20:00:29.857
Could you tell us,

20:00:29.924 --> 20:00:32.160
do you expect any further
attacks on New York?

20:00:32.193 --> 20:00:35.196
Is there anything to indicate
that there could be more bombs,

20:00:35.263 --> 20:00:36.431
more planes out there?

20:00:36.464 --> 20:00:40.134
I know originally there was a report
that eight planes had been hijacked,

20:00:40.168 --> 20:00:42.070
four have only
been accounted for.

20:00:42.103 --> 20:00:43.271
What about the remaining four,

20:00:43.371 --> 20:00:46.507
and is there any possibility that
there could be bombs on the ground?

20:00:47.475 --> 20:00:50.044
We have no specific
information to that effect.

20:00:50.111 --> 20:00:53.548
Do we know anything about the composition
of that dust that flag was blown in half?

20:00:53.581 --> 20:00:56.351
Is there any asbestos or any
hazardous material in that dust?

20:00:56.951 --> 20:00:58.553
I don't know.

20:00:58.686 --> 20:00:59.454
I don't know the answer to that.

20:00:59.454 --> 20:00:59.487
Mr. Mayor,

20:00:59.620 --> 20:01:01.255
are you aware of a gas
explosion related to this?

20:01:01.389 --> 20:01:07.562
There was a gas
leak or possible...

20:01:07.729 --> 20:01:08.696
We don't believe
that's the case.

20:01:08.730 --> 20:01:09.097
Mr. Mayor,

20:01:09.864 --> 20:01:12.133
can you tell us anything about
where the planes come from,

20:01:12.400 --> 20:01:13.434
where the aircraft came from?

20:01:13.901 --> 20:01:17.505
Bill Diamond reminds me that we've
turned off the gas in the city buildings,

20:01:17.672 --> 20:01:18.206
just to be certain.

20:01:18.272 --> 20:01:18.639
Can you...

20:01:30.151 --> 20:01:31.085
Somebody got a stuck mic.

20:01:53.474 --> 20:01:54.208
And now we join

20:01:54.575 --> 20:01:57.812
Paddy O'Connell again in New York with
the latest news of what's happening there.

20:01:57.879 --> 20:01:58.146
Paddy.

20:01:59.647 --> 20:02:03.351
I think David what's becoming
clear is that this is not over.

20:02:03.451 --> 20:02:04.185
That is to say,

20:02:04.852 --> 20:02:06.654
if you look at the
pictures of Manhattan,

20:02:07.522 --> 20:02:08.890
downtown where it happened,

20:02:09.357 --> 20:02:12.093
the mayor has evacuated
part of Lower Manhattan.

20:02:12.160 --> 20:02:13.361
That will be no surprise,

20:02:13.394 --> 20:02:15.596
but if you think back
a step as to why,

20:02:16.164 --> 20:02:18.566
it's because buildings
remain unstable.

20:02:19.367 --> 20:02:21.836
This is the scene around
the building that collapsed,

20:02:21.869 --> 20:02:24.238
but the question being
asked is what about the

20:02:24.272 --> 20:02:26.941
buildings that were
standing immediately after it?

20:02:27.408 --> 20:02:27.975
Now I don't, I don't,

20:02:28.009 --> 20:02:29.644
where I'm sitting in
midtown Manhattan,

20:02:29.710 --> 20:02:31.045
have an answer to that question,

20:02:31.446 --> 20:02:34.615
but I'm afraid this question is
the one that's preoccupying us

20:02:34.649 --> 20:02:37.819
because underneath the rubble
is the answer to the question.

20:02:38.319 --> 20:02:40.288
How many people
have lost their lives?

20:02:43.024 --> 20:02:46.594
we know there are disgusted
people all across this country,

20:02:46.694 --> 20:02:48.596
and here there are
people trying to get home.

20:02:48.963 --> 20:02:49.964
But as I speak to you,

20:02:50.031 --> 20:02:50.431
David,

20:02:50.932 --> 20:02:55.269
we don't know the answer to the
question of the scale of the human tragedy.

20:02:55.570 --> 20:02:56.370
The analysis,

20:02:56.637 --> 20:02:57.705
important as it is,

20:02:58.239 --> 20:02:59.073
will be had,

20:02:59.407 --> 20:03:01.409
but the figures on people,

20:03:01.943 --> 20:03:02.944
we just don't know.

20:03:04.212 --> 20:03:07.682
And what sort of flow
of information is there?

20:03:07.682 --> 20:03:09.217
You say nothing is really known,

20:03:09.283 --> 20:03:10.084
but is everybody,

20:03:11.319 --> 20:03:15.356
Is information still coming out from
the World Trade Centre down there?

20:03:16.491 --> 20:03:19.260
We have an unconfirmed
report of a building collapse.

20:03:19.393 --> 20:03:22.663
In times like this you want to hear
directly from the city authorities.

20:03:23.030 --> 20:03:26.467
I passed one of the major
hospitals four hours ago.

20:03:26.834 --> 20:03:29.237
They were shouting for
blood donations in the street.

20:03:29.470 --> 20:03:32.273
We have an unconfirmed
report of a building collapse.

20:03:32.306 --> 20:03:35.209
In times like this you want to hear
directly from the city authorities.

20:03:39.280 --> 20:03:40.381
We'll leave it there
for the moment.

20:03:40.781 --> 20:03:42.850
We've got some news
just coming in actually.

20:03:43.351 --> 20:03:43.718
That the

20:03:44.085 --> 20:03:46.821
Salomon Brothers
building in New York,

20:03:46.954 --> 20:03:49.223
right in the heart of Manhattan,

20:03:49.457 --> 20:03:51.325
has also collapsed.

20:03:52.293 --> 20:03:56.764
This does fit in with a warning
from the British Foreign Office a

20:03:56.797 --> 20:04:01.269
couple of hours ago to British
citizens that there is a real risk.

20:04:02.170 --> 20:04:03.471
Let me get the exact words.

20:04:03.771 --> 20:04:04.872
The British Foreign Office,

20:04:04.906 --> 20:04:06.607
the Foreign Department
of the British Government,

20:04:06.641 --> 20:04:11.245
said there was a strong risk of
further atrocities in the United States.

20:04:11.646 --> 20:04:14.749
And it does seem as if
there now is another one

20:04:14.749 --> 20:04:17.852
with the Salomon
Brothers building collapsing.

20:04:17.952 --> 20:04:20.655
We've got no word
yet on casualties.

20:04:21.322 --> 20:04:25.326
One assumes that the building
would have been virtually deserted.

20:04:25.726 --> 20:04:29.330
Whether this latest collapse is
going to influence the President,

20:04:29.397 --> 20:04:32.700
who we heard about a few
moments ago was expected

20:04:32.700 --> 20:04:36.003
to be heading from
Nebraska back to Washington,

20:04:37.038 --> 20:04:37.572
we don't know.

20:07:40.488 --> 20:07:40.688
Okay,

20:07:41.389 --> 20:07:41.989
let's go.

20:07:46.761 --> 20:07:46.894
No, no.

20:07:47.561 --> 20:07:49.797
Go low to the corner.

20:08:23.497 --> 20:08:24.465
Very difficult to breathe here,

20:08:28.569 --> 20:08:30.571
Car after car after car.

20:08:31.672 --> 20:08:32.106
Behind me, Behind me.

20:08:32.173 --> 20:08:32.973
That gave me hope.

20:08:33.107 --> 20:08:44.618
That's where one
of the two towers are.

20:08:46.587 --> 20:08:52.126
It's not that.

20:08:57.264 --> 20:08:58.365
It's a real environment.

20:09:01.535 --> 20:09:04.605
It's almost impossible to track.

20:09:05.439 --> 20:09:07.908
We have to make
a more correlation.

20:09:08.309 --> 20:09:11.145
I'd like to say somebody
declared shoreline.

20:09:12.346 --> 20:09:13.080
It's certainly a good start,

20:09:18.919 --> 20:09:24.492
We're off to the side.

20:09:59.193 --> 20:09:59.760
Ready?

20:10:04.665 --> 20:10:05.065
Are we ready?

20:10:08.369 --> 20:10:11.772
We are in an abandoned skyscraper and quite
frankly I don't even know where I'm at.

20:10:11.839 --> 20:10:14.642
I see a sign outside that just gives
me a reference to Barclay Street.

20:10:14.942 --> 20:10:16.143
As you can see all around here,

20:10:16.410 --> 20:10:18.846
The windows have been
blown completely out.

20:10:19.313 --> 20:10:21.482
And as we take a
walk towards the front,

20:10:22.249 --> 20:10:23.517
towards the front
of the building here,

20:10:25.019 --> 20:10:26.387
you want to take a look outside.

20:10:27.454 --> 20:10:28.656
If you have never been to war,

20:10:29.790 --> 20:10:30.991
like I have never been to war,

20:10:31.992 --> 20:10:34.228
then this is what it looks like.

20:10:35.362 --> 20:10:36.697
We don't know
what that building is.

20:10:36.730 --> 20:10:38.265
We don't know
where this building is.

20:10:38.632 --> 20:10:39.900
But they're obviously on fire.

20:10:41.468 --> 20:10:44.505
Maybe there's a chance
that they could collapse.

20:10:48.175 --> 20:10:49.843
I've been on this
earth for 37 years.

20:10:50.411 --> 20:10:51.345
I've never been to a war.

20:10:52.513 --> 20:10:55.683
But I can only imagine that
this is as close as I've ever come.

20:11:10.297 --> 20:11:13.634
Now more on the latest
building collapse in New York.

20:11:13.667 --> 20:11:15.903
You might have heard a few
moments ago I was talking

20:11:15.936 --> 20:11:18.105
about the Salomon
Brothers building collapsing.

20:11:18.539 --> 20:11:19.406
And indeed it has.

20:11:19.440 --> 20:11:22.142
Apparently that's only a few
hundred yards away from where the

20:11:22.509 --> 20:11:24.411
World Trade Center towers were.

20:11:24.878 --> 20:11:27.648
And it seems that this was
not a result of a new attack.

20:11:27.948 --> 20:11:32.620
It was because the building had been
weakened during this morning's attacks.

20:11:32.620 --> 20:11:35.756
We'll probably find out more now
about that from our correspondent,

20:11:35.990 --> 20:11:36.657
Jane Stanley.

20:11:36.924 --> 20:11:37.157
Jane,

20:11:37.191 --> 20:11:40.694
what more can you tell us about the
Salomon Brothers building and its collapse?

20:11:42.663 --> 20:11:42.863
Well,

20:11:43.030 --> 20:11:44.665
only really what
you already know.

20:11:44.765 --> 20:11:45.599
Details are very,

20:11:45.666 --> 20:11:46.367
very sketchy.

20:11:46.467 --> 20:11:49.069
There's almost a
sense downtown in

20:11:49.470 --> 20:11:49.903
New York,

20:11:49.970 --> 20:11:50.704
behind me,

20:11:50.871 --> 20:11:52.239
down by the World Trade Center,

20:11:52.272 --> 20:11:57.911
of just an area completely closed off
as the rescue workers try to do their job.

20:11:58.112 --> 20:12:01.915
But this isn't the first building
that has suffered as a result.

20:12:02.082 --> 20:12:05.119
We know that part of the
Marriott Hotel next to the

20:12:05.152 --> 20:12:08.555
World Trade Center also
collapsed as a result of this.

20:12:08.989 --> 20:12:12.559
Huge amount of falling
debris from 110 floors of

20:12:12.559 --> 20:12:16.130
the two twin towers of
the World Trade Center.

20:12:16.530 --> 20:12:17.865
As you can see behind me,

20:12:18.232 --> 20:12:18.332
the

20:12:18.966 --> 20:12:21.168
Trade Center appears
to be still burning.

20:12:21.201 --> 20:12:24.705
We see these huge
clouds of smoke and ash.

20:12:24.738 --> 20:12:26.273
And we know that behind that,

20:12:26.306 --> 20:12:30.144
there's an empty piece
of what was a very familiar

20:12:30.411 --> 20:12:31.612
New York skyline,

20:12:31.712 --> 20:12:35.516
a symbol of the financial
prosperity of this city,

20:12:35.683 --> 20:12:37.851
but completely disappeared.

20:12:47.094 --> 20:12:53.000
The transmitter is

20:12:53.000 --> 20:12:53.434
is off,

20:12:53.467 --> 20:12:53.767
right?

20:13:00.974 --> 20:13:02.376
There's things up
there right there.

20:13:02.409 --> 20:13:04.912
What's he doing up there?

20:13:06.013 --> 20:13:07.548
What are you doing up there?

20:13:07.548 --> 20:13:09.216
I'm just fucking out there.

20:13:09.349 --> 20:13:12.219
I'm just going to
go and park there.

20:13:51.091 --> 20:13:52.426
whoa,

20:13:53.961 --> 20:13:58.599
and then moments later I saw
that first tower collapse on itself.

20:13:58.632 --> 20:13:59.566
Did you see anybody jumping?

20:13:59.733 --> 20:14:01.335
I didn't see that.

20:14:01.468 --> 20:14:02.102
What's your name, sir?

20:14:03.403 --> 20:14:04.171
Michael.

20:14:09.042 --> 20:14:09.910
I'm with the Connecticut Post.

20:14:11.211 --> 20:14:12.379
let me ask you a question.

20:14:12.613 --> 20:14:17.651
What does a fire safety
director do in a situation like this?

20:14:17.684 --> 20:14:18.018
Actually...

20:14:19.720 --> 20:14:22.356
I'm responsible for evacuating a
building that was a serious emergency.

20:14:22.356 --> 20:14:23.524
Did you evacuate the building?

20:14:23.557 --> 20:14:23.824
Yeah,

20:14:23.857 --> 20:14:24.291
we did.

20:14:25.159 --> 20:14:25.959
How many people was that?

20:14:27.060 --> 20:14:27.227
Well,

20:14:27.261 --> 20:14:29.229
it was like early in
the day we made the

20:14:29.229 --> 20:14:31.765
decision to evacuate
after the first tower fell.

20:14:33.000 --> 20:14:34.168
How long did it take
you to get people out?

20:14:35.068 --> 20:14:35.836
Actually,

20:14:35.903 --> 20:14:37.104
people started on their own,

20:14:37.137 --> 20:14:38.972
so they started to just
kind of leave naturally.

20:14:39.039 --> 20:14:42.509
But regarding the exact time,

20:14:42.509 --> 20:14:45.913
I don't really remember what time
we even decided to clear the building.

20:16:02.489 --> 20:16:03.490
Let's go to Emma's room.

20:16:10.264 --> 20:16:10.931
Come here.

20:16:11.732 --> 20:16:12.399
Get in the chair.

20:16:13.967 --> 20:16:15.068
Is it still out there?

20:16:15.102 --> 20:16:15.569
I'm right here.

20:17:01.315 --> 20:17:03.383
Joining me is Jack Kelly.

20:17:03.583 --> 20:17:03.717
Now,

20:17:03.750 --> 20:17:05.352
he is a foreign correspondent,

20:17:05.953 --> 20:17:07.154
war correspondent,

20:17:07.154 --> 20:17:08.689
and just came back from Israel.

20:17:08.889 --> 20:17:11.325
He has some information
about these attacks.

20:17:11.425 --> 20:17:11.692
Jack,

20:17:11.725 --> 20:17:13.961
what can you tell us
happened first in New York?

20:17:14.928 --> 20:17:15.462
Apparently,

20:17:15.529 --> 20:17:18.832
what appears to happen was that at
the same time two planes hit the building,

20:17:20.100 --> 20:17:22.736
that the FBI most likely
thinks that there was a car or

20:17:22.769 --> 20:17:25.405
truck packed with explosives
underneath the buildings,

20:17:25.505 --> 20:17:27.107
which also exploded
at the same time.

20:17:27.407 --> 20:17:28.408
and brought both of them down.

20:17:28.709 --> 20:17:28.809
Now,

20:17:28.842 --> 20:17:30.310
that's the first time
we're hearing that.

20:17:30.344 --> 20:17:34.381
So two planes and explosives
that were in the building,

20:17:34.414 --> 20:17:34.915
is that correct?

20:17:35.015 --> 20:17:36.917
That is the working
theory at this point.

20:17:36.950 --> 20:17:37.985
That is still unconfirmed,

20:17:38.051 --> 20:17:40.554
but that is what the FBI
is going on at this point.

20:17:40.754 --> 20:17:42.990
Let's go to 1010 Winds
reporter Eileen LaPalmer.

20:17:42.990 --> 20:17:43.290
Eileen?

20:17:43.557 --> 20:17:44.091
All right,

20:17:44.124 --> 20:17:44.391
Ralph,

20:17:44.391 --> 20:17:45.759
I'm here on Hudson Street.

20:17:45.859 --> 20:17:47.060
As you've been hearing,

20:17:47.060 --> 20:17:49.930
that Seven World Trade Center
just collapsed about five minutes ago.

20:17:50.464 --> 20:17:51.698
suddenly we saw officers,

20:17:52.165 --> 20:17:53.100
tons and tons of them,

20:17:53.166 --> 20:17:54.201
maybe 100 officers,

20:17:54.267 --> 20:17:54.935
police officers,

20:17:55.002 --> 20:17:55.602
running north,

20:17:55.669 --> 20:17:56.703
running along Hudson Street,

20:17:57.004 --> 20:17:57.871
telling people to move,

20:17:57.904 --> 20:17:58.505
get out of the way.

20:17:58.605 --> 20:17:59.106
Again,

20:17:59.139 --> 20:18:00.674
the smoke was billowing north,

20:18:01.008 --> 20:18:01.775
and people were running.

20:18:01.842 --> 20:18:03.210
I'm here with an
emergency worker.

20:18:03.210 --> 20:18:05.045
He's a first-year
NYU medical student.

20:18:05.312 --> 20:18:06.046
He was down there.

20:18:06.046 --> 20:18:07.114
He was trying to help people.

20:18:07.547 --> 20:18:08.181
His name is Daryl.

20:18:10.150 --> 20:18:10.417
Yeah,

20:18:10.917 --> 20:18:12.119
so I was just standing there,

20:18:12.953 --> 20:18:13.253
you know,

20:18:14.021 --> 20:18:16.356
we were watching the building
actually because it was on fire,

20:18:17.024 --> 20:18:20.193
the bottom floors of the
building were on fire and,

20:18:20.994 --> 20:18:21.228
you know,

20:18:21.294 --> 20:18:23.964
we heard this sound that
sounded like a clap of thunder.

20:18:24.164 --> 20:18:28.001
We turned around we were shocked
to see that the building was uh well it

20:18:32.239 --> 20:18:35.942
the windows all uh busted out
then you know it was horrifying and

20:18:35.976 --> 20:18:39.679
then uh you know about a second
later the bottom floor caved out

20:18:39.946 --> 20:18:43.050
out and the building
followed after that and we saw

20:18:43.083 --> 20:18:46.186
the building crash down
all the way to the ground.

20:18:47.320 --> 20:18:47.788
You know,

20:18:47.921 --> 20:18:50.357
we were in shock and
then the worst part about it,

20:18:50.390 --> 20:18:54.594
we saw the smoke and the
plumes of smoke coming after

20:18:54.628 --> 20:18:58.799
us and we had to run
north actually on that street.

20:18:58.832 --> 20:19:01.635
We just ran north to
escape from the smoke and

20:19:01.668 --> 20:19:04.938
luckily we weren't hurt
but it was certainly very,

20:19:05.105 --> 20:19:05.772
very scary.

20:19:07.941 --> 20:19:08.775
that was about it.

20:19:09.676 --> 20:19:09.876
Okay,

20:19:09.910 --> 20:19:11.011
and Daryl and his friends,

20:19:11.078 --> 20:19:12.245
they are NYU medical students,

20:19:12.245 --> 20:19:15.515
they are going to go back and help
with the emergency situation again.

20:19:15.615 --> 20:19:16.083
Eileen LaPalmer,

20:19:16.083 --> 20:19:16.983
1010 Winds,

20:19:17.050 --> 20:19:17.918
live on Hudson Street.

20:19:18.251 --> 20:19:18.885
Now Jack,

20:19:19.286 --> 20:19:22.389
as these battleships
are headed out,

20:19:22.923 --> 20:19:23.924
does this mean war?

20:19:24.925 --> 20:19:25.926
Lawrence Eagleburger,

20:19:25.992 --> 20:19:27.094
the former Secretary of State,

20:19:27.094 --> 20:19:31.064
just told us that this is a declaration
of war as far as he is concerned.

20:19:31.098 --> 20:19:33.533
He said this is the
biggest attack against the

20:19:34.067 --> 20:19:36.436
U.S. since Pearl Harbor
more than 60 years ago.

20:19:37.270 --> 20:19:40.373
Osama bin Laden appears to be
the number one suspect at this point,

20:19:40.440 --> 20:19:42.375
though nobody will go
on the record and say this.

20:19:42.509 --> 20:19:46.813
Only Osama bin Laden has the sophistication
to carry off a multiple coordinated attack.

20:19:47.214 --> 20:19:48.782
I've sat with his people
and they've said that

20:19:48.815 --> 20:19:50.417
this is something that
they would like to do.

20:19:51.184 --> 20:19:54.121
As recently as just a
month and a half ago or so,

20:19:54.254 --> 20:19:54.988
isn't that correct,

20:19:55.021 --> 20:19:57.457
when you sat with
Osama bin Laden's people?

20:19:58.258 --> 20:20:00.694
In Dubai and one of
them at that point said that

20:20:00.727 --> 20:20:03.163
they were considering
more attacks against the US.

20:20:03.330 --> 20:20:04.364
Also what's interesting,

20:20:04.498 --> 20:20:09.202
three weeks ago a US official warned
the Taliban through a third person

20:20:09.202 --> 20:20:14.407
that should there be any more attacks
that the US would respond militarily.

20:20:14.841 --> 20:20:16.476
At this point now
the Pentagon...

20:20:16.610 --> 20:20:19.746
And CIA and the FBI
have identified a possible

20:20:20.147 --> 20:20:21.414
100 targets within Afghanistan
to possibly strike back.

20:20:21.448 --> 20:20:22.916
100 targets within Afghanistan
that could possibly strike back.

20:20:23.383 --> 20:20:25.252
We are now preparing for war.

20:20:25.318 --> 20:20:26.453
Is that what I'm understanding?

20:20:26.786 --> 20:20:30.824
That nobody will actually
state that at this point,

20:20:31.024 --> 20:20:33.593
but there are always
situations ready and battle

20:20:33.627 --> 20:20:36.196
plans ready just in case
something were to happen.

20:20:36.229 --> 20:20:36.496
You know,

20:20:36.930 --> 20:20:38.565
this has been warned
for quite some time.

20:20:38.632 --> 20:20:40.567
It's just a matter of
when it would take place,

20:20:40.700 --> 20:20:42.102
and it took place today.

20:20:44.538 --> 20:20:47.107
There we can see what looks
like the Salomon Brothers building,

20:20:47.174 --> 20:20:48.408
which is the third building,

20:20:48.441 --> 20:20:50.477
which is just about to
collapse in these pictures.

20:20:50.477 --> 20:20:51.845
They came in just
a few moments ago.

20:20:52.512 --> 20:20:53.713
It's 47 stories high.

20:20:53.713 --> 20:20:57.584
The World Trade Center
towers were 110 stories high.

20:20:58.785 --> 20:21:01.988
And this building appears to
have been weakened by debris

20:21:02.022 --> 20:21:05.125
or perhaps parts of the
plane from the initial crash.

20:21:05.692 --> 20:21:08.762
You can see the
building go there.

20:21:13.800 --> 20:21:16.903
And you can also imagine
the difficulties faced by

20:21:16.937 --> 20:21:20.006
the emergency services
on the streets of Manhattan.

20:21:21.341 --> 20:21:21.741
All right,

20:21:22.008 --> 20:21:22.609
Jeff Rawson,

20:21:22.876 --> 20:21:23.677
Lower Manhattan,

20:21:24.077 --> 20:21:25.011
has an update for us.

20:21:25.145 --> 20:21:25.345
Jeff.

20:21:25.612 --> 20:21:25.946
And Roz,

20:21:25.979 --> 20:21:27.847
last time we spoke
there was a collapse,

20:21:27.914 --> 20:21:28.648
a building collapse.

20:21:28.648 --> 20:21:30.483
We understand now it
was World Trade Center,

20:21:30.550 --> 20:21:31.618
building number seven.

20:21:32.018 --> 20:21:34.788
We were being evacuated live on
television and we want to let you know,

20:21:34.854 --> 20:21:35.355
first of all,

20:21:35.422 --> 20:21:36.623
everyone in our crew is okay.

20:21:36.690 --> 20:21:38.325
everyone in the
area here is okay.

20:21:38.692 --> 20:21:39.859
You can look at our live truck.

20:21:39.893 --> 20:21:41.494
That's where we had
to abandon it just down

20:21:41.528 --> 20:21:43.430
the street as we broadcast
these live pictures.

20:21:43.730 --> 20:21:44.531
And beyond that,

20:21:44.564 --> 20:21:46.266
you can see the smoke billowing.

20:21:46.333 --> 20:21:49.502
Certainly there was smoke before
because that building was on fire.

20:21:49.536 --> 20:21:50.537
But since the collapse,

20:21:50.570 --> 20:21:53.306
we could literally
see the smoke,

20:21:53.440 --> 20:21:55.709
the dark cloud of smoke
and dust coming down the

20:21:55.709 --> 20:21:58.278
corridor of buildings down
Church Street toward us.

20:21:58.645 --> 20:22:00.013
At that very same moment,

20:22:00.080 --> 20:22:01.748
police started
evacuating everybody.

20:22:02.115 --> 20:22:03.683
And this is where
we all are right now,

20:22:04.651 --> 20:22:07.520
Evacuated back here to
Jwain Street at Church,

20:22:07.554 --> 20:22:10.490
And you can see all these people
were about a block up with us.

20:22:10.724 --> 20:22:11.891
But when that
building collapsed,

20:22:11.891 --> 20:22:12.959
you heard another tremble,

20:22:13.059 --> 20:22:15.262
kind of like this morning
when those two planes went

20:22:15.262 --> 20:22:17.497
into it and then the
subsequent building collapses.

20:22:17.797 --> 20:22:18.999
This sounded a lot like that.

20:22:18.999 --> 20:22:22.135
And then all of a sudden we looked
over and we saw the smoke coming at us.

20:22:22.502 --> 20:22:24.504
Right now we can tell
you that the paramedics,

20:22:24.504 --> 20:22:25.438
the fire officials,

20:22:25.538 --> 20:22:28.074
all emergency workers
trying to do a head count,

20:22:28.074 --> 20:22:32.512
trying to figure out if everyone inside
that building fighting that fire is okay.

20:22:32.545 --> 20:22:35.148
We will certainly bring that
information to you as we get it.

20:22:35.382 --> 20:22:36.216
Live in Lower Manhattan,

20:22:36.283 --> 20:22:37.183
Jeff Ross in ABC7

20:22:37.517 --> 20:22:38.485
Eyewitness News.

20:22:38.551 --> 20:22:38.818
Thank you,

20:22:38.852 --> 20:22:39.119
Jeff.

20:22:53.933 --> 20:22:56.803
Al Jones just saw building number
seven go down at the World Trade Center.

20:22:56.970 --> 20:22:57.437
It's collapsed Al.

20:22:57.737 --> 20:23:00.106
You know we've seen so much today with
the collapse of number one and number two.

20:23:00.106 --> 20:23:02.242
we've seen so much today with the
collapse of number one and number two.

20:23:02.509 --> 20:23:05.111
Folks standing here on the corner of
Leonard Street and West Broadway.

20:23:05.145 --> 20:23:08.882
We're just sitting here watching all the
smoke pouring up from number seven.

20:23:08.948 --> 20:23:11.251
Number 7 is the kind of
reddish-brown building

20:23:11.284 --> 20:23:13.553
that's towards the
north end of the complex.

20:23:13.687 --> 20:23:15.989
And although we really
couldn't see much damage on it,

20:23:16.022 --> 20:23:17.991
there was smoke pouring
out of it here for hours.

20:23:18.525 --> 20:23:20.794
And folks just kind of
standing around milling about it.

20:23:20.794 --> 20:23:22.395
And then I wasn't watching.

20:23:22.762 --> 20:23:23.930
I just could tell
from the reaction.

20:23:23.963 --> 20:23:26.533
reaction of the crowd what had happened
because I'd heard it already before.

20:23:26.833 --> 20:23:27.367
The gasp,

20:23:27.500 --> 20:23:28.134
the screams,

20:23:28.168 --> 20:23:30.737
people immediately turning
and starting to run even though

20:23:30.770 --> 20:23:33.273
we're probably a dozen
blocks from the center itself.

20:23:33.540 --> 20:23:36.776
People starting to run away
from the scene and I turned

20:23:36.810 --> 20:23:40.013
in time to see what looked
like a skyscraper implosion.

20:23:40.113 --> 20:23:41.781
Looked like it had been
done by a demolition crew.

20:23:41.815 --> 20:23:44.184
The whole thing just
collapsing down on itself

20:23:44.184 --> 20:23:46.553
and another big huge
plume of gray and white

20:23:46.553 --> 20:23:51.224
smoke shooting up into the air and then more
of the smoke billowing up the street here.

20:23:51.324 --> 20:23:52.826
So that's number one,

20:23:52.859 --> 20:23:53.226
number two,

20:23:53.226 --> 20:23:53.727
and now number six.

20:23:53.827 --> 20:23:57.063
seven that have come down
from this explosion and uh folks just

20:23:57.097 --> 20:24:00.333
simply can't believe it well i
didn't realize because the other

20:24:00.367 --> 20:24:03.570
towers are so big but the number
seven is 47 story that was a

20:24:03.703 --> 20:24:04.904
That was a huge
building in its own right.

20:24:05.171 --> 20:24:06.773
huge building in its own right
right it was always it was the

20:24:06.773 --> 20:24:10.076
one that kind of uh was dwarfed
by the other two it was kind of

20:24:10.110 --> 20:24:13.413
a reddish brown and it uh more
or less ran east and west it was

20:24:13.446 --> 20:24:16.583
a long thin building but uh uh
it had been damaged and it had

20:24:16.783 --> 20:24:20.220
been on fire for hours uh and
the smoke just seemed to intensify,

20:24:20.387 --> 20:24:23.690
But we really couldn't see a
lot of damage from this angle.

20:24:23.757 --> 20:24:25.692
from the north side
of the structures.

20:24:26.493 --> 20:24:29.396
That's why everybody was so surprised
when all of a sudden it just fell.

20:24:30.563 --> 20:24:30.663
Now,

20:24:30.697 --> 20:24:31.097
the other thing,

20:24:31.131 --> 20:24:31.297
too,

20:24:31.364 --> 20:24:32.932
we presume it has been
burning for some time.

20:24:32.932 --> 20:24:33.566
As you indicated,

20:24:33.600 --> 20:24:34.734
there was nobody inside,

20:24:34.734 --> 20:24:36.836
and we hope no danger to
anybody when it went down.

20:24:37.337 --> 20:24:37.470
Well,

20:24:38.071 --> 20:24:38.605
that's the thing,

20:24:38.605 --> 20:24:40.874
is that when number
two went down,

20:24:40.874 --> 20:24:41.074
you know,

20:24:41.508 --> 20:24:42.041
I don't think,

20:24:42.442 --> 20:24:44.177
and I know I'll put
myself in that group,

20:24:44.210 --> 20:24:45.745
I never thought these
things would fall down.

20:24:45.912 --> 20:24:46.146
I mean,

20:24:46.379 --> 20:24:47.180
we were watching them.

20:24:47.647 --> 20:24:48.581
You could see them burning.

20:24:48.615 --> 20:24:49.749
A lot of it was damaged.

20:24:49.749 --> 20:24:50.950
There was fire
coming out of the top,

20:24:51.017 --> 20:24:53.253
but I just never for the life
of me thought that these...

20:24:53.453 --> 20:24:56.423
huge buildings that have been
here so long would actually just fall.

20:24:56.990 --> 20:24:58.124
And that's what happened.

20:24:58.925 --> 20:24:59.559
They just crumbled.

20:24:59.726 --> 20:25:00.059
Well, you know,

20:25:00.160 --> 20:25:00.660
as reporters,

20:25:00.693 --> 20:25:01.795
you kind of run to the scene,

20:25:01.795 --> 20:25:03.730
and that's what happened with
some of the firefighters and police,

20:25:03.730 --> 20:25:03.863
too.

20:25:03.863 --> 20:25:04.697
They ran to the scene,

20:25:04.798 --> 20:25:04.931
and,

20:25:04.964 --> 20:25:05.398
of course,

20:25:05.532 --> 20:25:06.599
with devastating results.

20:25:06.666 --> 20:25:07.834
And the thing is,

20:25:07.867 --> 20:25:11.204
with all the triage that's been set up
around that area and all the people

20:25:11.237 --> 20:25:14.841
that were being treated and all the
emergency personnel that are close to it,

20:25:15.308 --> 20:25:17.177
you only hope that they
were far enough back so that

20:25:17.210 --> 20:25:19.379
when this came down that
they were all out of harm's way.

20:25:19.646 --> 20:25:20.680
Because as you suggested,

20:25:20.680 --> 20:25:21.881
we never thought
they would go down.

20:25:22.081 --> 20:25:22.215
No,

20:25:22.348 --> 20:25:22.949
it's...

20:25:23.116 --> 20:25:25.385
The gasp from the crowd
here was all you needed

20:25:25.418 --> 20:25:27.687
to know that this just
shocked everybody again.

20:25:28.354 --> 20:25:31.057
That is 1010 Windsor reporter Al
Jones with the news and giving us

20:25:31.090 --> 20:25:33.793
that description of World Trade
Center building number 7 going down,

20:25:33.827 --> 20:25:35.128
a 47-story building.

20:25:35.562 --> 20:25:36.696
That too is gone.

20:25:39.432 --> 20:25:43.903
We've just got some pictures in from New
York of the latest building to collapse.

20:25:43.937 --> 20:25:45.905
That's the Salomon
Brothers building.

20:25:48.741 --> 20:25:51.110
That's 47 stories tall.

20:25:51.144 --> 20:25:52.078
There you can see it going.

20:25:56.549 --> 20:25:57.283
So this happened,

20:25:57.383 --> 20:25:57.484
oh,

20:25:57.584 --> 20:26:02.789
some six hours or so after the
collapse of the World Trade Center.

20:26:03.122 --> 20:26:03.656
Presumably,

20:26:03.957 --> 20:26:06.993
it was so close to the World
Trade Center that it had been

20:26:07.026 --> 20:26:10.497
weakened by the explosions
and the collapse of those buildings.

20:26:11.331 --> 20:26:14.000
We were talking to our correspondent
in New York a few moments ago,

20:26:14.100 --> 20:26:17.303
trying to find out what sort of
casualties might be involved.

20:26:17.637 --> 20:26:19.038
In the collapse
of this building,

20:26:19.072 --> 20:26:22.275
but it's just in the
realm of guesswork.

20:26:22.976 --> 20:26:23.710
Most people,

20:26:23.743 --> 20:26:24.677
it's assumed,

20:26:25.278 --> 20:26:27.380
had been evacuated
from the building and

20:26:27.380 --> 20:26:30.049
perhaps there'd only
be a skeleton staff there.

20:26:30.550 --> 20:26:31.217
Presumably,

20:26:31.317 --> 20:26:36.489
they would recognize the risk of it collapsing
in the wake of the World Trade Center.

20:26:36.489 --> 20:26:42.562
The possibility that the
fire was going to get worse,

20:26:43.029 --> 20:26:44.597
all of a sudden a loud,

20:26:44.731 --> 20:26:46.533
incredibly loud explosion.

20:26:47.300 --> 20:26:48.935
And we have the
video to show you.

20:26:49.736 --> 20:26:51.938
Now what happened was
the police started screaming,

20:26:51.971 --> 20:26:52.906
everyone started screaming.

20:26:52.906 --> 20:26:54.007
It was a very foul odor.

20:26:54.040 --> 20:26:57.410
We were covered in smoke
and everyone started running.

20:26:57.477 --> 20:26:58.545
I started running as well.

20:26:58.845 --> 20:26:59.479
My photographer,

20:26:59.479 --> 20:27:00.213
Bache Warner,

20:27:00.480 --> 20:27:01.981
did not run.

20:27:02.048 --> 20:27:04.450
And he was there
filming all of the clouds,

20:27:04.751 --> 20:27:07.353
filming the billowing smoke.

20:27:07.487 --> 20:27:12.692
And it was just incredibly frightening to
see hundreds of policemen running away.

20:27:13.026 --> 20:27:17.530
From the scene and just
anyone that was in the area.

20:27:18.498 --> 20:27:18.698
Now,

20:27:19.132 --> 20:27:21.367
we did speak to many
firefighters and policemen.

20:27:44.958 --> 20:27:47.327
That building I was
referring to that was on fire,

20:27:47.360 --> 20:27:49.062
I didn't know at
the time what it was.

20:27:49.929 --> 20:27:51.864
I learned later and
also learned just how

20:27:51.898 --> 20:27:54.267
lucky myself and my
photographer Terrence were.

20:27:55.201 --> 20:27:56.569
That was 7 World Trade Center.

20:27:56.803 --> 20:27:58.338
30 minutes after
I got out of there,

20:27:58.905 --> 20:27:59.639
it collapsed.

20:28:00.440 --> 20:28:01.174
30-some stories.

20:28:01.708 --> 20:28:03.910
I have one other note
that I just want to put by.

20:28:05.845 --> 20:28:09.015
This is probably the darkest day
in the history of New York City,

20:28:09.015 --> 20:28:10.783
if not the history of
the United States.

20:28:11.985 --> 20:28:13.453
But if you're looking
for some inspiration,

20:28:14.087 --> 20:28:14.854
just 10 minutes ago,

20:28:15.288 --> 20:28:19.292
I wasn't too far from where the tower
number one and tower number two went down,

20:28:19.292 --> 20:28:21.227
and I saw a car completely
covered with soot.

20:28:22.161 --> 20:28:23.062
And on that car,

20:28:23.796 --> 20:28:24.564
somebody wrote,

20:28:25.298 --> 20:28:26.833
this won't stop.

20:28:27.634 --> 20:28:28.067
New York.

20:28:28.768 --> 20:28:29.969
So if you're looking
for inspiration,

20:28:30.370 --> 20:28:30.870
hang your hat on that.

20:28:30.903 --> 20:28:31.571
What have you heard,

20:28:31.604 --> 20:28:32.138
if anything,

20:28:32.171 --> 20:28:33.673
about biological entities?

20:28:33.873 --> 20:28:37.176
There had been that issue
raised earlier that perhaps anthrax

20:28:37.176 --> 20:28:40.313
and the like might have
been part of this attack today.

20:28:40.680 --> 20:28:41.247
What have you heard?

20:28:42.315 --> 20:28:42.515
Well,

20:28:42.615 --> 20:28:44.684
certainly there's a lot of
concern of that around here.

20:28:44.717 --> 20:28:48.454
I haven't heard anything
concrete where there is definite,

20:28:49.689 --> 20:28:50.657
I won't even say speculation,

20:28:50.690 --> 20:28:51.624
definite feeling,

20:28:51.791 --> 20:28:52.392
if you will,

20:28:52.959 --> 20:28:57.096
that they believe that some sort of
biological terrorism has been used.

20:28:57.697 --> 20:29:00.433
There's all kinds of speculation
as to what has happened here.

20:29:00.767 --> 20:29:02.902
Was the plane loaded
with explosives?

20:29:03.236 --> 20:29:05.805
Was the plane enough
in and of itself to crash

20:29:05.838 --> 20:29:08.408
into a building to bring
those two towers down?

20:29:08.441 --> 20:29:09.442
Because you'll see the video,

20:29:09.542 --> 20:29:10.977
and you've seen
it a hundred times.

20:29:11.477 --> 20:29:14.480
It looked like it was a
controlled implosion.

20:29:14.580 --> 20:29:15.682
It didn't fall over.

20:29:16.049 --> 20:29:19.318
It looked as if somebody put
TNT all throughout that building.

20:29:19.352 --> 20:29:21.354
It pancaked from
floor to floor to floor.

20:29:21.854 --> 20:29:25.525
So of course there's speculation
here that maybe these planes were

20:29:25.558 --> 20:29:29.262
loaded with C4 explosives or
some type of explosives on timers.

20:29:29.796 --> 20:29:31.998
That if the plane itself
didn't bring it down,

20:29:32.298 --> 20:29:36.969
that charges would go off and that
eventually what happened would happen.

20:29:37.003 --> 20:29:40.707
But as far as
biological attacks go...

20:29:41.140 --> 20:29:41.441
Yes,

20:29:41.607 --> 20:29:42.608
it is a concern.

20:29:43.109 --> 20:29:44.243
How great of a concern?

20:29:44.377 --> 20:29:45.445
I don't think at this point.

20:29:48.014 --> 20:29:51.751
And word late tonight that two
suspects are in FBI custody after a

20:29:51.751 --> 20:29:56.189
truckload of explosives was discovered
around the George Washington Bridge.

20:29:56.222 --> 20:29:57.724
That bridge links

20:29:58.091 --> 20:30:01.461
new york to new jersey over the
hudson river whether the discovery of

20:30:01.461 --> 20:30:04.831
those explosives has anything to
do with other events today is unclear

20:30:05.164 --> 20:30:07.166
But the FBI has two
suspects in hand,

20:30:07.200 --> 20:30:09.535
said the truckload
of explosives,

20:30:09.869 --> 20:30:11.704
enough explosives
were in the truck to do

20:30:11.738 --> 20:30:13.906
great damage to the
George Washington Bridge.

20:30:14.307 --> 20:30:17.243
But they arrested the two suspects
and they're questioning them as we speak.

20:30:17.710 --> 20:30:21.214
I gather has just heard of
an incident in New Jersey.

20:30:22.181 --> 20:30:25.351
The New York City Police
Department has a report that the

20:30:25.785 --> 20:30:28.821
FBI is responding to New
Jersey because a truck

20:30:28.855 --> 20:30:31.691
reportedly loaded with
explosives has been

20:30:31.724 --> 20:30:34.660
stopped by authorities
on the road there and

20:30:34.660 --> 20:30:37.630
the men with that truck
have been detained.

20:30:38.331 --> 20:30:40.133
Members of the Joint
Terrorist Task Force,

20:30:40.166 --> 20:30:41.834
according to the New
York police officials,

20:30:41.868 --> 20:30:44.003
are responding to
question those people.

20:30:44.303 --> 20:30:45.638
I asked him what happened.

20:30:46.672 --> 20:30:50.877
what was amazing about his
story was that he was in the lobby

20:30:50.910 --> 20:30:55.548
of World Trade Center one when
the plane the first plane hit and

20:30:56.182 --> 20:30:58.484
When the debris
started coming down

20:30:58.918 --> 20:31:04.090
He went back to go into the building to
protect himself and was in the revolving doors

20:31:04.657 --> 20:31:09.562
Going back in off West Street when he
looked up and a fireball came flying out

20:31:10.062 --> 20:31:13.099
I guess from the elevator shafts
here That's what he seemed to

20:31:13.132 --> 20:31:16.169
believe and blew out all the
windows and threw him back onto

20:31:16.469 --> 20:31:17.103
the street.

20:31:17.103 --> 20:31:18.037
There was an explosion.

20:31:18.504 --> 20:31:19.906
We were on the support floor,

20:31:20.039 --> 20:31:20.807
which is a basement.

20:31:21.307 --> 20:31:22.508
A guy came in running.

20:31:22.809 --> 20:31:24.110
All his skin was
out of his body.

20:31:26.879 --> 20:31:27.547
We took him out.

20:31:28.181 --> 20:31:28.748
We ran out.

20:31:29.382 --> 20:31:30.850
We heard a lot of rumbling.

20:31:31.117 --> 20:31:31.851
I went back in.

20:31:32.685 --> 20:31:35.087
There was a lot of smoke.

20:31:35.121 --> 20:31:35.288
Well,

20:31:35.354 --> 20:31:35.721
thank you.

20:31:35.788 --> 20:31:35.988
And again,

20:31:36.022 --> 20:31:38.224
our apologies to our viewers
about five minutes ago,

20:31:38.324 --> 20:31:41.727
but we do have an established
connection now with CNN's Deborah Farrig.

20:31:41.761 --> 20:31:42.862
The reports we're getting now,

20:31:43.229 --> 20:31:45.398
two or three men arrested
on the New Jersey Parkway.

20:31:45.431 --> 20:31:45.665
Deborah,

20:31:45.665 --> 20:31:46.098
can you hear me?

20:31:46.132 --> 20:31:48.434
me now yet that kind of uh...

20:31:48.568 --> 20:31:52.471
that is the information that i'm getting
from two sources that there was a van either

20:31:52.538 --> 20:31:56.375
on the new jersey turnpike or the garden
state parkway and that it was near the

20:31:56.409 --> 20:32:00.913
george washington bridge there were two
or three men who were in the band that that

20:32:00.947 --> 20:32:05.618
was pulled over it is not clear why the
band was pulled over but when it was uh...

20:32:05.885 --> 20:32:08.487
law enforcers
that found that uh...

20:32:08.754 --> 20:32:12.692
and kind of explosive inside
of the band that is right now

20:32:12.725 --> 20:32:16.562
all i'm hearing a hundred
again two to three people uh...

20:32:16.662 --> 20:32:17.263
two to three people in custody,

20:32:17.296 --> 20:32:20.166
custody and we are trying to get
more information on that right now.

20:32:20.433 --> 20:32:20.800
Deborah,

20:32:20.800 --> 20:32:22.168
I don't mean to put
you on the spot here,

20:32:22.201 --> 20:32:24.203
Do you know where on the
Jersey Turnpike this was?

20:32:24.270 --> 20:32:25.671
how far from New York City?

20:32:27.173 --> 20:32:28.407
We do not know that.

20:32:28.407 --> 20:32:29.408
We are looking into that.

20:32:29.442 --> 20:32:32.311
There is one report that it was
on the New Jersey Turnpike.

20:32:32.378 --> 20:32:36.048
There is another report that
it was very close to the bridge,

20:32:36.115 --> 20:32:37.350
if not on the bridge.

20:32:37.617 --> 20:32:38.150
So again,

20:32:41.053 --> 20:32:45.124
keep together at the depot got though
part two to three and people i think

20:32:45.157 --> 20:32:46.459
two to three people
in custody running.

20:32:46.959 --> 20:32:49.729
found with a bad filled
with explosive well as

20:32:49.762 --> 20:32:52.531
the debris here is spread
over a three to four mile

20:32:52.565 --> 20:32:55.201
radius which has now been
completely sealed off and

20:32:55.234 --> 20:32:58.137
is being treated according
to the FBI as a crime scene

20:32:58.137 --> 20:33:03.042
a crime scene governor tom ridge made
some remarks earlier at a press conference

20:33:03.809 --> 20:33:05.278
He had flown over the site.

20:33:05.344 --> 20:33:07.713
He said the emergency
response here was immediate.

20:33:08.481 --> 20:33:09.348
He also said,

20:33:09.382 --> 20:33:12.418
and I don't know whether or not
you all are able to see pictures of this,

20:33:12.551 --> 20:33:18.190
but this is one of those cases where the
pictures really do tell the story that sort of

20:33:18.224 --> 20:33:21.227
the most horrifying
aspect of this particular

20:33:21.260 --> 20:33:24.263
crash scene is how
little debris is visible.

20:33:24.430 --> 20:33:27.166
There is a large
crater in the ground,

20:33:27.667 --> 20:33:31.404
and I'm hoping that you all are
seeing it as I'm talking about it.

20:33:32.305 --> 20:33:35.808
That's really all you see is a large
crater in the ground and just tiny,

20:33:36.008 --> 20:33:37.109
tiny bits of debris.

20:33:37.143 --> 20:33:41.180
There's been at least one report
that the investigators out there,

20:33:41.213 --> 20:33:42.181
and there are hundreds of them,

20:33:42.214 --> 20:33:42.949
as I said tonight,

20:33:43.616 --> 20:33:46.285
have found nothing
larger than a phone book.

20:33:47.153 --> 20:33:50.957
They were having coffee in the World
Trade Center when the first plane struck.

20:33:51.357 --> 20:33:52.758
And all of a sudden
it sounded like,

20:33:52.792 --> 20:33:54.093
I don't know where
the subway is,

20:33:54.260 --> 20:33:55.962
but it sounded like
a subway collision,

20:33:55.962 --> 20:33:57.763
a bomb,

20:33:57.797 --> 20:33:58.664
And it was just pounding,

20:33:58.831 --> 20:33:59.532
boom.

20:33:59.532 --> 20:34:02.001
And I literally
thought the subway.

20:34:03.936 --> 20:34:07.573
The subway had exploded and
all the cars put the line on top of it.

20:34:07.573 --> 20:34:07.940
It was so loud.

20:34:07.940 --> 20:34:12.611
I was reviewing some work and it was
about 10 to 9 and the building shook.

20:34:13.512 --> 20:34:15.081
And I felt it was an
earthquake and it didn't

20:34:15.114 --> 20:34:16.949
bother me because I felt
it was a big earthquake.

20:34:16.949 --> 20:34:21.053
the building could sustain
earthquake they were built for that

20:34:21.087 --> 20:34:25.157
and then there was a huge
explosion in the ceiling cell he went

20:34:30.730 --> 20:34:32.365
through the front door of the ground
floor and the lady who was about

20:34:32.465 --> 20:34:33.366
three seconds in front of him
was hit by a terrific fireball and

20:34:33.566 --> 20:34:37.203
she was injured, so
we went to assistance,

20:34:37.269 --> 20:34:39.171
I think he got some touch over.

20:34:39.672 --> 20:34:40.906
And as he was doing that,

20:34:40.940 --> 20:34:42.942
another explosion happened.

20:34:43.876 --> 20:34:46.912
I was entering the
building on the lobby level,

20:34:47.079 --> 20:34:47.646
I was in the room.

20:34:47.680 --> 20:34:50.149
...revolving door when
the plane hit the building.

20:34:50.416 --> 20:34:53.185
David Dre worked in number
one World Trade Center.

20:34:54.053 --> 20:34:54.920
One of the elevators,

20:34:54.987 --> 20:34:55.254
I think,

20:34:55.287 --> 20:34:59.558
came crashing to the lobby level
and all the debris came flying out of it.

20:35:02.561 --> 20:35:06.065
And a fireball emerged from the
elevator lobby and was coming toward me.

20:35:06.332 --> 20:35:10.202
We then were talking about the day's
work and what needed to be done when we

20:35:10.336 --> 20:35:16.075
heard a massive explosion that was in
the World Trade Center at about 8.46 a.m.

20:35:16.175 --> 20:35:16.675
in the morning.

20:35:17.143 --> 20:35:18.310
The explosion came from,

20:35:18.677 --> 20:35:21.447
I believe at first we believed that
it came from the mechanical room.

20:35:21.981 --> 20:35:25.151
And then we heard a
series of other explosions

20:35:25.184 --> 20:35:28.220
that sounded up on
the above levels of the

20:35:28.254 --> 20:35:31.690
building to where we
then realized that there was

20:35:31.690 --> 20:35:35.061
something wrong and
there was a major problem.

20:35:37.596 --> 20:35:40.399
Rescue workers pushed
people away from the scene.

20:35:50.109 --> 20:35:51.377
So everyone moved back,

20:35:52.044 --> 20:35:57.183
leaving debris and silence.

20:35:57.349 --> 20:36:00.453
We want to take our
viewers live to Shanksville,

20:36:00.486 --> 20:36:01.020
Pennsylvania.

20:36:01.053 --> 20:36:02.354
Our Brian Cabell is standing by.

20:36:02.421 --> 20:36:02.788
This, of course,

20:36:02.855 --> 20:36:05.324
is the site where
United Airlines Flight 93

20:36:05.357 --> 20:36:08.327
crashed on its way from
Newark to San Francisco,

20:36:08.394 --> 20:36:09.328
crashed on Tuesday.

20:36:09.328 --> 20:36:11.897
And I understand in this investigation
there's some breaking news.

20:36:11.997 --> 20:36:12.298
Brian,

20:36:12.331 --> 20:36:12.998
what can you tell us?

20:36:14.200 --> 20:36:14.333
Well,

20:36:14.366 --> 20:36:14.633
Darren,

20:36:14.633 --> 20:36:15.868
in the last hour or so,

20:36:15.901 --> 20:36:20.072
the FBI and the state police here have
confirmed that they have cordoned off a second

20:36:20.106 --> 20:36:24.243
area about six to eight miles away from
the crater here where this plane went down.

20:36:24.710 --> 20:36:27.279
This is apparently
another debris site,

20:36:27.580 --> 20:36:29.048
which raises a
number of questions.

20:36:29.115 --> 20:36:30.483
Why would debris from the plane,

20:36:30.483 --> 20:36:32.685
and they identified it specifically
as being from this plane,

20:36:33.085 --> 20:36:35.020
why would debris be
located six miles away?

20:36:35.054 --> 20:36:36.288
Could it have
blown that far away?

20:36:36.622 --> 20:36:37.623
Seems highly unlikely.

20:36:37.656 --> 20:36:40.960
Almost all the debris found
at this site is within 100 yards,

20:36:41.026 --> 20:36:41.861
200 yards away.

20:36:42.061 --> 20:36:43.295
So it raises some questions.

20:36:43.395 --> 20:36:44.530
We don't want to over-speculate,

20:36:44.530 --> 20:36:44.897
of course,

20:36:45.231 --> 20:36:47.166
but there were some
cell phone callers,

20:36:47.299 --> 20:36:48.734
one cell phone
caller in particular,

20:36:49.034 --> 20:36:51.370
who said he saw a bomb
or something that looked

20:36:51.370 --> 20:36:53.672
like a bomb with one
of the hijackers also.

20:36:54.006 --> 20:36:57.009
The man who took over the
plane apparently announced

20:36:57.042 --> 20:37:00.045
that at one point there was
a bomb on board the plane.

20:37:00.079 --> 20:37:00.179
So,

20:37:00.246 --> 20:37:00.479
again,

20:37:00.579 --> 20:37:01.413
we don't want to speculate.

20:37:01.413 --> 20:37:02.815
We don't want to
jump to conclusions.

20:37:03.249 --> 20:37:05.317
But what we do know is
that there is a site about

20:37:05.351 --> 20:37:07.386
a half mile behind me
where the plane went down,

20:37:07.486 --> 20:37:08.521
where most of the debris is,

20:37:08.787 --> 20:37:10.890
and then about six
miles away up by a lake.

20:37:11.223 --> 20:37:12.992
There is another area
that's been cordoned off,

20:37:13.325 --> 20:37:15.661
and state police and the
FBI have said definitely

20:37:15.694 --> 20:37:17.963
there is debris from
the plane located there.

20:37:17.963 --> 20:37:19.198
We have a crew on
the way right now.

20:37:19.231 --> 20:37:21.433
We should have pictures
of that a little bit later on.

20:37:21.433 --> 20:37:21.901
In the meantime,

20:37:21.934 --> 20:37:22.868
the search here goes on.

20:37:22.968 --> 20:37:26.605
80 searchers going foot by foot
combing the area looking for evidence.

20:37:26.772 --> 20:37:28.641
They have not yet
found the black box.

20:37:28.908 --> 20:37:29.308
Darren?

20:37:30.142 --> 20:37:31.177
Which was my first question,

20:37:31.177 --> 20:37:32.645
so I'll move on to my next one,

20:37:32.711 --> 20:37:33.078
Brian.

20:37:33.179 --> 20:37:35.881
We don't want to speculate
about this large debris field,

20:37:36.182 --> 20:37:38.551
but it seems to me from
covering a number of

20:37:38.584 --> 20:37:41.353
plane crashes on the
scene that if nothing else,

20:37:41.387 --> 20:37:43.489
you can say this is
not typical for a plane

20:37:43.489 --> 20:37:45.591
crash to be spread
across an area this large.

20:37:46.058 --> 20:37:49.361
It certainly doesn't make
sense because most of the debris

20:37:49.395 --> 20:37:52.665
has been found in a very
compact area within 100 yards,

20:37:52.731 --> 20:37:53.332
200 yards,

20:37:53.365 --> 20:37:54.600
maybe a little beyond that.

20:37:54.934 --> 20:37:56.202
And then all of a
sudden they're telling us,

20:37:56.468 --> 20:37:57.803
6 miles away,

20:37:57.970 --> 20:37:59.905
they have another
concentration of debris.

20:38:00.039 --> 20:38:01.240
They say it's very small pieces.

20:38:01.273 --> 20:38:02.474
Most of these are
very small pieces.

20:38:02.675 --> 20:38:05.511
Most of the pieces here are no bigger
than the size of a briefcase they say.

20:38:05.844 --> 20:38:08.480
And the pieces six miles away
may be even smaller than that.

20:38:08.681 --> 20:38:10.416
They have talked to a
number of individuals here.

20:38:10.482 --> 20:38:13.786
They say they have talked to people who
saw this plane during the final moments.

20:38:13.819 --> 20:38:15.154
They haven't confirmed
whether they saw,

20:38:15.621 --> 20:38:18.757
they talked to anybody who saw
this plane actually land or crash,

20:38:18.791 --> 20:38:19.058
rather.

20:38:19.458 --> 20:38:21.560
And as to whether it
broke up on the way,

20:38:21.660 --> 20:38:24.296
we don't know that FBI is
being very tight-lipped about that.

20:38:24.363 --> 20:38:24.697
But again,

20:38:24.697 --> 20:38:26.232
it leads to that possibility.

20:38:26.398 --> 20:38:27.933
It certainly leads to a
number of questions.

20:38:28.500 --> 20:38:30.469
You mentioned they have
yet to find the black box.

20:38:30.603 --> 20:38:31.403
It would seem to me,

20:38:31.537 --> 20:38:34.473
when you compare the four
plane crashes of Tuesday,

20:38:34.506 --> 20:38:37.409
this would be the site where they
would be most likely to find a black box.

20:38:38.210 --> 20:38:39.478
That's what they
told us initially,

20:38:39.645 --> 20:38:41.847
and I think they're somewhat
disappointed they haven't found it.

20:38:41.880 --> 20:38:42.948
It's been 48 hours,

20:38:43.182 --> 20:38:45.117
but they are still
hopeful they will find it.

20:38:45.284 --> 20:38:47.586
There is a pond nearby
this particular site.

20:38:47.686 --> 20:38:49.688
They may have to send
divers into the pond.

20:38:49.722 --> 20:38:50.589
They haven't done that yet,

20:38:50.823 --> 20:38:52.291
but conceivably it
could be in the pond.

20:38:52.291 --> 20:38:53.058
It could be anywhere.

20:38:53.192 --> 20:38:55.127
It could be at this
other debris site.

20:38:55.127 --> 20:38:58.497
They've also found some other
debris scattered around this area.

20:38:58.497 --> 20:38:58.764
They say,

20:38:58.764 --> 20:38:59.064
in fact,

20:38:59.098 --> 20:39:00.699
some individuals
have been collecting it.

20:39:00.933 --> 20:39:01.166
Again,

20:39:01.166 --> 20:39:02.001
we're talking about very,

20:39:02.101 --> 20:39:02.935
very tiny parts.

20:39:02.935 --> 20:39:05.471
The biggest part they
found at this site is an engine.

20:39:05.838 --> 20:39:06.472
an engine part,

20:39:06.538 --> 20:39:09.575
and most of the other pieces are probably
no bigger than this particular notebook.

20:39:09.875 --> 20:39:10.342
So again,

20:39:10.476 --> 20:39:11.477
very small pieces.

20:39:11.910 --> 20:39:13.579
They had hoped to find
the black box by now.

20:39:13.679 --> 20:39:15.748
They're still voicing
optimism they will find it.

20:39:16.482 --> 20:39:18.217
It's not an assignment I
would wish on anybody,

20:39:18.250 --> 20:39:20.052
but I would say that you
would have to have an

20:39:20.085 --> 20:39:21.887
assignment like that
to appreciate what that

20:39:21.920 --> 20:39:23.856
looks like when a plane
comes crashing into the

20:39:23.889 --> 20:39:25.858
ground and basically
just drops out of the sky.

20:39:25.924 --> 20:39:26.992
Brian Cabell in Shanksville,

20:39:27.059 --> 20:39:27.559
Pennsylvania,

20:39:27.626 --> 20:39:28.260
thank you very much.

20:39:28.627 --> 20:39:30.095
Also a note from yesterday when we
were listening into an FBI news conference,

20:39:30.129 --> 20:39:31.530
a note from yesterday when we were
listening into an FBI news conference,

20:39:31.530 --> 20:39:32.031
they were saying...

20:39:32.531 --> 20:39:35.901
They expect this search just at this
site to take about three to five weeks.

20:39:36.235 --> 20:39:40.072
So they are going to be very deliberate and
look for every possible piece of evidence.

20:39:40.105 --> 20:39:40.372
Brian,

20:39:40.406 --> 20:39:40.939
thank you very much.

20:39:40.973 --> 20:39:42.574
In the B4 level,

20:39:42.775 --> 20:39:44.510
I was assigned to the B3 level,

20:39:45.344 --> 20:39:49.748
but I had to do something
in the B4 sheet metal shop.

20:39:50.549 --> 20:39:52.151
So I went in the
sheet metal shop,

20:39:52.184 --> 20:39:53.085
do what I had to do,

20:39:53.652 --> 20:39:54.420
And on my way,

20:39:54.586 --> 20:39:55.621
I heard a

20:39:55.788 --> 20:39:59.558
a bomb such as probably a
transformer again blew up.

20:40:00.492 --> 20:40:00.626
So

20:40:01.293 --> 20:40:01.960
I stepped back,

20:40:02.127 --> 20:40:06.532
finished what i had to finish
and i started towards the door

20:40:06.565 --> 20:40:10.836
again and there come a
big blast with a big ball of fire

20:40:10.869 --> 20:40:15.207
and that's when i got hit it
hit me right back down on the

20:40:15.240 --> 20:40:19.611
ground and i realized that
my uncle was shattered pfeiffer

20:40:19.611 --> 20:40:21.480
Piper was the first
chief into the building.

20:40:23.515 --> 20:40:28.520
right away a guy from the port authority
told him the damage is somewhere above the

20:40:28.554 --> 20:40:29.355
a guy from the Port Authority told him the
damage is somewhere above the 78th floor.

20:40:29.355 --> 20:40:29.388
78th floor

20:40:31.190 --> 20:40:32.825
But all you had to
do was look around.

20:40:33.559 --> 20:40:34.326
It was obvious.

20:40:35.227 --> 20:40:37.563
Something had happened
right there in the lobby.

20:40:41.166 --> 20:40:45.037
You just saw that all the
windows were blown out.

20:40:48.574 --> 20:40:51.543
We have a report now
that a large plane crashed

20:40:51.577 --> 20:40:54.947
