Somerset County Airport,

20:40:54.947 --> 20:40:56.548
which is in western
Pennsylvania,

20:40:56.882 --> 20:40:58.617
not too terribly
far from Pittsburgh,

20:40:58.650 --> 20:40:59.718
about 80 miles or so.

20:41:01.019 --> 20:41:04.523
I don't think there are enough
words in the English language

20:41:05.624 --> 20:41:08.026
