20:41:13.165 --> 20:41:16.001
And I said to myself,

20:41:16.268 --> 20:41:17.102
oh my god,

20:41:17.102 --> 20:41:18.137
I think it's a generator.

20:41:18.470 --> 20:41:21.673
And I was going to recognize it
when I finished saying that in my mind,

20:41:21.807 --> 20:41:23.342
