20:41:23.409 --> 20:41:24.610
Right on top,

20:41:25.444 --> 20:41:26.278
pretty far away.

20:41:27.045 --> 20:41:31.016
So it was a difference between coming
from the basement and coming from the top.

20:41:31.917 --> 20:41:32.251
And that's...

20:41:33.018 --> 20:41:34.153
everybody started screaming.

20:41:34.653 --> 20:41:36.522
